  <para style="h">2 Ngoma</para>
  <para style="toc1">Igitabu ca kabiri c’ivyo ku Ngoma</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Ngoma</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Ng</para>
  <para style="mt2">Igitabu ca kabiri c’ivyo ku</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ngoma</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CH 1" />
  <para style="s1">Salomo asaba ubwenge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 1:1" />Salomo mwene Dawidi aba agakomeye mu bwami bwiwe, kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yiwe yari kumwe na we kandi amugira uwuhambaye cane.<verse eid="2CH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 1:2" />Maze Salomo avugana n’Abisirayeli bose, abatwara ingabo ibihumbi n’abatwara ingabo amajana, abacamanza, abarongozi, b’Abisirayeli bose n’abakuru b’amazu ya ba sekuruza. <verse eid="2CH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 1:3" />Maze Salomo n’abantu bose baja kw’itaba ry’umusozi i Gibeyoni, kuko Ihema ry’Ibonaniro ry’Imana ari ho ryari rishinzwe, iryo Mose umusavyi w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yarakoze bakiri mu bugaragwa. <verse eid="2CH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 1:4" />Ico gihe Dawidi yari yaramaze kuzana Isandugu y’Imana ayikura i Kiriyati-Yeyarimu ayijana mu kibanza yari yayiteguriye, kuko yari yarayishingiye ihema i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 1:5" />Ariko ca gicaniro gikozwe mu butare bw’umwakaka ico Bezaleli mwene Uri, Uri mwene Huri, yari yarakoze cari kikiri i Gibeyoni imbere y’Ihema ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Aho ni ho Salomo n’ikoraniro ryose bambariza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="2CH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 1:6" />Salomo araduga aja kuri ca gicaniro c’ubutare bw’umwakaka cari imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> mw’Ihema ry’Ibonaniro aca agitangirako ibimazi igihumbi vyo guturirwa n’umuriro.<verse eid="2CH 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 1:7" />Muri iryo joro Imana yiyereka Salomo iramubwira iti: “Nsaba ico ushaka cose ndakiguha.”<verse eid="2CH 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 1:8" />Salomo yishura Imana ati: “Wagiriye neza cane data Dawidi maze ungira umwami mu kibanza ciwe. <verse eid="2CH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 1:9" />None rero, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mana, nushitse isezerano wasezeraniye data Dawidi, kuko wanyimitse ngo mbe umwami w’ihanga ry’abantu benshi bangana nk’umukungugu wo kw’isi. <verse eid="2CH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 1:10" />Numpe ubwenge n’ubumenyi, kugira ngo nshobore kurongora ubu bwoko. Mbega none ni nde yoshobora kuganza ubu bwoko bwawe bwinshi bungana gutya?”<verse eid="2CH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 1:11" />Imana ibwira Salomo iti: “Ko ico ari co umutima wawe wipfuza ukaba utansavye ubutunzi, ibintu canke icubahiro, canke ngo unsabe ko abansi bawe bapfa; kandi ko utansavye kuramba ariko ukansaba ubwenge n’ubumenyi kugira ngo ushobore kuganza neza abantu banje, abo naguhaye ngo ubabere umwami; <verse eid="2CH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 1:12" />nuko ubwenge n’ubumenyi ndabiguhaye. Kandi nzoguha ubutunzi n’ibintu vyinshi, icubahiro no kuba rurangiranwa, ku buryo ata mwami n’umwe mu bakwitangiye imbere bose yigeze kuronka nk’ivyo, canke ngo habe n’umwe azobironka mu bazoza inyuma yawe.”<verse eid="2CH 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 1:13" />Nuko Salomo aja i Yerusalemu avuye imbere y’ihema ry’ibonaniro ryari kw’itaba ry’umusozi Gibeyoni. Maze akomeza ivy’ubwami bwiwe mu Bisirayeli.<verse eid="2CH 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 1:14" />Maze Salomo yegeranya imikogote y’intambara n’amafarasi menshi. Yari afise imikogote igihumbi n’amajana ane, n’amafarasi ibihumbi cumi na bibiri. Bimwe abibika mu bisagara vy’imikogote, ibindi abigumiza hafi yiwe i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 1:15" />Umwami agwiza ifeza n’inzahabu i Yerusalemu bisigara bimeze nk’amabuye, imbaho z’agaciro z’amasederi na zo ziragwira zimera nk’ibiti vy’imisukomora vyo mu biyaya vy’i Buyuda. <verse eid="2CH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 1:16" />Amafarasi ya Salomo yari yayakuye muri Egiputa n’i Kilikiya; abadandaza b’umwami bari bayaguriye muri Kilikiya ku giciro gisanzwe. <verse eid="2CH 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 1:17" />Umukogote umwe bawugura muri Egiputa shekeli amajana atandatu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilo 6,9.</char></note> z’ifeza, ifarasi imwe na yo bakayigura shekeli ijana na mirongo itanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ikilo 1,7.</char></note>. Kandi abo badandaza ni bo banabigurisha no ku bami bose b’Abaheti n’ab’Abarameya.<verse eid="2CH 1:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Salomo yitegurira kwubakira Uhoraho Ingoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 2:1" />Salomo yigira ingingo yo kwubaka Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> n’ikirimba ciwe, <verse eid="2CH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 2:2" />ashiraho abagabo ibihumbi mirongo indwi bo kwikorera ibikoresho n’abandi ibihumbi mirongo umunani bo kubaza amabuye bayakura mu misozi, n’abashika ibihumbi bitatu n’amajana atandatu bo kubakoresha.<verse eid="2CH 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 2:3" />Salomo arungika intumwa kuri Hiramu umwami w’i Tiro ati:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2CH 2:3">“Ndungikira ibiti vy’amasederi nk’uko wabigiriye data Dawidi aho wamurungikira amasederi yo kwubaka ikirimba ciwe. <verse eid="2CH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 2:4" />Ubu ngira nubake Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanje. Kizoba ari ikibanza catoranirijwe gutuririramwo ibimota neza imbere yayo, aho gushira imikate ihezagiye ubudasiba, no gushikaniramwo ibimazi biturijwe umuriro ku murango, ku mugoroba, ku masabato, mu mboneko z’ukwezi hamwe rero no ku misi mikuru yashinzwe n’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu. Kandi ivyo ni icagezwe cahawe Abisirayeli ibihe vyose.<verse eid="2CH 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 2:5" />Iyo Ngoro ngira nubake izoba iteye igomwe, kuko Imana yacu ari iyihambaye kurusha ibindi vyitwa imana vyose. <verse eid="2CH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 2:6" />Ariko, mbega ni nde yoshobora kuyubakira inzu ibamwo? Ko amajuru, mbere n’amajuru asumba ayandi, idashobora kuyakwirwamwo! None jewe ndi iki ngo ndayubakire Ingoro, kiretse gusa kwubaka ahantu ho kuyituririra ibimazi!<verse eid="2CH 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 2:7" />Nuko, ndungikira umuntu w’umuhinga azi gukora ivy’inzahabu n’ivy’ifeza, ivy’ubutare bw’umwakaka n’ivy’ivyuma; ivy’amarangi y’agahama, n’ay’ubururu ari ku bitambara. Yoba kandi azi ubuhinga bwo gutunganya amashusho ayarumika aho akwiye, agashobora gukorana n’abahinga b’i Buyuda n’i Yerusalemu, abo Data Dawidi yateguye.<verse eid="2CH 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 2:8" />Undungikire kandi ibiti vy’amasederi n’ivy’amapinusi n’ivy’amasantali vy’i Libani, kuko ndazi ko abantu bawe ari abahinga mu vyo kubaza imbaho zo hiyo. Abantu banje bazokorana n’abawe <verse eid="2CH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 2:9" />ngo bantegurire imbaho nyinshi, kuko Ingoro nzokwubaka ibwirizwa kuba yagutse kandi ishajije. <verse eid="2CH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 2:10" />Abakozi bawe, abantu bo kubaza imbaho, nzobaha ingero koru ibihumbi mirongo ibiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amatoni 3.600.</char></note> z’ingano, ingero koru ibihumbi mirongo ibiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amatoni 3.000.</char></note> za sayiri, ingero batu ibihumbi mirongo ibiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amalitiro 440.000.</char></note> z’umuvinyu, n’ingero batu ibihumbi mirongo ibiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amalitiro 440.000.</char></note> z’amavuta ya elayo.”<verse eid="2CH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 2:11" />Hiramu umwami w’i Tiro yishura Salomo mw’ikete yamwandikiye ati:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2CH 2:11">“<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> arakunda abantu biwe, ni co catumye akugira umwami wabo.”<verse eid="2CH 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 2:12" />Kandi Hiramu arongera ati:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2CH 2:12">“<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ahimbazwe, Imana y’Abisirayeli, yaremye ijuru n’isi! Yahaye umwami Dawidi umuhungu w’ubwenge, yuzuye n’ubumenyi bwo kumenya ibibereye, akaba ari we azokwubaka Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> n’ikirimba ciwe c’ubwami.<verse eid="2CH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 2:13" />Ndakurungikiye Huramu Abi, umuntu w’umuhinga cane, <verse eid="2CH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 2:14" />nyina wiwe akomoka mu muryango wa Dani, se na we ava i Tiro. Yigishijwe gukora ibintu bitandukanye mu nzahabu, mw’ifeza, mu miringa n’ivyuma, mu mabuye n’ibiti, ivy’amabara atukura n’ay’ubururu, n’ayavanze y’ubururu n’agahama, n’ayera derere. Ni umuhinga amenyereye ivyo kubaza amashusho kandi ashobora gukora ivyo womusaba vyose. Azokorana n’abahinga bawe n’aba databuja, so wawe Dawidi.<verse eid="2CH 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 2:15" />None rero nyakwubahwa urungikire abasavyi bawe za ngano na sayiri na ya mavuta ya elayo na wa muvinyu nk’uko wasezeranye, <verse eid="2CH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 2:16" />natwe tuzoca ibiti vyose mukeneye vy’i Libani tubizane ku kiyaga gushika i Yopa. Namwe muzoheza mubitoreho mubidugane i Yerusalemu.”<verse eid="2CH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 2:17" />Salomo aharura abantu bose b’inyambukira bari muri Isirayeli, inyuma y’iharura ryari ryakozwe na se Dawidi; basanga ni ibihumbi ijana na mirongo itanu na bitatu n’amajana atandatu. <verse eid="2CH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 2:18" />Atoranya ibihumbi mirongo indwi bo muri bo abashinga kuba abikorezi abandi ibihumbi mirongo umunani abashinga kuba abo kubaza amabuye mu misozi, abandi ibihumbi bitatu n’amajana atandatu abashinga kuba abakoresha abandi baraba ko abantu bariko barakora.<verse eid="2CH 2:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CH 3" />
  <para style="s1">Salomo yubaka Ingoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 3:1" />Maze Salomo atangura kwubakira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Ingoro i Yerusalemu ku musozi Moriya, hamwe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yariyerekeye se Dawidi. Hari ku mbuga yo kugosorerako ingano ya Orunani Umuyebusi, ikibanza cari categuwe na Dawidi. <verse eid="2CH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 3:2" />Atangura kwubaka ku musi ugira kabiri w’ukwezi kwa kabiri mu mwaka ugira kane ari ku ngoma.<verse eid="2CH 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 3:3" />Umushinge Salomo yubatse wo kwubakako iyo Ngoro y’Imana wari ufise ingero z’igice c’ukuboko mirongo itandatu z’uburebure n’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko mirongo ibiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 27 z’uburebure n’imetero 9 z’ubwaguke.</char></note> z’ubwaguke. <verse eid="2CH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 3:4" />Ibaraza ry’amaja imbere y’iyo Ngoro ryari rifise uburebure bungana n’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko mirongo ibiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 9.</char></note> hamwe n’igihagararo kingana n’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko mirongo ibiri nyene.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 3:4">Imbere mu Ngoro ahomeka inzahabu ihinguwe neza. <verse eid="2CH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 3:5" />Icumba gikuru acubakisha imbaho z’amasederi, azomekako inzahabu zihinguwe neza, hanyuma ashushanyako ibigazi n’imigufu. <verse eid="2CH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 3:6" />Ashariza impome z’Ingoro n’amabuye y’igiciro kinini. Inzahabu yakoresheje zavuye i Paruvayimu. <verse eid="2CH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 3:7" />Imyamba ifashe igisenge, ibishimaryango, impome hamwe n’imiryango y’Ingoro avyomekako inzahabu, hanyuma impome azishushanyako abakerubi.<verse eid="2CH 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 3:8" />Yubaka Ahera Cane, uburebure bwaho bwangana n’ubwaguke bw’Ingoro; ni ukuvuga ingero z’igice c’ukuboko mirongo ibiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 9.</char></note> hamwe rero n’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko mirongo ibiri z’ubwaguke. Imbere ahomeka inzahabu ihinguwe neza ipima italanto amajana atandatu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amatoni 23.</char></note>. <verse eid="2CH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 3:9" />Imisumari y’inzahabu yapima shekeli mirongo itanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amagarama 575.</char></note>. Ivyumba vyo hejuru na vyo nyene avyomekako inzahabu.<verse eid="2CH 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 3:10" />Abaza ibishushanyo bibiri vy’abakerubi vyo gushira Ahera Cane, avyomekako inzahabu. <verse eid="2CH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 3:11" />Ubwaguke bw’amababa y’abo bakerubi uko ari babiri bwangana n’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko mirongo ibiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 9.</char></note>. Ibaba rimwe ry’umukerubi wa mbere ryari rifise uburebure bungana n’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko zitanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 2,3.</char></note> kandi ryakora ku ruhome rw’Ingoro, mu gihe irindi baba, na ryo nyene rifise ingero z’igice c’ukuboko zitanu, ryafatana n’ibaba ry’uwundi mukerubi. <verse eid="2CH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 3:12" />Ibaba ry’umukerubi wa kabiri ryapima ingero z’igice c’ukuboko zitanu rigakora ku kindi gihome c’urusengero, irindi baba na ryo nyene ryapima ingero z’igice c’ukuboko zitanu z’uburebure, rigakora kw’ibaba ry’umukerubi wa mbere. <verse eid="2CH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 3:13" />Amababa y’abo bakerubi yari afise ingero z’igice c’ukuboko mirongo ibiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 9.</char></note>. Bari bahagaze, batumbereye Ahera Cane.<verse eid="2CH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 3:14" />Ashona igihuzu mu nyuzi z’amabara y’ubururu avanze n’ayatukura hamwe n’ayera derere, gishushanijweko abakerubi.<verse eid="2CH 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 3:15" />Imbere y’Ingoro yubaka inkingi zibiri, zose hamwe zareha n’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko mirongo itatu na zitanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 16.</char></note> z’uburebure bw’igihagararo, imwe yose ku mutwe yari ifise umwashi upima ingero z’igice c’ukuboko zitanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 2,3.</char></note>. <verse eid="2CH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 3:16" />Akora imigufu isobekeranye ayishira ku mitwe y’izo nkingi, aca acura ibisa n’ivyamwa vyitwa amakomamanga ijana abimanika kuri iyo migufu. <verse eid="2CH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 3:17" />Ahagarika za nkingi imbere y’Ingoro, imwe ayishira amaja mu bumanuko iyindi amaja mu buraruko. Iyo mu bumanuko ayita Yakini, iyo mu buraruko ayita Bowazi.<verse eid="2CH 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CH 4" />
  <para style="s1">Ibikoresho vyo mu Ngoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 4:1" />Salomo acurisha mu butare bwitwa umwakaka igicaniro kingana n’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko mirongo ibiri z’uburebure, ingero z’igice c’ukuboko mirongo ibiri z’ubwaguke hamwe n’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko cumi z’igihagararo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni ukuvuga hafi imetero 9 z’uburebure n’ubwaguke, n’imetero 4,5 z’igihagararo.</char></note>. <verse eid="2CH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 4:2" />Yongera akoresha ibesani nini ayita ikiyaga, bayikora ari umuzingi mu butare bw’umwakaka. Ubwaguke bwayo ku rubiga, uva ku ruhande rumwe uja ku rundi uciye hagati bwangana n’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko cumi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 4,5.</char></note>, kandi yari ifise igihagararo kingana n’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko zitanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 2,3.</char></note>. Uburebure bw’uwo muzingi na wo uwuzungurutse bwari ingero z’igice c’ukuboko mirongo itatu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 14.</char></note>. <verse eid="2CH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 4:3" />Musi y’urubiga, hari ibibumbano bisa n’impfizi z’inka bikikuje hose, vyari cumicumi ku hantu hangana n’ingero y’igice c’ukuboko imwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’isantimetero 45.</char></note>. Ivyo bibumbano vy’impfizi vyari bitonze ku mirongo ibiri bifatanye n’ico kiyaga gikozwe mu butare bw’umwakaka.<verse eid="2CH 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 4:4" />Iyo besani yari ihagaze ku bibumbano vy’impfizi cumi na zibiri zicuzwe mu butare bw’umwakaka, zitatu zikaraba mu buraruko, zitatu mu burengero, izindi zitatu mu bumanuko hamwe n’izindi zitatu zaraba mu buseruko. Iyo besani bita ikiyaga, yari iteretse hejuru kuri ivyo bibumbano vy’izo mpfizi, maze ibice vy’inyuma vyazo bikaraba hagati musi y’ico kiyaga. <verse eid="2CH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 4:5" />Cari gifise intimbatimba ingana n’ikiganza c’umuntu,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’isantimetero 7,5.</char></note> kandi urubiga rwaco rwari rumeze nk’urw’igikombe, nk’ishurwe ry’ikirungu risambuye. Cashobora kwuzuzwa n’ingero batu ibihumbi bitatu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amalitiro 66.000.</char></note><verse eid="2CH 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 4:6" />Salomo aca akoresha amabesani matomato cumi yo kwogerezamwo ibikoresho bakoresha mu gutanga ibimazi bitongozwa umuriro: atanu ayashira ku ruhande rw’ubumanuko, ayandi atanu ayashira ku ruhande rwo mu buraruko. Ariko ya besani yitwa ikiyaga, yari iyo abaherezi bakarabiramwo.<verse eid="2CH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 4:7" />Salomo akoresha ibiterekwako amatara cumi nk’uko amategeko yavyo yari ari, abishira mu Ngoro, bitanu mu ruhande rw’ubumanuko, bindi bitanu mu ruhande rw’uburaruko.<verse eid="2CH 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 4:8" />Salomo akoresha imeza icumi azishira mu Ngoro, zitanu zija mu ruhande rwo mu bumanuko izindi zitanu zija mu ruhande rwo mu buraruko. Yongera akoresha mu nzahabu utubakure two kumijagira ijana.<verse eid="2CH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 4:9" />Yubakisha n’ibaraza ry’abaherezi, hamwe n’ikindi kibanza c’ibaraza kinini. Aca akoresha n’inzugi z’imiryango ija muri ayo mabaraza, azomekako ubutare bw’umwakaka. <verse eid="2CH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 4:10" />Ashira ya besani yitwa ikiyaga ku ruhande rw’ubumanuko, mu gice c’iyo Ngoro giherereye mu buseruko.<verse eid="2CH 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 4:11" />Huramu yarakoze kandi inkono, ivyaruzo, hamwe n’utubakure two kumijagira.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 4:11">Maze Huramu aheraheza ico gikorwa c’umwami Salomo yari yatanguye mu Ngoro y’Imana:<verse eid="2CH 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 4:12" />za nkingi zibiri;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 4:12">ya myashi ibiri imeze nk’ibikombe yo ku mutwe w’izo nkingi;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 4:12">ya migufu ibiri isobekeranye yo gushariza iyo myashi ibumbwe bwa bikombe biri ku mitwe y’izo nkingi;<verse eid="2CH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 4:13" />vya bicurano bisa n’amakomamanga amajana ane yo kuri ya migufu ibiri; imirongo ibiri y’ibisa n’amakomamanga ku mugufu umwumwe usharije ya myashi iri ku mitwe ya za nkingi;<verse eid="2CH 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 4:14" />Ivyo guterekako ya mabesani hamwe n’ayo mabesani nyene;<verse eid="2CH 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 4:15" />ca kiyaga na vya bibumbano vy’amashuri cumi n’abiri cari giteretseko;<verse eid="2CH 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 4:16" />za nkono, vya vyaruzo, amakanya yo guterura inyama n’ibindi bikoresho bijanye na vyo.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2CH 4:16" />
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 4:16">Ibikoresho vyose Huramu Abi yakoreye umwami Salomo ku bw’iyo Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> vyari mu butare bw’umwakaka uhinguwe neza. <verse eid="2CH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 4:17" />Umwami ategeka ko bifyaturirwa mu maforoma y’ibumba mu kiyaya ca Yorodani hagati ya Sukoti na Zereda. <verse eid="2CH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 4:18" />Ivyo bintu vyose Salomo yakoze vyari vyinshi cane ku buryo igipimo c’ubutare bw’umwakaka bwakoreshejwe kitashobora kumenyekana.<verse eid="2CH 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 4:19" />Salomo yongera akora ibikoresho vyose vyari mu Ngoro y’Imana:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2CH 4:19" />
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 4:19">igicaniro c’inzahabu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 4:19">imeza yo gushirako ya mikate ihezagiye,<verse eid="2CH 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 4:20" />vya biterekwako amatara vy’inzahabu ihinguwe neza n’amatara yavyo, yo kubonesha imbere y’Ahera Cane nk’uko vyategetswe;<verse eid="2CH 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 4:21" />ya mashurwe acuzwe mu nzahabu, amatara, n’ivyo kuyora umunyota vyose vyari bikozwe mu nzahabu ihinguye neza;<verse eid="2CH 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 4:22" />imbugita, utubakure, ibikombe n’udusahani tw’umunyota bicuzwe mu nzahabu ihinguye neza; n’inzugi z’Ingoro zikozwe mu nzahabu: inzugi zinjira Ahera n’iz’Ahera Cane.<verse eid="2CH 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CH 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 5:1" />Igikorwa cose Salomo yakoreye Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> giheze, aca yinjiza ibintu vyose se Dawidi yari yaragize inyegu y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>: ifeza, inzahabu n’ibindi bikoresho abishira mu bubiko bw’iyo Ngoro y’Imana.<verse eid="2CH 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bazana Isandugu y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> mu Ngoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 5:2" />Nuko umwami Salomo aca atumako abakuru b’Abisirayeli, abatware b’imiryango bose n’abaserukira amazu y’Abisirayeli, bakoranira i Yerusalemu kugira ngo bazane Isandugu y’Isezerano y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, bayikure aho yari iri i Siyoni mu Gisagara ca Dawidi, bayijane mu kibanza gishasha kiri muri iyo Ngoro. <verse eid="2CH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 5:3" />Abisirayeli bose bakoranira imbere y’umwami ku musi mukuru w’insago, hari mu kwezi kw’indwi.<verse eid="2CH 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 5:4" />Abakuru bose b’Abisirayeli bamaze gushika, Abalewi baterura ya sandugu, <verse eid="2CH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 5:5" />badugana Isandugu y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> n’Ihema ry’Ibonaniro, badugana n’ibikoresho vyose vyakoreshwa muri ryo. Abaherezi ari bo Balewi ni bo babiduganye. <verse eid="2CH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 5:6" />Umwami Salomo n’ikoraniro ryose ry’Abisirayeli bari bakoraniye hamwe bari imbere y’iyo sandugu, batanga ibimazi vyinshi vy’intama n’inka bitashoboye kwandikwa canke ngo biharurwe.<verse eid="2CH 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 5:7" />Abo baherezi baca bajana iyo Sandugu y’Isezerano y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aho yateguriwe mu gice c’imbere mu Ngoro, ari ho hitwa Ahera Cane, baca bayishira musi y’amababa ya ba bakerubi. <verse eid="2CH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 5:8" />Abo bakerubi bari bashanje amababa hejuru y’aho iyo Sandugu yari iri, agapfuka Isandugu hamwe n’imyamba bayireruza. <verse eid="2CH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 5:9" />Iyo myamba yari miremire ku buryo umuntu ari Ahera Cane yashobora kubona aho igarukira. Ariko umuntu atarashika Ahera, ntivyashoboka ko ayibona; kandi n’uwu musi ni ho ikiri. <verse eid="2CH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 5:10" />Nta kindi kintu cari muri iyo sandugu kiretse vya bisate Mose yashiramwo ari i Horebu, aho <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yagiraniye isezerano n’Abisirayeli bamaze kuva muri Egiputa.<verse eid="2CH 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 5:11" />Abaherezi baca barasohoka bava Ahera. Abaherezi bari ngaho bose bari bihumanuye, hadakurikijwe imice yabo. <verse eid="2CH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 5:12" />Abalewi bose bari abaririmvyi, Asafu, Hemani, Yedutuni n’abahungu babo n’ab’iwabo bose, barahaguruka bahagarara mu buseruko bw’igicaniro, bambaye impuzu zera derere bavuza ivyuma bisama, inanga n’amakembe. Bari baherekejwe n’abaherezi ijana na mirongo ibiri bavuza inzamba. <verse eid="2CH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 5:13" />Abavuza inzamba n’abaririmvyi baririmba mw’ijwi rimwe, nk’umuntu umwe, mu guhimbaza bashimira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Baherekejwe n’inzamba, ivyuma bisama n’ibindi bicurarangisho, bashira amajwi hejuru bahimbaza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> baririmba bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 5:13">“Ni mwiza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CH 5:13">urukundo rwiwe rwamaho ibihe bidashira.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 5:13">Maze Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yuzura igicu c’ubwiza, <verse eid="2CH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 5:14" />abaherezi ntibaba bagishobora gukora igikorwa cabo kubera ico gicu, kuko ubwiza bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bwari bwuzuye Ingoro y’Imana.<verse eid="2CH 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CH 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 6:1" />Maze Salomo avuga ati: “Ewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, wavuze ko uba mu gicu c’umwijima w’umuzitanya. <verse eid="2CH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 6:2" />Ariko jewe nakwubakiye Ingoro y’igitangaza, ikibanza uzokwiberamwo ibihe vyose.”<verse eid="2CH 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 6:3" />Ikoraniro ryose ry’Abisirayeli rigihagaze ngaho, umwami arahindukira arabahezagira. <verse eid="2CH 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 6:4" />Maze avuga ati:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2CH 6:4">“<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana y’Abisirayeli ahimbazwe, we ashikije n’amaboko yiwe ivyo yari yarasezeraniye data Dawidi n’akanwa kiwe, aho yavuga ati: <verse eid="2CH 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 6:5" />‘Uhereye umusi nakuriye ubwoko bwanje mu gihugu ca Egiputa, sinigeze ntoranya igisagara na kimwe co mu miryango ya Isirayeli ngo cubakwemwo Ingoro yitirirwa izina ryanje, canke ngo ntoranye umuntu n’umwe ngo abe uwo kurongora ubwoko bwanje bw’Abisirayeli. <verse eid="2CH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 6:6" />Ariko ubu ntoranije Yerusalemu ngo izina ryanje rihabe, kandi ntoranije Dawidi kugira ngo abe ari we aganza abantu banje b’Abisirayeli.’<verse eid="2CH 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 6:7" />Data Dawidi yari afise umugambi mu mutima wo kwubakira Ingoro izina ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana ya Isirayeli; <verse eid="2CH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 6:8" />ariko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> amubwira ati: ‘Wagize neza kwiyumvira kwubakira Ingoro izina ryanje, <verse eid="2CH 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 6:9" />ariko si wewe uzoyubaka. Umuhungu wawe, uwo wivyariye, ni we azokwubakira Ingoro izina ryanje.’<verse eid="2CH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 6:10" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yazigamye isezerano ryiwe. Yansubije mu gishingo ca data Dawidi; none ubu nicaye ku ntebe y’ubwami bwa Isirayeli, nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabisezeranye, kandi nanje nubatse Ingoro yo guhesha icubahiro izina ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana ya Isirayeli. <verse eid="2CH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 6:11" />Aho ni ho nashize ya sandugu irimwo rya sezerano <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yagiranye n’ubwoko bw’Abisirayeli.”<verse eid="2CH 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Salomo asenga isengesho ryo gushikiriza iyo Ngoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 6:12" />Maze Salomo ahagarara imbere y’igicaniro c’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> n’imbere y’ikoraniro ryose ry’Abisirayeli agorora amaboko yiwe. <verse eid="2CH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 6:13" />Salomo yari yarubatse hagati na hagati muri rwa rugo, ahantu hataramutse ho guhagarara mu butare bw’umwakaka, hangana n’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko zitanu z’uburebure n’ubwaguke, hakagira n’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko zitatu z’igihagararo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 2,3 z’uburebure n’ubwaguke, n’imetero 1,4 z’igihagararo.</char></note>. Ahagararaho, araheza apfukama imbere y’ikoraniro ryose ry’Abisirayeli agorora amaboko ayerekeje mw’ijuru. <verse eid="2CH 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 6:14" />Nuko aravuga ati:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2CH 6:14">“Ewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mana ya Isirayeli, nta yindi Mana ihwanye nawe mw’ijuru no mw’isi, wewe uzigama isezerano wagiriye abasavyi bawe, bagukurikira n’imitima yabo yose. <verse eid="2CH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 6:15" />Wazigamye isezerano wagiriye data Dawidi umusavyi wawe, urisezeranishije akanwa kawe, none uwu musi urishikishije amaboko yawe.<verse eid="2CH 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 6:16" />None rero <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Mana ya Isirayeli, zigamira umusavyi wawe Dawidi ari we data, isezerano wamugiriye, aho wavuga uti: ‘Mu ruvyaro rwawe, ntihazokwigera habura uwuba ku ngoma ya Isirayeli, nirwagendera mu Vyagezwe vyanje nk’uko wabigendeyemwo.’ <verse eid="2CH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 6:17" />None rero <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Mana ya Isirayeli, shitsa isezerano wasezeraniye data Dawidi umusavyi wawe.<verse eid="2CH 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 6:18" />Ariko none vy’ukuri Imana izoba hano kw’isi ibane n’abantu? Ko amajuru, mbere n’amajuru asumba ayandi, udashobora kuyakwirwamwo, mbe ndareka iyi Ngoro nubatse! <verse eid="2CH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 6:19" />Ariko wumvirize ugusenga n’ukwinginga kwanje, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mana yanje. Wumve ugutakamba n’ugusenga kw’umusavyi wawe ari imbere yawe. <verse eid="2CH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 6:20" />Inyonga zawe zize zame ziri kuri iyi Ngoro ku murango no mw’ijoro, aha hantu wavuze ko uzoshira izina ryawe. Uzokwame wumva amasengesho umusavyi wawe azosengera hano hantu. <verse eid="2CH 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 6:21" />Uze wumvirize ukwinginga kw’umusavyi wawe n’ukw’abantu bawe b’Abisirayeli nibasenga batumbereye iyi ngoro. Uze ubumvirize uri mw’ijuru, aho uba; kandi niwabumva, ubaharire.<verse eid="2CH 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 6:22" />Umuntu niyagirira nabi mugenziwe maze bigasabwa ko bamurahiza ko atabikoze, akaza akarahirira imbere y’igicaniro cawe kiri muri iyi Ngoro, <verse eid="2CH 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 6:23" />uze uvyumve uri mw’ijuru ucire urubanza abantu bawe. Uwakoze ikibi atsindwe, ivyo yakoze bimusubire ku mutwe kandi hatsinde uwutacumuye, umwerekane kandi bimenyekane ko ata kimwagira.<verse eid="2CH 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 6:24" />Abantu bawe b’Abisirayeli nibatsindwa n’abansi babo kuko bagucumuyeko maze bagahindukira bagahimbaza izina ryawe, bagasenga binginga imbere yawe bari muri iyi Ngoro, <verse eid="2CH 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 6:25" />uzobumve uri mw’ijuru uharire icaha c’abantu bawe b’Abisirayeli ubagarukane mu gihugu wabahaye bo na ba sekuruza.<verse eid="2CH 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 6:26" />Ijuru niryugarwa imvura ntigwe kuko abantu bawe bagucumuyeko, maze bagasenga batumbereye aha hantu bagahimbaza izina ryawe, bagahindukira bakava mu caha cabo, umaze kubateza ivyago, <verse eid="2CH 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 6:27" />uze ubumve uri mw’ijuru, uharire icaha c’abasavyi bawe, ari bo bwoko bwawe bw’Abisirayeli. Uze ubigishe inzira zawe, maze urekurire imvura mu gihugu wahaye abantu bawe kw’umugabane.<verse eid="2CH 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 6:28" />Ikigoyi canke ikiza nivyatera mu gihugu, canke akaranda canke ururyi, inzige canke ibihori, canke abansi babo bakabugariza mu gisagara kimwe mu vyo babamwo, ikiza ico ari co cose canke ingwara iyo ari yo yose nivyabashikako, <verse eid="2CH 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 6:29" />maze hakagira na bamwe bo mu Bisirayeli basenga ku bw’imibabaro yo mu mitima yabo, bakarabisha ibiganza vyabo kuri iyi Ngoro, <verse eid="2CH 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 6:30" />nawe uze wumve uri mw’ijuru, aho wibera. Uze ubaharire, kandi ugirire umuntu wese ibihwanye n’ivyo yakoze, kuko uzi imitima yabo: ni wewe wenyene uzi imitima y’abana b’abantu. <verse eid="2CH 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 6:31" />Ni ho bazogutinya bakagendera mu nzira zawe ibihe vyose bazoba mu gihugu wahaye ba sogokuruza.<verse eid="2CH 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 6:32" />Mbere n’aho yoba umunyamahanga atari uwo mu bwoko bwawe bw’Abisirayeli, ariko akaza avuye mu gihugu ca kure ku bw’izina ryawe rihambaye n’ukuboko kwawe kw’inkomezi kandi kuramvuye; niyaza akagusenga atumbereye iyi Ngoro, <verse eid="2CH 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 6:33" />uze umwumve uri mw’ijuru, aho uba, ukorere uwo munyamahanga ico azoba agusavye cose, kugira ngo amahanga yose yo kw’isi amenye izina ryawe akwubahe, nk’uko abantu bawe b’Abisirayeli bakora, kandi bamenye ko iyi Ngoro nubatse yitirirwa izina ryawe.<verse eid="2CH 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2CH 6:34" />Abantu bawe nibaja mu ntambara kugwanya abansi babo, aho uzobarungika hose, maze bakagusenga batumbereye iki gisagara watoranije n’iyi Ngoro nubakiye izina ryawe, <verse eid="2CH 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2CH 6:35" />nuko uze wumve ugusenga kwabo no kwinginga kwabo uri mw’ijuru, ubatabare.<verse eid="2CH 6:35" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2CH 6:36" />Nibaramuka bagucumuyeko, kuko ata muntu adacumura, hanyuma uburake bwawe bukabaziriringira, maze ukabarekurira mu maboko y’abansi babo bakabatwara nk’inyagano mu bihugu vyabo, vyaba ivya hafi canke ivya kure; <verse eid="2CH 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2CH 6:37" />maze nibahindukira mu mitima yabo bari mu gihugu bajanywemwo nk’inyagano, bakihana bakagusaba imbabazi bari muri ico gihugu c’ababanyaze bakavuga bati: ‘twaracumuye, twakoze nabi, twakoze ivyo kwankwa urunuka’; <verse eid="2CH 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2CH 6:38" />maze bakagaruka kuri wewe n’imitima yabo yose n’imishaha yabo yose, bari mu gihugu c’abansi babo babagize inyagano, hanyuma bagasenga baraba mu gihugu wahaye ba sekuruza babo, no ku gisagara watoranije hamwe no kuri iyi Ngoro nubakiye izina ryawe; <verse eid="2CH 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2CH 6:39" />nuko uri mw’ijuru, aho uba, uze wumve ugusenga kwabo n’ugutakamba kwabo, uheze ubagwanirire. Uheze uharire abantu bawe, bagucumuyeko.<verse eid="2CH 6:39" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2CH 6:40" />None rero, Mana yanje, inyonga zawe zame kuri aha hantu kandi amatwi yawe uyashire ku gusenga kwose kuzobera aha hantu.<verse eid="2CH 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="qm1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2CH 6:41" />Nuko rero haguruka, ewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mana,</para>
  <para style="qm2" vid="2CH 6:41">uze mu buruhukiro bwawe,</para>
  <para style="qm2" vid="2CH 6:41">wewe n’Isandugu, ari co kimenyetso c’inkomezi zawe.</para>
  <para style="qm1" vid="2CH 6:41">Abaherezi bawe, yewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mana,</para>
  <para style="qm2" vid="2CH 6:41">nibambare agakiza kawe,</para>
  <para style="qm1" vid="2CH 6:41">abizigirwa bawe banezererwe</para>
  <para style="qm2" vid="2CH 6:41">ukugira neza kwawe.<verse eid="2CH 6:41" /></para>
  <para style="qm1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2CH 6:42" />Yewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mana, ntushiburire kure uwo warobanuje amavuta.</para>
  <para style="qm2" vid="2CH 6:42">Wibuke urukundo ruhambaye wasezeraniye Dawidi umusavyi wawe.”<verse eid="2CH 6:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CH 7" />
  <para style="s1">Bashikiriza Imana Ingoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 7:1" />Salomo ahejeje gusenga, umuriro urakoroka uvuye mw’ijuru utongora ikimazi co guturirwa n’ibimazi vyose, maze ubwiza bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bwuzura iyo Ngoro. <verse eid="2CH 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 7:2" />Abaherezi ntibashobora kwinjira mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> kuko ubwiza bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bwari buyuzuye. <verse eid="2CH 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 7:3" />Abisirayeli bose babonye umuriro umanutse kandi ubwiza bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> buri hejuru y’iyo Ngoro, bapfukama ku musezero, bubama hasi, basenga bashimira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, bavuga bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 7:3">“Uri mwiza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CH 7:3">urukundo rwawe rwamaho ibihe bidashira.”<verse eid="2CH 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 7:4" />Nuko umwami n’abantu bose bashikanira ibimazi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="2CH 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 7:5" />Umwami Salomo araheza atanga ikimazi kigizwe n’impfizi ibihumbi mirongo ibiri na bibiri n’intama ibihumbi ijana na mirongo ibiri. Uko ni ko umwami n’abantu bose bashikirije Imana iyo Ngoro. <verse eid="2CH 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 7:6" />Abaherezi baja mu bibanza vyabo, n’Abalewi ni uko bafise ibicurarangisho vy’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ivyo umwami Dawidi yari yarakoze vyo gutazira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, vyakoreshejwe mu gutazira igihe yashima avuga ati: “Urukundo rwayo rwamaho ibihe bidashira.” Ku rundi ruhande rurabana n’aho Abalewi bari bari, hari abaherezi bavuza inzamba, Abisirayeli bose na bo bari bahagaze.<verse eid="2CH 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 7:7" />Maze umwami ashikiriza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ikibanza kiri imbere y’Ingoro, ahatangira n’ibimazi vyo guturirwa, ivy’ifu hamwe n’ibinure vy’ibimazi vy’ishimwe, kuko igicaniro yari yarakoze mu butare bw’umwakaka kitashobora gukwirwako ibimazi vyo guturirwa, ivy’ifu hamwe n’ibinure vy’ibimazi.<verse eid="2CH 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 7:8" />Nuko umwami Salomo ari kumwe n’Abisirayeli bose bamara imisi indwi bagira imisi mikuru. Hari hakoraniye abantu isinzi bari baje bava i Lebo-Hamati gushika ku mugezi wa Egiputa. <verse eid="2CH 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 7:9" />Ku musi ugira umunani bagira ikoraniro ryo kurangiza, kuko bari bamaze imisi indwi bashikiriza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> igicaniro, bongera bamara imisi indwi bagira umusi mukuru w’insago. <verse eid="2CH 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 7:10" />Ku musi ugira mirongo ibiri na gatatu w’ukwezi kw’indwi arungika abantu iwabo, bataha banezerewe cane, imitima yabo inezerejwe n’ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yakoreye Dawidi na Salomo n’abantu biwe b’Abisirayeli.<verse eid="2CH 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 7:11" />Nuko Salomo ahejeje Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> n’ikirimba c’umwami, akarangiza neza n’ivyo yari yarateguye gukora mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> no ku kirimba ciwe bwite, <verse eid="2CH 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 7:12" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aramwiyereka mw’ijoro amubwira ati:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2CH 7:12">“Numvise ugusenga kwawe kandi ntoranije aha hantu ngo habe ahanje, habe Ingoro yo gushikaniramwo ibimazi.<verse eid="2CH 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 7:13" />Ninugara ijuru ngo imvura ntigwe, canke nkarekura inzige ngo zirye imirima canke nkarekura ikiza mu bantu banje, <verse eid="2CH 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 7:14" />abantu banje, bitirirwa izina ryanje, nibicisha bugufi bagasenga barondera mu nyonga hanje, bakava mu nzira zabo mbi, nanje nzobumva ndi mw’ijuru, mparire ivyaha vyabo, nkize n’igihugu cabo. <verse eid="2CH 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 7:15" />Guhera ubu inyonga zanje zizokwama kuri bo n’amatwi yanje azokwama yumviriza amasengesho bazosengera aha hantu. <verse eid="2CH 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 7:16" />Ndobanuye iyi Ngoro kandi ndayitoranije kugira ngo izina ryanje rihabe ibihe bidashira. Amaso yanje n’umutima wanje bizokwama kuri yo.<verse eid="2CH 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 7:17" />Nawe niwagendera imbere yanje nk’uko so Dawidi yabigira, ugakora ivyo nagutegetse vyose, ugakurikiza amategeko n’amabwirizwa yanje; <verse eid="2CH 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 7:18" />nanje nzokomeza intebe yawe y’ubwami, nk’uko nasezeraniye so Dawidi igihe navuga nti: ‘Ntuzokwigera ubura uwo kuganza Abisirayeli.’<verse eid="2CH 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 7:19" />Ariko nimwahindukira mugata amategeko n’amabwirizwa nabahaye, mukaja gukorera izindi mana mukazisenga, <verse eid="2CH 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 7:20" />nanje nzorandura Abisirayeli ndabakure mu gihugu canje nari narabahaye; n’iyi Ngoro neguriye izina ryanje nzoyita imve mu maso. Nzoyigira iciro ry’imigani n’agatwengo mu mahanga yose. <verse eid="2CH 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 7:21" />Kandi naho iyi Ngoro yari iteye igomwe, abazoyica i ruhande bazogira ubwoba batangare bavuge bati: ‘Ni igiki catumye Uhoraho agirira atya iki gihugu n’iyi Ngoro?’ <verse eid="2CH 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 7:22" />Abantu bazobishura bati: ‘Ni ukubera bataye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya ba sekuruza yabakuye muri Egiputa, bagahindukirira izindi mana, bakazisenga kandi bakazikorera; ni co gituma <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabateje ivyo vyago vyose.’ ”<verse eid="2CH 7:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CH 8" />
  <para style="s1">Ibindi bikorwa vya Salomo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 8:1" />Haheze imyaka mirongo ibiri, ari yo Salomo yubatsemwo iyo Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> n’ikirimba ciwe, <verse eid="2CH 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 8:2" />Salomo asubiramwo kwubaka ibigwati Hiramu yari yamuhaye, aca avyimuriramwo Abisirayeli ngo babibemwo. <verse eid="2CH 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 8:3" />Maze Salomo aca aja gutera i Hamati Zoba arahafata. <verse eid="2CH 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 8:4" />Arongera asubiramwo kwubaka Tadumori mu bugaragwa, n’ibisagara vyose vy’ububiko yari yarubatse i Hamati. <verse eid="2CH 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 8:5" />Yubaka kandi ibisagara vya Beti-Horoni yo haruguru na Beti-Horoni yo hepfo abigira ibikomeye, bizitijwe inzitiro kandi bifise amarembo n’ibihindizo. <verse eid="2CH 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 8:6" />Arongera yubaka Bayalati n’ibisagara vy’ububiko vyiwe, n’ibisagara vyose vy’imikogote yiwe n’amafarasi yiwe; ivyo yipfuje vyose kwubaka i Yerusalemu, i Libani no mu gihugu cose aho yaganza.<verse eid="2CH 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 8:7" />Hari hakiriho amasigarira y’Abaheti, Abamori, Abaperizi, Abahiwi n’Abayebusi; abo bo ntibari Abisirayeli. <verse eid="2CH 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 8:8" />Ni abasigaye, abo Abisirayeli batashoboye kurandura, bo mu moko yakomoka ku mahanga yahora aba muri ico gihugu. Nuko Salomo aca afata abo bantu bose abagira abagurano, abashinga gukora ibikorwa vy’agahato, nk’uko biri kugeza n’uwu musi. <verse eid="2CH 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 8:9" />Ariko Salomo nta Mwisirayeli n’umwe yagize umugurano ngo amukorere; ahubwo yabagize abo kugwana, intwazangabo, abagwanira ku mikogote, n’abakuru babo. <verse eid="2CH 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 8:10" />Umwami Salomo agena abatware amajana abiri na mirongo itanu bo gukurikirana abantu.<verse eid="2CH 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 8:11" />Salomo akura umukobwa wa Farawo mu Gisagara ca Dawidi, amwimurira mu ngoro aho yari yamwubakiye, kuko yagize ati: “Umwamikazi wanje ntakwiye kuba mu ngoro ya Dawidi umwami w’Abisirayeli, kuko Isandugu y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yigeze kuhaba kandi ahantu hose Isandugu y’Uhoraho yinjiye hakaba ari ahera.”<verse eid="2CH 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 8:12" />Ku gicaniro c’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ico Salomo yari yarubakishije imbere y’ibaraza, ahashikanira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ibimazi vyo guturirwa, <verse eid="2CH 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 8:13" />nk’uko vyari vyarashinzwe na Mose ku vyerekeye ibimazi bishikanwa ku musi ku musi, ivyo ku masabato, ivyo mu mboneko z’ukwezi n’ivy’imisi mikuru itatu yo mu mwaka: umusi mukuru w’imikate itagiramwo umwambiro, umusi mukuru w’amayinga, n’umusi mukuru w’insago. <verse eid="2CH 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 8:14" />Mu bijanye no gushira abaherezi ku bikorwa vyabo, Salomo akurikiza ivyo se Dawidi yashinze. Kandi ashiraho n’Abalewi bo kurongora indirimbo zo gutazira no gufasha abaherezi nk’uko bisabwa ku musi ku musi. Ashiraho n’abarinzi b’amarembo nk’uko imice yabo yari iri ku marembo atandukanye, kuko ivyo ari vyo Dawidi umuntu w’Imana yari yarategetse. <verse eid="2CH 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 8:15" />Salomo ntiyakikamye ngo ave mu vyo umwami yashinze vyerekeye abaherezi canke Abalewi, harimwo mbere n’ivyerekeye ububiko.<verse eid="2CH 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 8:16" />Ico Salomo yategerezwa gukora cose carakozwe, kuva ku musi bashiriyeko umushinge w’ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> gushika bahejeje kuyubaka. Uko ni ko iyo Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bahejeje kuyubaka.<verse eid="2CH 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 8:17" />Hanyuma Salomo aja i Eziyoni Geberi n’i Elati ku nkengera y’ikiyaga, ku rubibe rw’Abanyedomu. <verse eid="2CH 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 8:18" />Maze Hiramu amurungikira amato akoresheje abakozi biwe, abantu bari bazi neza ivy’ikiyaga. Abo rero, bari kumwe n’abantu ba Salomo, barasoza baja i Ofiru bakurayo italanto amajana ane na mirongo itanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amatoni 17.</char></note> z’inzahabu, bayashikiriza umwami Salomo.<verse eid="2CH 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CH 9" />
  <para style="s1">Umwamikazi w’i Sheba aja kuramutsa Salomo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 9:1" />Umwamikazi w’i Sheba yumvise ingene Salomo ari umuntu ahambaye, aja i Yerusalemu kumugerageresha ibibazo bigoye cane. Ashika ari kumwe n’abamuherekeje benshi, ingamiya zikoreye ibimota neza, inzahabu nyinshi cane, n’amabuye y’agaciro; maze aja aho Salomo ari aganira na we ivyo yiyumvira vyose. <verse eid="2CH 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 9:2" />Salomo yishura ibibazo vyose yamubajije, ntihagira na kimwe kimunanira kumusigurira. <verse eid="2CH 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 9:3" />Umwamikazi w’i Sheba abonye ubwenge bwa Salomo n’ingoro yubatse, <verse eid="2CH 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 9:4" />ivyokurya vyo ku meza yiwe, ivyicaro vy’abatware biwe, abakozi biwe bagabura ku meza n’imyambaro yabo, abamuhereza ivyo kunywa n’imyambaro yabo, n’ibimazi bituriwe yatanga mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, aratangara cane.<verse eid="2CH 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 9:5" />Abarira umwami ati: “Ivyo numviye mu gihugu canje ku vyerekeye ivyo wakoze hamwe n’ubwenge bwawe, nsanze ari ukuri. <verse eid="2CH 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 9:6" />Ariko sinari navyizeye gushika nishikiye hano nkavyibonera n’amaso yanje ubwanje. Mu vy’ukuri, nta n’igice bambwiye c’ingene ubwenge bwawe bungana; birarengeye kure cane ivyo bambwiye. <verse eid="2CH 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 9:7" />Erega abantu bawe barahiriwe! Eka n’abagendanyi bawe na bo nyene barahiriwe, bo bama bahagaze imbere yawe imisi yose, bumviriza ivy’ubwenge bwawe! <verse eid="2CH 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 9:8" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yawe iragahimbazwa, kuko wayihimbaye maze ikagushira ku ntebe yayo ngo uganze mw’izina ryayo. Ku bw’urukundo Imana yawe ikunda Abisirayeli n’ukugomba kubashigikira ibihe vyose, yakugize umwami ngo ubarongore, kandi ukomeze uguca imanza zibereye no kugororoka.”<verse eid="2CH 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 9:9" />Maze aca ashikanira umwami italanto ijana na mirongo ibiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amatoni 4.</char></note> z’inzahabu, ibimota neza vyinshi, n’amabuye y’igiciro. Nta n’umwe yongeye gushikanira umwami ibimota neza bingana n’ivyo umwamikazi w’i Sheba yashikaniye umwami Salomo.<verse eid="2CH 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 9:10" />I ruhande y’ivyo, abantu ba Hiramu n’abantu ba Salomo bazanye inzahabu zo muri Ofiru; bazana n’ibiti vyitwa santali n’amabuye y’igiciro kinini. <verse eid="2CH 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 9:11" />Umwami aca akoresha vya biti vya santali mu kwubaka ingazi z’Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> n’ingoro yiwe, yongera abikoramwo amakembe n’inanga vy’abacuraranzi. Nta bintu vyiza nk’ivyo vyari bwaboneke mu Buyuda.<verse eid="2CH 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 9:12" />Umwami Salomo aha umwamikazi w’i Sheba ivyo yipfuza n’ivyo yasavye vyose; amwihera n’izindi ngabire nk’uko umugenzo w’ubugwaneza bw’umwami Salomo wari uri. Maze arahaguruka asubira mu gihugu ciwe n’abari kumwe na we.<verse eid="2CH 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubukuru bwa Salomo n’icubahiro ciwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 9:13" />Ingabire Salomo yaronka ku mwaka ku mwaka zangana n’italanto amajana atandatu na mirongo itandatu na zitandatu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amatoni 25.</char></note> z’inzahabu, <verse eid="2CH 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 9:14" />udashizemwo ubundi butunzi yaronka biciye mu makori abadandaza batanga hamwe n’ayava mu bami bose bo muri Arabiya; abatware bo mu gihugu ciwe na bo bakama bamushikanira inzahabu n’ifeza.<verse eid="2CH 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 9:15" />Umwami Salomo acurisha inkinzo nininini amajana abiri mu nzahabu; imwimwe yose itwara shekeli amajana atandatu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilo 6,9.</char></note> z’inzahabu. <verse eid="2CH 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 9:16" />Acurisha n’izindi nkinzo ntonto amajana atatu mu nzahabu, imwe yose ikajako shekeli amajana atatu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilo 3,5.</char></note> z’inzahabu. Umwami aca azibika mu ngoro yise Ikibira c’i Libani.<verse eid="2CH 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 9:17" />Hanyuma umwami akoresha intebe y’ubwami nini isharijwe n’amahembe y’inzovu ayomekako inzahabu ihinguwe neza. <verse eid="2CH 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 9:18" />Iyo ntebe yari ifise ingazi zitandatu, n’ico gushirako ibirenge c’inzahabu cari gifatanye na yo. Ku mpande zose z’iyo ntebe hari ivyo gushirako amaboko, kandi hari n’ibishushanyo vy’intare bibiri bihagaze i ruhande y’amaboko. <verse eid="2CH 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 9:19" />Hari n’ibindi bishushanyo cumi na bibiri vy’intare, kimwekimwe ku mpera y’ingazi yose muri zimwe zitandatu. Nta ntebe nk’iyo yari bwigere iboneka mu bwami na bumwe. <verse eid="2CH 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 9:20" />Ibikombe vyose vy’umwami Salomo vyari bikozwe mu nzahabu, n’ibikoresho vyose vyo mu ngoro yise Ikibira c’i Libani vyari bikozwe mu nzahabu ihinguwe neza. Nta na kimwe cari gikozwe mw’ifeza, kuko ifeza yafatwa nk’aho ifise agaciro gato mu gihe ca Salomo. <verse eid="2CH 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 9:21" />Umwami yari afise amato yo kudandaza yaja i Tarushishi atwawe n’abantu ba Hiramu. Uko imyaka itatu iheze ayo mato yaba agarutse avuye i Tarushishi, azanye inzahabu, ifeza, amahembe y’inzovu, inkende, n’amadendo.<verse eid="2CH 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 9:22" />Maze umwami Salomo aba agahambaye mu butunzi no mu bwenge kurusha abandi bami bose bo kw’isi. <verse eid="2CH 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 9:23" />Abami bose bo kw’isi bagomba kubonana na Salomo ngo bumve ubwenge Imana yamuhaye. <verse eid="2CH 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 9:24" />Ku mwaka ku mwaka, abaja kumuraba umwe wese yagenda amushikaniye ifeza n’inzahabu, amakanzu, ibigwanisho, ibimota neza, amafarasi, n’inyumbu.<verse eid="2CH 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 9:25" />Salomo yari afise ibibandahori ibihumbi bine vy’amafarasi n’imikogote, n’amafarasi ibihumbi cumi na bibiri. Zimwe yazitungira mu bisagara vy’imikogote, izindi zikaba i Yerusalemu aho yaba. <verse eid="2CH 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 9:26" />Yaganza abami bose uhereye ku ruzi Efurate mu buraruko hamwe n’igihugu c’Abafilisitiya, gushika ku rubibe rwa Egiputa mu bumanuko. <verse eid="2CH 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 9:27" />Umwami agwiza ifeza i Yerusalemu zisigara zimeze nk’amabuye, imbaho z’agaciro z’amasederi na zo ziragwira zimera nk’ibiti vy’imisukomora vyo mu biyaya vy’i Buyuda. <verse eid="2CH 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 9:28" />Amafarasi ya Salomo yava muri Egiputa no mu bindi bihugu vyose.<verse eid="2CH 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Urupfu rwa Salomo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 9:29" />Ibindi vyabaye ku ngoma ya Salomo, uhereye ku ntango ugashitsa kw’iherezo, mbega vyose ntivyanditswe mu vyagenda biraba vyanditswe na Natani uwavugishwa n’Imana, mu vyavugishijwe na Ahiya w’i Shilo no mu vyeretswe Ido uwerekwa vyerekeye Yerobowamu mwene Nebati? <verse eid="2CH 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 9:30" />Salomo yabaye ku ngoma i Yerusalemu aganza Abisirayeli bose kumara imyaka mirongo ine. <verse eid="2CH 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 9:31" />Nuko Salomo arapfa ahamvya ba sekuruza; ahambwa mu Gisagara ca se Dawidi. Maze umuhungu wiwe Rehobowamu amusubirira ku ngoma.<verse eid="2CH 9:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CH 10" />
  <para style="s1">Abisirayeli bagarariza Rehobowamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 10:1" />Rehobowamu aja i Shekemu aho Abisirayeli bose bari bakoraniye kugira ngo bamwimike abe umwami. <verse eid="2CH 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 10:2" />Yerobowamu mwene Nebati avyumvise ari muri Egiputa, aho yari yarahungiye umwami Salomo, aca aragaruka. <verse eid="2CH 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 10:3" />Nuko batumako Yerobowamu, maze we n’Abisirayeli bose baja aho Rehobowamu ari bamubwira bati: <verse eid="2CH 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 10:4" />“So yadutwaje umukazo, none turagusavye utugabanirize umuruho w’ibikorwa bigoye yadutegetse gukora, natwe tuzoba abasavyi bawe.”<verse eid="2CH 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 10:5" />Rehobowamu abishura ati: “Muze mugaruke haciye imisi itatu.” Nuko abo bantu baca baragenda.<verse eid="2CH 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 10:6" />Umwami Rehobowamu aca agisha inama abatware bakoranye na se Salomo akiriho. Arababaza ati: “Mungiriye inama ki? Aba bantu ndabishure iki?”<verse eid="2CH 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 10:7" />Na bo baramwishura bati: “Niwagirira neza aba bantu ukabanezereza, ukabaha inyishu nziza, bazokwama bagukorera ibihe vyose.”<verse eid="2CH 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 10:8" />Ariko Rehobowamu yanka impanuro abahumure bamuhaye, aca asiguza abasore bakuranye na we bari mu bamukorera. <verse eid="2CH 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 10:9" />Arababaza ati: “Mumpanuye iki? Nokwishura iki aba bantu bambwiye bati: ‘Turemurure umutwaro so yaturemetse’?”<verse eid="2CH 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 10:10" />Ba basore bakuranye na we bamwishura bati: “Abo bantu bakubwiye bati, ‘So yaturemetse imitwaro ituvuna, ariko weho uturemurure iyo mitwaro’; babwire uti, ‘Urutoke rwanje rw’uruhererezi rusumvya ubunini umugongo wa data. <verse eid="2CH 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 10:11" />Data yabaremereje ibikorwa vyinshi, ni ko: ariko jeho nzobibaremereza gusumba. Data yabakubitisha ikimoko, jeho nzobarisha sikoropiyo!’ ”<verse eid="2CH 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 10:12" />Haheze imisi itatu, Yerobowamu na ba bantu bagaruka kuraba umwami Rehobowamu, nk’uko yari yabibabwiye, ati: “Muze mugaruke mu misi itatu.” <verse eid="2CH 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 10:13" />Maze umwami Rehobowamu abishura abakankamira, kuko yari yanse impanuro yahawe n’abahumure, <verse eid="2CH 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 10:14" />akumvira impanuro z’imisore yakuranye na we. Abishura ati: “Data yabaremereje ibikorwa bigoye, jeho nzobibaremereza gusumba. Data yabakubitisha ikimoko, jeho nzobarisha sikoropiyo.” <verse eid="2CH 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 10:15" />Nuko umwami ntiyumvira abo bantu, kuko Imana ari yo yatumye vyose bigenda gutyo, kugira ngo Uhoraho ashitse ico yari yarasezeraniye Yerobowamu mwene Nebati, abicishije kuri Ahiya w’i Shilo.<verse eid="2CH 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 10:16" />Abisirayeli bose babonye ko umwami yanse kubumviriza, bishura umwami bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 10:16">“Hari umugabane dufise mu muryango wa Dawidi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CH 10:16">Nta co twiteze kuronka kuri mwene Isayi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 10:16">Yemwe Bisirayeli, mwese nimusubire mu ngo zanyu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CH 10:16">Nawe Dawidi, urimenya urabe ab’inzu yawe!”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CH 10:16">Nuko Abisirayeli bose basubira iwabo. <verse eid="2CH 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 10:17" />Ariko Abisirayeli bagumye baba mu bisagara vy’i Buyuda, bobo Rehobowamu yagumye abaganza.<verse eid="2CH 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 10:18" />Umwami Rehobowamu arungika Hadoramu yari ajejwe ibikorwa vy’agahato, kugira ngo agarukane umutekano, ariko Abisirayeli bamutera amabuye arapfa. Maze umwami Rehobowamu, yurira umukogote wiwe arahunga aja i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 10:19" />Uko ni ko imiryango ya Isirayeli yo mu buraruko yanse kuganzwa n’inzu ya Dawidi gushika n’uwu musi.<verse eid="2CH 10:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CH 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 11:1" />Rehobowamu ashitse i Yerusalemu, akoranya Abayuda n’Ababenyamini, abatoranyamwo imisore ishobora kugwana ibihumbi ijana na mirongo umunani kugira ngo baje gutera Abisirayeli, bagarurire ubwami Rehobowamu.<verse eid="2CH 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 11:2" />Ariko ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> riza kuri Shemaya umuntu w’Imana riti: <verse eid="2CH 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 11:3" />“Barira Rehobowamu mwene Salomo umwami w’i Buyuda n’Abisirayeli bari i Buyuda n’i Bubenyamini, uti: <verse eid="2CH 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 11:4" />‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze: Ntimuduge kugwanya abavukanyi banyu. Umwe wese muri mwebwe nasubire iwe, kuko ivyabaye vyose ari jewe nabigize.’ ” Nuko bumvira ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> basubira inyuma bareka gutera Yerobowamu.<verse eid="2CH 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rehobowamu akomeza i Buyuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 11:5" />Rehobowamu aba i Yerusalemu, aca yubaka ibisagara vyo kugwanira igihugu c’i Buyuda ari vyo <verse eid="2CH 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 11:6" />Betelehemu, Etamu, Tekowa, <verse eid="2CH 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 11:7" />Beti-Zuri, Soko, Adulamu, <verse eid="2CH 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 11:8" />Gati, Maresha, Zifu, <verse eid="2CH 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 11:9" />Adorayimu, Lakishi, Azeka, <verse eid="2CH 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 11:10" />Zora, Ayaloni n’i Heburoni. Ivyo vyari ibisagara bizitijwe inzitiro vy’i Buyuda n’i Bubenyamini. <verse eid="2CH 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 11:11" />Akomeza uburyo bwo kubikingira yongera ashiraho n’abakuru b’ingabo muri vyo, n’ububiko bw’ivyokurya, amavuta ya elayo, n’umuvinyu. <verse eid="2CH 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 11:12" />Ashiramwo inkinzo n’amacumu muri ivyo bisagara vyose, abigira ibihambaye. Nuko i Buyuda n’i Bubenyamini haguma musi y’ubutware bwiwe.<verse eid="2CH 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 11:13" />Abaherezi n’Abalewi bandi bari bakwiragiye mu ntara zose za Isirayeli bavayo baja ku ruhande rwiwe. <verse eid="2CH 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 11:14" />Abalewi baheba ibisagara vyabo n’uburagiro bwabo, baja kuba i Buyuda n’i Yerusalemu kuko Yerobowamu n’abahungu biwe bari babankiye gukora igikorwa cabo c’ubuherezi bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="2CH 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 11:15" />Kandi ashiraho abaherezi biwe ngo bakorere mu bibanza vyo gusengeramwo ku misozi, ngo bahereze ibimazi ibigirwamana vy’impene n’inka yari yakoresheje. <verse eid="2CH 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 11:16" />Abo mu miryango yose y’Abisirayeli bashize imitima ku kurondera <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana y’Abisirayeli, bakurikira Abalewi baja i Yerusalemu ngo baje gushikanira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya ba sekuruza ibimazi. <verse eid="2CH 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 11:17" />Bakomeza ubwami bw’i Buyuda, bashigikira Rehobowamu mwene Salomo imyaka itatu, bagendera mu nzira za Dawidi na Salomo mu gihe ciwe.<verse eid="2CH 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umuryango wa Rehobowamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 11:18" />Rehobowamu arongora Mahalati, yari umukobwa wa Yerimoti mwene Dawidi na Abihayili, umukobwa wa Eliyabu mwene Isayi. <verse eid="2CH 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 11:19" />Avyarana na we abahungu ari bo: Yewushi, Shemariya na Zahamu. <verse eid="2CH 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 11:20" />Hanyuma arongora Mayaka umukobwa wa Abusalomu, ari we bavyaranye Abiya, Atayi, Ziza na Shelomiti. <verse eid="2CH 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 11:21" />Rehobowamu akunda Mayaka umukobwa wa Abusalomu kurusha abandi bagore biwe bose n’incoreke ziwe. Bose na bose yari afise abagore icumi n’umunani n’incoreke mirongo itandatu; bavyarana abahungu mirongo ibiri n’umunani n’abakobwa mirongo itandatu.<verse eid="2CH 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 11:22" />Rehobowamu ashinga Abiya mwene Mayaka ngo abe umuganwa mukuru ku bavukanyi biwe, kugira ngo aze amwimike. <verse eid="2CH 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 11:23" />Akorana ubwenge mu gukwiragiza abandi bahungu biwe mu ntara zose z’i Buyuda n’i Bubenyamini, no muri vya bisagara bizitijwe inzitiro. Abaha ubutunzi bwinshi, abaronderera n’abagore benshi.<verse eid="2CH 11:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CH 12" />
  <para style="s1">Shishaki atera i Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 12:1" />Ubwami bwa Rehobowamu bumaze gukomera akaba agahambaye, we n’Abisirayeli bose bari kumwe na we baheba Ivyagezwe vy’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="2CH 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 12:2" />Maze mu mwaka ugira gatanu umwami Rehobowamu ari ku ngoma, Shishaki umwami wa Egiputa atera i Yerusalemu kuko batabaye abizigirwa imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="2CH 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 12:3" />Aza azananye n’imikogote ibihumbi cumi na bibiri n’abagendera ku mafarasi ibihumbi mirongo itandatu, n’ingabo zigwanira hasi zitoharurika z’Abanyalibiya, Abasuki, n’Abanyetiyopiya baje bazananye bavuye muri Egiputa. <verse eid="2CH 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 12:4" />Yigarurira ibisagara bizitijwe inzitiro vy’i Buyuda, araza ashika n’i Yerusalemu.<verse eid="2CH 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 12:5" />Maze uwavugishwa n’Imana Shemaya aza kwa Rehobowamu n’abakuru bose b’i Buyuda bari bakoraniye i Yerusalemu kubera gutinya Shishaki, arababwira ati: “Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze: ‘Kubera ko mwampevye, nanje ndabatanze mu maboko ya Shishaki.’ ”<verse eid="2CH 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 12:6" />Abakuru b’Abisirayeli n’umwami baca bicisha bugufi bavuga bati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aragororotse.”<verse eid="2CH 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 12:7" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abonye ko bicishije bugufi, arungika ijambo ryiwe kuri Shemaya ati: “Ko bicishije bugufi, sinzobica ariko nzobaha agahengwe. Uburake bwanje ntibuzosukwa kuri Yerusalemu biciye kuri Shishaki. <verse eid="2CH 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 12:8" />Ariko bazoba abagurano biwe, kugira ngo bamenye itandukaniro riri hagati yo kunkorera jewe no gukorera abami bo mw’isi.”<verse eid="2CH 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 12:9" />Maze Shishaki umwami wa Egiputa ateye i Yerusalemu, asahura ubutunzi bwose bwari mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> n’ubwari mu ngoro y’umwami. Atwara ibintu vyose, harimwo na za nkinzo z’inzahabu Salomo yari yaracurishije. <verse eid="2CH 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 12:10" />Nuko umwami Rehobowamu aca acurisha izindi nkinzo mu butare bw’umwakaka asubiriza zimwe za mbere, aca azizeza intwazangabo z’abacungera ku kirimba c’ingoro y’umwami. <verse eid="2CH 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 12:11" />Igihe cose umwami yagomba kwinjira mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, abacungera ku kirimba baca bajana na we bitwaje za nkinzo, mu nyuma bagaheza bakazisubiza mu cumba cazo.<verse eid="2CH 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 12:12" />Kubera ko Rehobowamu yicishije bugufi, uburake bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bwaramuvuyeko ntiyarandurwa rwose. Kandi mu vy’ukuri, hariho ivyiza vyari mu Buyuda.<verse eid="2CH 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 12:13" />Umwami Rehobowamu aba agakomeye cane i Yerusalemu abandanya kuganza. Yari afise imyaka mirongo ine n’umwe igihe yimikwa ngo abe umwami, hanyuma aganza imyaka cumi n’indwi, aba i Yerusalemu, igisagara <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yaratoranije mu miryango yose y’Abisirayeli ngo ahashire izina ryiwe. Nyina yitwa Nayama; yari Umwamonikazi. <verse eid="2CH 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 12:14" />Akora ibibi kuko atari yashize umutima wiwe ku kurondera <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="2CH 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 12:15" />Ivyabaye ku ngoma ya Rehobowamu, kuva ku ntango gushika ku mpera, mbega ntivyanditswe mu nzandiko z’ivyagenda biraba nk’uko vyanditswe na Shemaya uwavugishwa n’Imana hamwe na Ido uwerekwa, vyerekana ingene abantu bagiye bararondoka? Hama hari intambara hagati ya Rehobowamu na Yerobowamu. <verse eid="2CH 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 12:16" />Rehobowamu arapfa ahamvya ba sekuruza; ahambwa hamwe na bo mu Gisagara ca Dawidi. Maze umuhungu wiwe Abiya amusubirira ku ngoma.<verse eid="2CH 12:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CH 13" />
  <para style="s1">Abiya aba umwami w’i Buyuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 13:1" />Mu mwaka ugira cumi n’umunani Yerobowamu ari ku ngoma, ni ho Abiya yaba umwami w’i Buyuda, <verse eid="2CH 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 13:2" />maze aganza imyaka itatu aba i Yerusalemu. Nyina wiwe yitwa Mayaka, umukobwa wa Uriyeli w’i Gibeya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 13:2">Havyuka intambara hagati ya Abiya na Yerobowamu. <verse eid="2CH 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 13:3" />Abiya aja mu ntambara afise ingabo ibihumbi amajana ane bashobora kugwana; maze Yerobowamu atonda urugamba ngo agwane na we ari kumwe n’ingabo ibihumbi amajana umunani bashoboye kugwana.<verse eid="2CH 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 13:4" />Abiya ahagarara ku musozi Zemarayimu, mu misozi y’Abefurayimu, maze aravuga ati: Yewe Yerobowamu namwe Bisirayeli mwese, munyumvirize! <verse eid="2CH 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 13:5" />Ntimuzi ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana y’Abisirayeli, yimitse Dawidi ngo abe umwami w’Abisirayeli n’abamukomokako ibihe vyose biciye mw’isezerano ry’umunyu? <verse eid="2CH 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 13:6" />Ariko Yerobowamu mwene Nebati, umukozi wa Salomo mwene Dawidi, yagararije shebuja. <verse eid="2CH 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 13:7" />Bamwe mu bantu b’imburakimazi, batisonera, bagiye hamwe baja aho ari kugira ngo bagwanye Rehobowamu mwene Salomo igihe yari akiri muto ataramenya gufata ingingo, kandi atarakomera ngo agwanye izo mburakimazi.<verse eid="2CH 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 13:8" />“None rero mwateguye kugwanya ubwami bwashizweho n’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, buri mu minwe y’abakomoka kuri Dawidi. Egome muri ingabo nyinshi kandi muje mufise vya bigirwamana vy’inka bicuzwe mu nzahabu Yerobowamu yacurishije ngo bibe imana zanyu. <verse eid="2CH 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 13:9" />Ntimwirukanye abaherezi b’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, bene Aroni, n’Abalewi, mukishiriraho abaherezi banyu nk’uko bigenda no mu yandi mahanga? Umuntu wese aje azanye ishuri n’impfizi z’intama indwi muca mumugira umuherezi w’ibitari imana vy’ukuri.<verse eid="2CH 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 13:10" />Ariko tweho, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ni we Mana yacu, kandi ntitwigeze tumuhemukira. Abaherezi bahereza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ni bene Aroni, kandi Abalewi ni bo babafasha. <verse eid="2CH 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 13:11" />Uko bukeye uko bwije bashikanira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ibimazi vyo guturirwa n’ibimota neza. Bama bategura ya mikate itambiwe kuri ya meza idahumanye kandi bagatunganya amatara ku giterekwako amatara c’inzahabu uko bukeye. Twama twitondera ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu yihanikirije. Ariko mwebwe mwaramutaye. <verse eid="2CH 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 13:12" />Imana iri kumwe natwe; ni yo iturongora. Abaherezi bayo ni bo baza kuvuza inzamba y’akamo k’intambara nitwaza kubagwanya. Bagabo b’Abisirayeli, ntimugwanye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana ya ba sogokuruza banyu, kuko mutazotsinda.”<verse eid="2CH 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 13:13" />Muri ico gihe Yerobowamu yari yarungitse ingabo zimwe ngo zibaturuke inyuma, ku buryo izindi ngabo zisigaye zari zihanganye n’Abayuda, abandi babaturutse inyuma. <verse eid="2CH 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 13:14" />Abayuda bahindukiye babona ko batewe imbere n’inyuma. Nuko baca batakambira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Abaherezi bavuza inzamba zabo, <verse eid="2CH 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 13:15" />ingabo z’Abayuda ziha akamo. Bamaze kwiha akamo, Imana ica ikinagiza Yerobowamu n’Abisirayeli bose imbere ya Abiya n’Abayuda. <verse eid="2CH 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 13:16" />Abisirayeli bahunga Abayuda, maze Imana ibagabura mu maboko yabo. <verse eid="2CH 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 13:17" />Abiya n’abantu biwe babicamwo benshi, ingabo ibihumbi amajana atanu z’Abisirayeli zigwa muri iyo ntambara. <verse eid="2CH 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 13:18" />Kuri uwo musi ingabo z’Abisirayeli ziraneshwa bikomeye. Abayuda batahana intsinzi kuko bifatanije n’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana ya ba sekuruza.<verse eid="2CH 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 13:19" />Abiya akinagiza Yerobowamu amunyaga ibisagara vy’i Beteli, Yeshana na Efuroni, hamwe n’utundi dutoduto tuhakikije. <verse eid="2CH 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 13:20" />Yerobowamu ntiyasubira kugira inkomezi mu gihe c’ingoma ya Abiya. Maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aramukubita arapfa.<verse eid="2CH 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 13:21" />Ariko Abiya we arushaho kuba umunyenkomezi. Arongora abagore icumi na bane avyara abahungu mirongo ibiri na babiri n’abakobwa icumi na batandatu.<verse eid="2CH 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 13:22" />Ibindi vyabaye ku ngoma ya Abiya, ivyo yakoze n’ivyo yavuze, vyanditswe mu nkuru zanditswe n’uwavugishwa n’Imana Ido.<verse eid="2CH 13:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="2CH 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 14:1" />Hanyuma Abiya arapfa ahamvya ba sekuruza ahambwa mu Gisagara ca Dawidi. Umuhungu wiwe Asa amusubirira ku ngoma, kandi ku ngoma yiwe, igihugu kiba impore kumara imyaka icumi.<verse eid="2CH 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Asa aba umwami w’i Buyuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 14:2" />Asa akora ibigororotse n’ibibereye imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yiwe. <verse eid="2CH 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 14:3" />Akuraho ibicaniro vy’imana z’inyamahanga n’ibibanza vyo gusengeramwo ku misozi, amenagura n’inkingi z’amabuye, asitura n’ibishushanyo vya Ashera. <verse eid="2CH 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 14:4" />Ategeka Abayuda ngo barondere <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya ba sekuruza, no kwumvira ivyagezwe vyiwe n’amabwirizwa yiwe. <verse eid="2CH 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 14:5" />Akuraho ibibanza vyo gusengeramwo vyo mu mataba y’imisozi hamwe n’ibicaniro batuririramwo ibimota neza vyari mu bisagara vyose vy’i Buyuda, maze igihugu kironka impore ku ngoma yiwe. <verse eid="2CH 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 14:6" />Yubaka ibisagara bizitijwe inzitiro vy’i Buyuda, kuko igihugu cari impore. Nta n’umwe yamugwanije muri iyo myaka yose, kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yamuhaye impore.<verse eid="2CH 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 14:7" />Abwira Abayuda ati: “Nimuze twubake ibi bisagara, tubikikuze inzitiro, twubake n’iminara, dushireko amarembo n’ibihindizo. Igihugu kiracari icacu, kuko twarondeye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu; twaramurondeye na we aduha impore impande zose.” Nuko barubaka kandi baratunga baratunganirwa.<verse eid="2CH 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 14:8" />Asa yari afise ingabo zingana ibihumbi amajana atatu bava i Buyuda, bari bafise inkinzo nini n’amacumu, n’abandi ibihumbi amajana abiri na mirongo umunani bava i Bubenyamini, bitwaje inkinzo ntonto n’imiheto. Abo bose bari abahizi bazi kugwana.<verse eid="2CH 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 14:9" />Zera Umunyetiyopiya aza kubatera afise ingabo zingana umuliyoni n’imikogote amajana atatu, araza ashika i Maresha. <verse eid="2CH 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 14:10" />Asa aja guhura na we, batonda urugamba mu kiyaya c’i Zefata hafi y’i Maresha.<verse eid="2CH 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 14:11" />Maze Asa yambaza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yiwe avuga ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, nta n’umwe ameze nkawe wo gufasha abanyantegenke batewe n’abanyenkomezi. Dutabare, ewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mana yacu, kuko tukwizigiye, kandi twaje kugwanya izi ngabo nyinshi gutya mw’izina ryawe. Ewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ni wewe Mana yacu; ntureke ngo umuntu aguhonyore ku gakanu.”<verse eid="2CH 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 14:12" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> atsinda Abanyetiyopiya imbere ya Asa n’Abayuda. Abo Banyetiyopiya barahunga, <verse eid="2CH 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 14:13" />Asa na we n’ingabo ziwe barabakurikira gushika i Gerari. Abenshi mu Banyetiyopiya bagwa mu ntambara ku buryo batasubiriye kuvyura umutwe, kuko bari batsinzwe imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> n’ingabo ziwe. Ingabo z’Abayuda zisahura ibintu vyinshi muri ivyo bisagara. <verse eid="2CH 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 14:14" />Basambura ibisagara bitobito vyose bikikuje Gerari, kuko ubwoba buvuye k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bwari bwabatekeye. Banyaga ivyo bisagara vyose, kuko harimwo ubutunzi bwinshi. <verse eid="2CH 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 14:15" />Batera aho abungere bacumbika batwara imikuku myinshi y’intama n’impene hamwe n’ingamiya. Basubira i Yerusalemu.<verse eid="2CH 14:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="2CH 15" />
  <para style="s1">Ivyo Asa yahinduye mu gihugu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 15:1" />Mpwemu w’Imana aza kuri Azariya mwene Odedi. <verse eid="2CH 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 15:2" />Aja guhura na Asa aramubwira ati: “Nyumviriza, yewe Asa namwe Bayuda n’Ababenyamini mwese. <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azobana namwe nimwagumana na we. Nimwamurondera, muzomubona, ariko nimwamutera ibitugu, na we azobaheba. <verse eid="2CH 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 15:3" />Abisirayeli bamaze igihe kirekire batagira Imana y’ukuri, batagira umuherezi wo kubigisha batagira n’Ivyagezwe. <verse eid="2CH 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 15:4" />Ariko mu mubabaro wabo bahindukirira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana y’Abisirayeli, baramurondera, baramubona. <verse eid="2CH 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 15:5" />Muri iyo misi nta mutekano wariho ku buryo abantu bashobora gutembera, kuko ababa mu gihugu bose bari mu muvurungano ukomeye. <verse eid="2CH 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 15:6" />Ihanga rimwe ryarazimanganya irindi, igisagara kimwe kikazimanganya ikindi, kuko Imana yari yabateje ivyago vy’ubwoko bwose. <verse eid="2CH 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 15:7" />Ariko mweho, nimukomere ntimwihebure, kuko igikorwa canyu kizoronka ingero.”<verse eid="2CH 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 15:8" />Asa yumvise ayo majambo n’ukuvugishwa kwa Azariya mwene Odedi uwavugishwa n’Imana, ararema. Akuraho ibigirwamana biteye isoni vyari mu gihugu cose c’i Buyuda n’i Bubenyamini no mu bisagara vyose yari yigaruriye mu misozi y’Abefurayimu. Asanasana igicaniro c’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> cari imbere y’urwinjiriro rw’Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="2CH 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 15:9" />Hanyuma akoranya Abayuda n’Ababenyamini bose n’abantu bose bo mu Bwefurayimu, Abamanase n’Abasimeyoni bari bimukiye muri bo, kuko abantu benshi bari baje kuri we bavuye mu Bisirayeli bamaze kubona ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yiwe ari kumwe na we.<verse eid="2CH 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 15:10" />Bakoranira i Yerusalemu mu kwezi kwa gatatu kw’umwaka wa cumi na gatanu Asa ari ku ngoma. <verse eid="2CH 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 15:11" />Muri ico gihe bashikanira ibimazi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bingana n’inka amajana indwi n’intama n’impene ibihumbi indwi bakuye mu vyo banyaze batahanye bavuye kugwana. <verse eid="2CH 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 15:12" />Bagira isezerano ryo kurondera <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana ya ba sekuruza, n’imitima yabo yose n’imishaha yabo yose. <verse eid="2CH 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 15:13" />Basezerana ko abatazorondera <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana y’Abisirayeli, bakwiye kwicwa, baba abakiri bato canke abakuze, abagabo canke abagore. <verse eid="2CH 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 15:14" />Basezeranira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> mu kwiha akamo, bavuza n’inzamba n’amahembe y’intama. <verse eid="2CH 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 15:15" />Abayuda bose bifatanya na bo muri iyo ndahiro kuko bari barahiye n’umutima ubikunze. Barondeye Imana n’imitima ibikunze, na yo irabiyereka. Nuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abaha impore impande zose.<verse eid="2CH 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 15:16" />Umwami Asa yirukana inakuru Mayaka, amwaka iteka ryo kuba nyina w’umwami, kuko yari yaracurishije igishushanyo c’ubuyobe ca Ashera. Asa atemagura ico kigirwamana akigira ubunywenywe; agituririra ku mwonga Kidironi. <verse eid="2CH 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 15:17" />Naho atashoboye gukura muri Isirayeli ibibanza vyose basengeramwo vyo ku mataba y’imisozi, umutima wiwe wamye utunganye imisi yose y’ukubaho kwiwe. <verse eid="2CH 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 15:18" />Yinjiza mu Ngoro y’Imana ifeza n’inzahabu n’ibikoresho we na se bari bareguriye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="2CH 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 15:19" />Nta ntambara yasubiye kuba gushika ku mwaka wa mirongo itanu na gatanu wo ku ngoma ya Asa.<verse eid="2CH 15:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="2CH 16" />
  <para style="s1">Imyaka ya nyuma ya Asa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 16:1" />Mu mwaka ugira mirongo itatu na gatandatu Asa ari ku ngoma, Bayasha umwami wa Isirayeli aduga gutera i Buyuda, yubaka uruzitiro rukikuza i Rama kugira ngo abuze umuntu wese yogomba kuja canke kuva kwa Asa umwami w’i Buyuda.<verse eid="2CH 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 16:2" />Maze Asa afata ifeza n’inzahabu zari mu bubiko bwo mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> no mu ngoro yiwe azirungikira Beni-Hadadi umwami w’i Siriya, yatwarira i Damasiko, amurungikira n’ubutumwa buvuga ngo: <verse eid="2CH 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 16:3" />“Tugiriranire isezerano hagati yanje nawe, nk’uko vyari biri hagati ya data na so. Raba, ndakurungikiye ifeza n’inzahabu. None rero n’ureke isezerano rya mwe na Bayasha umwami wa Isirayeli kugira ngo asubire inyuma areke kuntera.”<verse eid="2CH 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 16:4" />Beni-Hadadi yemeranya n’umwami Asa, arungika intwazangabo ziwe gutera ibisagara vya Isirayeli, bafata Iyoni, Dani, Abeli-Mayimu, bafata n’ibisagara vyose vy’ububiko vyo mu ntara ya Nafutali. <verse eid="2CH 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 16:5" />Bayasha avyumvise, aca areka kwubaka i Rama, ahagarika n’ivyo yariko arakora. <verse eid="2CH 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 16:6" />Maze umwami Asa azana abantu biwe b’i Buyuda bose, bakurayo amabuye n’imbaho zose Bayasha yariko azitiza igisagara ca Rama. Asa aca abikoresha mu kuzitira ibisagara vya Geba na Misipa.<verse eid="2CH 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 16:7" />Muri ico gihe Hanani uwerekwa aza ku mwami Asa w’i Buyuda amubwira ati: “Ko wishimiye umwami w’i Siriya ntiwizigire <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yawe, ingabo z’umwami w’i Siriya ziraguciye mu myanya y’intoke. <verse eid="2CH 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 16:8" />Mbega Abanyetiyopiya n’Abanyalibiya ntibari ingabo zikomeye kandi zifise imikogote myinshi n’abagwanira ku mafarasi isinzi? Ariko igihe wizigira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, yabagabuye mu maboko yawe. <verse eid="2CH 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 16:9" />Kuko inyonga z’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> zinyurangana mw’isi yose ngo ahe inkomezi abamwegamitseko imitima yabo yose. Wakoze ivy’ubupfu, kandi guhera ubu uzokwama mu ntambara.”<verse eid="2CH 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 16:10" />Asa ashavurira uwo yerekwa kubera ivyo; arashangashirwa gushika aho amuta mw’ibohero, ashira amaguru yiwe mu mpatane z’ivyuma. Kandi muri ico gihe nyene Asa atangura gutwaza umukazo abantu bamwebamwe bo mu gihugu ciwe.<verse eid="2CH 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 16:11" />Ivyabaye ku ngoma ya Asa, kuva ku ntango kugeza ku mpera, vyanditswe mu gitabu c’ivyabaye ku ngoma z’abami b’i Buyuda n’abo muri Isirayeli. <verse eid="2CH 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 16:12" />Mu mwaka wa mirongo itatu n’icenda Asa ari ku ngoma asinzikazwa cane n’ingwara y’ibirenge. Naho iyo ngwara yari imubabaje cane, mu kugwara kwiwe kwose ntiyigeze arondera <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ngo amufashe, ariko yishimiye abavuzi. <verse eid="2CH 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 16:13" />Maze mu mwaka ugira mirongo ine na rimwe ari ku ngoma, Asa arapfa, ahamvya ba sekuruza. <verse eid="2CH 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 16:14" />Bamuhamba mu mva yari yarimbishije ubwiwe mu Gisagara ca Dawidi. Bamuryamika ku buriri bari bashizeko ibimota neza vy’uburyo bwinshi, baca bacana umuriro mwinshi ngo bamuheshe icubahiro.<verse eid="2CH 16:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="2CH 17" />
  <para style="s1">Yehoshafati umwami w’i Buyuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 17:1" />Yehoshafati umuhungu wiwe aca aba umwami amusubirira ku ntebe, maze akomeza Ubuyuda kugira ngo bashobore guhangana na Isirayeli. <verse eid="2CH 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 17:2" />Ashira ingabo mu bisagara bizitijwe inzitiro, ashiraho n’ibirindiro bikomeye mu Buyuda hose no mu bisagara vy’Abefurayimu, ivyo se Asa yari yarigaruriye.<verse eid="2CH 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 17:3" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari kumwe na Yehoshafati kuko mu myaka yiwe ya mbere yagendeye mu nzira sekuruza Dawidi yari yaragendeyemwo. Ntiyasiguje za Bayali, <verse eid="2CH 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 17:4" />ahubwo yarondeye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya se, agendera mu vyo yihanikirije, ntiyakora nk’ivyo Abisirayeli bakora. <verse eid="2CH 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 17:5" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aha ubwami bwiwe gukomera; kandi Abayuda bose bazanira ingabire Yehoshafati, gushika aho yabaye umutunzi, agira n’icubahiro. <verse eid="2CH 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 17:6" />Umutima wiwe warondera inzira z’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>; kandi akuraho ibibanza vyo gusengeramwo vyo mu mataba y’imisozi n’inkingi za Ashera mu Buyuda.<verse eid="2CH 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 17:7" />Mu mwaka ugira gatatu ari ku ngoma atuma abakuru bo mu bamukorera ari bo Beni-Hayili, Obadiya, Zakariya, Netaneli na Mikaya, ngo bigishe mu bisagara vy’i Buyuda. <verse eid="2CH 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 17:8" />Abarungikana n’Abalewi bamwe nka Shemaya, Netaniya, Zebadiya, Asaheli, Shemiramoti, Yehonatani, Adoniya, Tobiya na Tobi-Adoniya, n’abaherezi ari bo Elishama na Yehoramu. <verse eid="2CH 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 17:9" />Bigisha mu Buyuda hose, bitwaje Igitabu c’Ivyagezwe vy’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>; bazunguruka hose mu bisagara vy’i Buyuda bigisha abantu.<verse eid="2CH 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 17:10" />Ubwoba buvuye k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bufata abami bose b’ibihugu bikikije Ubuyuda, ntibigera bubahuka gutera Yehoshafati. <verse eid="2CH 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 17:11" />Abafilisitiya bamwe bazanira Yehoshafati amashikanwa yo kumwisaba hamwe n’ifeza, n’Abarabu bamuzanira imikuku: impfizi z’intama ibihumbi indwi n’amajana indwi n’impene ibihumbi indwi n’amajana indwi.<verse eid="2CH 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 17:12" />Yehoshafati arushaho kuba uwukomeye; yubaka iminara n’ibisagara vy’ububiko mu Buyuda. <verse eid="2CH 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 17:13" />Yari afise ibintu vyinshi yabitse mu bisagara binini vy’i Buyuda, ashira i Yerusalemu ingabo zimenyereye ivyo kugwana. <verse eid="2CH 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 17:14" />Uku ni ko bari barinjiye mu ngabo bakurikije uko imiryango yabo yari iri:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2CH 17:14" />
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 17:14">Mu Bayuda, hari abakuru batwara ingabo igihumbi:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CH 17:14">Adina umukuru w’ingabo, yari kumwe n’ingabo ibihumbi amajana atatu;<verse eid="2CH 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 17:15" />uwakurikira, ni Yehohanani umukuru w’ingabo, yari kumwe n’ingabo ibihumbi amajana abiri na mirongo umunani;<verse eid="2CH 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 17:16" />hagakurikira Amaziya mwene Zikuri, yitangiye igikorwa c’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, yari kumwe n’ingabo ibihumbi amajana abiri.<verse eid="2CH 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 17:17" />Mu Babenyamini:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CH 17:17">Eliyada, umusoda w’umuhizi, yari kumwe n’abagabo bitwaje imiheto n’inkinzo ibihumbi amajana abiri;<verse eid="2CH 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 17:18" />hagakurikira Yehozabadi, yari kumwe n’ingabo zambaye ibigwanisho vy’intambara ibihumbi ijana na mirongo umunani.<verse eid="2CH 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 17:19" />Abo ni bo bari ingabo zakorera umwami, uretse abo yari yararungitse muri vya bisagara bizitijwe inzitiro vyari mu gihugu cose c’i Buyuda.<verse eid="2CH 17:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="2CH 18" />
  <para style="s1">Mikaya aburira Ahabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 18:1" />Muri ico gihe Yehoshafati yari afise itunga ryinshi n’icubahiro cinshi, maze yifatanya na Ahabu biciye mu gusabira umuhungu wiwe umukobwa wa Ahabu. <verse eid="2CH 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 18:2" />Haheze imyaka mikeya, Yehoshafati amanuka i Samariya kuramutsa Ahabu. Maze Ahabu abagira Yehoshafati n’abo bari kumwe intama nyinshi n’inka nyinshi, aca amusaba ngo bajane gutera i Ramoti Gileyadi. <verse eid="2CH 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 18:3" />Ahabu umwami wa Isirayeli abaza Yehoshafati umwami w’i Buyuda ati: “Mbega wojana nanje kugwanya ab’i Ramoti Gileyadi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 18:3">Yehoshafati amwishura ati: “Twe nawe turi bamwe, kandi abantu banje ni abawe; turifatanya namwe muri iyo ntambara.” <verse eid="2CH 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 18:4" />Ariko Yehoshafati yongerako abwira umwami w’Abisirayeli ati: “Reka tubanze tugishe inama <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.”<verse eid="2CH 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 18:5" />Nuko umwami w’Abisirayeli akoranya abavugishwa; bose hamwe bari abagabo amajana ane. Araheza ababaza ati: “Mbega mubona twoja gutera i Ramoti Gileyadi, canke tureke?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 18:5">Barishura bati: “Nimugende, kuko Imana izohatanga mu kuboko kwawe mwami.”<verse eid="2CH 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 18:6" />Ariko Yehoshafati arabaza ati: “Mbega ngaha nta muvugishwa w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> n’umwe akihari twobaza?”<verse eid="2CH 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 18:7" />Umwami w’Abisirayeli yishura Yehoshafati ati: “Haracariho uwundi muvugishwa umwe yotubariza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ariko ndamwanka kuko atigera avugishwa ivyiza kuri jewe, atari ibibi. Ni Mikaya mwene Imula.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 18:7">Yehoshafati aramwishura ati: “Umwami ntakwiye kuvuga atyo.”<verse eid="2CH 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 18:8" />Nuko umwami w’Abisirayeli ahamagara umwe mu batware biwe amubwira ati: “Nyaruka uzane Mikaya mwene Imula.”<verse eid="2CH 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 18:9" />Ahabu umwami w’Abisirayeli na Yehoshafati umwami w’i Buyuda, bari bambaye amakanzu yabo y’inyambarabami, bicara ku ntebe z’ubwami ku mbuga yo gusekurirako ingano iri kw’irembo ry’i Samariya, abavugishwa bavugishirizwa imbere yabo. <verse eid="2CH 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 18:10" />Maze Zedekiya mwene Kenayana yari yarakoze amahembe y’icuma, aca avuga ati: “Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze: ‘Aya ni yo uzokwicisha Abasiriya gushika ubaranduye.’ ”<verse eid="2CH 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 18:11" />Abandi bavugishwa bose na bo nyene bavugishwa ukwo nyene, bati: “Genda utere i Ramoti Gileyadi, uzohatsinda, kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azohatanga mu maboko y’umwami.”<verse eid="2CH 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 18:12" />Ya ntumwa yari yagiye guhamagara Mikaya iramubwira iti: “Raba abandi bavugishwa bose bahurije hamwe nk’umuntu umwe mu kuvugishwa intsinzi y’umwami. Ijambo ryawe rero rize kumera nk’iryabo, uvuge ivyiza.”<verse eid="2CH 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 18:13" />Ariko Mikaya amwishura ati: “Ndahiye uguhoraho kw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ico Imana imbwira ni co nja kuvuga.”<verse eid="2CH 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 18:14" />Ashitse, umwami aramubaza ati: “Mikaya, mbega tuje gutera i Ramoti Gileyadi, canke tureke?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 18:14">Aramwishura ati: “Genda uhatere kandi uzotsinda, kuko hazotangwa mu maboko yawe.”<verse eid="2CH 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 18:15" />Umwami aca amubwira ati: “Nzogeza ryari kukurahiza kugira ngo ntihagire ikindi umbwira atari ukuri mw’izina ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>?”<verse eid="2CH 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 18:16" />Mikaya amwishura ati: “Mu kwerekwa nabonye Abisirayeli bashwiragiye ku misozi nk’intama zitagira umwungere, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aca ambarira ati: ‘Abo bantu ntibagira shebuja. Barungike umwe wese atahe mu rugo rwiwe amahoro.’ ”<verse eid="2CH 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 18:17" />Umwami w’Abisirayeli abarira Yehoshafati ati: “Sinakubwiye ko atigera avugishwa iciza na kimwe kuri jewe, atari ibibi gusa?”<verse eid="2CH 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 18:18" />Mikaya arabandanya ati: “Nuko niwumve ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>: Nabonye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avyagiye ku ntebe yiwe y’ubwami ari kumwe n’ingabo zo mw’ijuru zihagaze i buryo n’i bubamfu bwiwe. <verse eid="2CH 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 18:19" />Maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuga ati: ‘Ni nde yokwosha Ahabu umwami w’Abisirayeli ngo aje gutera i Ramoti Gileyadi kugira ngo aze yicirweyo?’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 18:19">Umwe akavuga ibi, uwundi ibindi. <verse eid="2CH 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 18:20" />Mu nyuma ni ho haza impwemu ihagarara imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, imubwira iti: ‘Jewe nomwosha!’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 18:20">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ayibaza ati: ‘Uzobikora gute?’<verse eid="2CH 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 18:21" />Na yo yishura iti: ‘Nzosohoka mbe impwemu yo kubesha mu kanwa k’abavugishwa biwe bose.’ <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ayibwira ati: ‘Ni vyo, uzoshobora kumwosha! Genda ubikore.’<verse eid="2CH 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 18:22" />None rero, ehe raba <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yashize impwemu yo kubesha mu kanwa k’abavugishwa bawe, kuko yamaze gufata ingingo yo kugusukako ivyago.”<verse eid="2CH 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 18:23" />Nuko Zedekiya mwene Kenayana ava hasi akubita ikofe Mikaya. Amubaza ati: “Iyo mpwemu y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yaciye mu yihe nzira iva kuri jewe iza kuvugana nawe?”<verse eid="2CH 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 18:24" />Mikaya amwishura ati: “Uzobimenya umusi uzobura aho winyegeza, ukajarajara uva mu cumba kimwe uja mu kindi.”<verse eid="2CH 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 18:25" />Umwami w’Abisirayeli atanga itegeko ati: “Nimumufate, mumujane kwa Amoni umukuru w’igisagara no kwa Yowashi umwana w’umwami. <verse eid="2CH 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 18:26" />Mubabwire muti: ‘Umwami avuze ngo: Uyu mugabo nimumushire mw’ibohero, ntihagire ikindi mumugaburira atari umukate n’amazi vy’inticantikize, gushika aho nzogarukira amahoro mvuye ku rugamba.’ ”<verse eid="2CH 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 18:27" />Mikaya na we aca avuga ati: “Niwagaruka amahoro, nzoba ntavugishijwe n’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>!” Yongera abwira abari ngaho ati: “Yemwe bantu mwese, muraba muvyumvise!”<verse eid="2CH 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahabu agwa i Ramoti Gileyadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 18:28" />Nuko umwami w’Abisirayeli na Yehoshafati umwami w’i Buyuda baraduga baja gutera i Ramoti Gileyadi. <verse eid="2CH 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 18:29" />Umwami wa Isirayeli abarira Yehoshafati ati: “Nja kwinjira mu rugamba niyoberanije, ariko wewe ugume wambaye impuzu zawe z’inyambarabami.” Nuko umwami wa Isirayeli ariyoberanya baja ku rugamba.<verse eid="2CH 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 18:30" />Umwami w’i Siriya ategeka abarongora abagwanira ku mikogote yiwe mirongo itatu na babiri ati: “Ntihagire uwundi muntu n’umwe mutera, yaba muto canke mukuru, atari umwami w’Abisirayeli.” <verse eid="2CH 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 18:31" />Ba bakuru b’abagwanira ku mikogote babonye Yehoshafati, baribwira bati: “Nta gukeka, uwu ni we mwami w’Abisirayeli.” Nuko barahindukira ngo bamutere, ariko Yehoshafati arataka, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aramutabara. Imana ibigiza kure yiwe, <verse eid="2CH 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 18:32" />kuko aho abatwara umukogote baboneye ko atari umwami w’Abisirayeli, baciye bareka kumukurikira.<verse eid="2CH 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 18:33" />Ariko umuntu umwe afora umuheto apfa kurasa, aca agema umwami w’Abisirayeli aho ivyuma bimukingira bihurira. Umwami aca abwira uwatwara umukogote wiwe ati: “Hindukira unkure mu rugamba, ndakomeretse.” <verse eid="2CH 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2CH 18:34" />Ariko kuri uwo musi, urugamba rurushiriza gukomera, maze umwami w’Abisirayeli bapfa kumushigikirira aho nyene mu mukogote, aguma ameze nk’uwuhanganye n’Abasiriya kugeza ku mugoroba; maze nko ku kirengazuba aracikana.<verse eid="2CH 18:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="2CH 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 19:1" />Yehoshafati umwami w’i Buyuda atahutse amahoro ku kirimba iwe i Yerusalemu, <verse eid="2CH 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 19:2" />Yehu uwerekwa, mwene Hanani, aja kumusanganira, aca amubwira ati: “Mbega vyari bikwiye ko uja gutabara urya muntu mubi ugakunda abansi b’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>? Kubera ivyo, wihamagariye uburake bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="2CH 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 19:3" />Ariko, hariho iciza kiri muri wewe, kuko wakuye inkingi za Ashera mu gihugu kandi ugashira umutima wawe ku kurondera Imana.”<verse eid="2CH 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yehoshafati ashinga abacamanza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 19:4" />Yehoshafati aba i Yerusalemu, maze aragenda aja mu bantu baba i Berisheba mu misozi y’Abefurayimu abagarukana k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana ya ba sekuruza. <verse eid="2CH 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 19:5" />Ashiraho abacamanza mu gihugu, mu bisagara vyose bizitijwe inzitiro vy’i Buyuda. <verse eid="2CH 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 19:6" />Ababwira ati: “Mumenye neza ivyo mukora, kuko mutariko mucira imanza abantu gusa, ariko muzica ku bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, kandi ari kumwe namwe igihe muzica. <verse eid="2CH 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 19:7" />Nuko rero nimwubahe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Mwitonde mu guca imanza, kuko k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu nta kurenganya canke guca iza ngondagonde, canke kurya ibiturire.”<verse eid="2CH 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 19:8" />N’i Yerusalemu na ho nyene, Yehoshafati ashinga bamwe mu Balewi, abaherezi n’abakuru bo mu miryango y’Abisirayeli, ngo bakoreshe ivyagezwe vy’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> mu gutatura amatati; kandi baba i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 19:9" />Abaha aya mategeko ati: “Muze mukore mu bwizigirwa n’imitima yanyu yose, mwubaha <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="2CH 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 19:10" />Mu manza zose abavukanyi banyu b’Abisirayeli baba mu bisagara bazobazanira, zaba ari iz’amaraso canke ibindi bijanye n’ivyagezwe, amabwirizwa, amategeko n’ivyashinzwe, muze mubabwire ko badakwiye gucumura k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>; bitari uko uburake bwiwe buzobazako mwebwe n’abavukanyi banyu. Muze mukore mutyo kugira ngo ntimucumure.<verse eid="2CH 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 19:11" />Amariya umuherezi mukuru ni we azobarongora mu bintu vyose vyerekeye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Zebadiya mwene Ishimayeli, umukuru w’umuryango wa Yuda, ni we azobarongora mu vyerekeye intwaro. Abalewi na bo bazoba abaraba ko ubutungane busasagaye. Mukorane umwete, kandi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aze abane n’abazokora neza.”<verse eid="2CH 19:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="2CH 20" />
  <para style="s1">Yehoshafati anesha Abanyamowabu n’Abamoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 20:1" />Inyuma y’ivyo, Abanyamowabu n’Abamoni hamwe n’ab’i Mayoni bamwe, baja gutera Yehoshafati.<verse eid="2CH 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 20:2" />Haza abantu babwira Yehoshafati bati: “Ingabo nyinshi ziraje kugutera zivuye muri Edomu, hakurya y’Ikiyaga c’Umunyu. Kandi bamaze gushika i Hazazoni-Tamari” ari ho Eni-Gedi. <verse eid="2CH 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 20:3" />Yehoshafati aratinya, aca ahitamwo gusiguza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, kandi ategeka ko Abayuda bose bisonzesha. <verse eid="2CH 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 20:4" />Abantu b’i Buyuda bakoranira hamwe ngo barondere <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>; kandi bari bavuye mu bisagara vyose vy’i Buyuda baje kurondera <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="2CH 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 20:5" />Maze Yehoshafati ahagarara mw’ikoraniro ry’Abayuda n’ab’i Yerusalemu ku Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, imbere y’imbuga nshasha, <verse eid="2CH 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 20:6" />avuga ati:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2CH 20:6">“Yewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mana ya ba sogokuruza, mbega si wewe Mana yo mw’ijuru? Uganza ubwami bwose n’amahanga yose. Ubushobozi n’inkomezi biri mu kiganza cawe, kandi nta woshobora kuguhagarara imbere ngo muhangane. <verse eid="2CH 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 20:7" />Yewe Mana yacu, mbega ntiwirukanye ababa muri iki gihugu imbere y’abantu bawe b’Abisirayeli ukagiha uruvyaro rwa Aburahamu umukunzi wawe? <verse eid="2CH 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 20:8" />Barakibayemwo kandi bacubakamwo Ingoro yitirirwa Izina ryawe bavuga bati: <verse eid="2CH 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 20:9" />‘Icago nicadutera, yaba inkota yo kuducira urubanza, canke akaranda, canke ikigoyi, tuzohagarara imbere yawe imbere y’iyi Ngoro yitirirwa izina ryawe, maze tugutakambire mu ngorane zacu, nawe uzotwumva udukize.’<verse eid="2CH 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 20:10" />None hariho abantu bavuye mu Bamoni, i Mowabu no ku musozi Seyiri, aho wankiye Abisirayeli ko bahatera igihe bava muri Egiputa; maze bica bituma bakevya ngo ntibabahonye. <verse eid="2CH 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 20:11" />Ariko raba ivyo batwishuye. Baje kudusohora ahantu waduhaye ngo habe inyegu yacu. <verse eid="2CH 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 20:12" />Ewe Mana yacu, mbega ntiwobacira urubanza? Kuko tudafise ubushobozi bwo guhangana n’iryo sinzi ry’ingabo zije kudutera. Ntituzi ico twokora, ariko amaso yacu tuyahanze wewe.”<verse eid="2CH 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 20:13" />Abayuda bose, abagore babo n’abana babo, abakuru n’abato, bahagarara ngaho imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="2CH 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 20:14" />Nuko Mpwemu w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aza kuri umwe mu bari muri iryo koraniro. Izina ryiwe ni Yahaziyeli mwene Zakariya, Zakariya wa Benaya, Benaya wa Yeyiyeli, Yeyiyeli wa Mataniya, Umulewi akomoka kuri Asafu.<verse eid="2CH 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 20:15" />Avuga ati: “Nimwumve, mwami Yehoshafati namwe ababa i Buyuda n’i Yerusalemu mwese! Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ababwiye: ‘Ntimutinye canke ngo mwihebure kubera izo ngabo nyinshi. Kuko intambara si iyanyu, ni iy’Imana. <verse eid="2CH 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 20:16" />Ejo muze mumanuke mubategere. Bazoba bariko baraduga baciye ku kadugo k’i Zizi, namwe muzobasanga bari aho ikiyaya kigarukira, mu bugaragwa bw’i Yeruweli. <verse eid="2CH 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 20:17" />Ntimuzorinda kugwana iyi ntambara. Muze mutonde urugamba muhagarare ku ruhande rwanyu; mushikame kugira ngo murabe ugutabarwa <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azobaha, mwebwe Abayuda n’ab’i Yerusalemu. Ntimutinye, ntimwihebure. Ejo muze musohoke muhangane na bo; kandi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azoba ari kumwe namwe.’ ”<verse eid="2CH 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 20:18" />Yehoshafati arunama ashika hasi, kandi n’Abayuda n’ab’i Yerusalemu barunama imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, baramusenga. <verse eid="2CH 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 20:19" />Maze Abalewi bamwe bo mu Bakohati no mu Bakorahi barahaguruka, bahimbaza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana y’Abisirayeli n’ijwi rirenga.<verse eid="2CH 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 20:20" />Mu gitondo kare, baragenda batumbereye ubugaragwa bw’i Tekowa. Bagisohoka, Yehoshafati arahagarara avuga ati: “Nimunyumvirize, yemwe Bayuda namwe ababa i Yerusalemu! Nimwizere <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu muzohagarara mushikamye; nimwizigire abavugishwa na we muzoronka intsinzi.” <verse eid="2CH 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 20:21" />Amaze kubonana n’abantu, Yehoshafati aca ashiraho abantu bo kuririmbira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> no guhimbaza ubwiza bw’ukwera kwiwe, bagenda bararirimba bari imbere y’ingabo bavuga bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 20:21">“Nimushimire <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CH 20:21">kuko urukundo rwiwe rwamaho ibihe bidashira.”<verse eid="2CH 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 20:22" />Bagitangura kuririmba no guhimbaza, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> atega imitego ba Bamoni n’Abanyamowabu n’abo mu misozi y’i Seyiri bari baje gutera i Buyuda baca baratsindwa. <verse eid="2CH 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 20:23" />Abamoni n’Abanyamowabu bava hasi bagwanya abo mu misozi y’i Seyiri ngo babice babamare. Bahejeje kwicisha inkota ab’i Seyiri, baca barasubiranamwo, baricana.<verse eid="2CH 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 20:24" />Abayuda bashitse aho umuntu abona neza mu bugaragwa, baravye za ngabo nyinshi, babona ni ibiziga birambaraye hasi gusa; ata n’umwe yarokotse. <verse eid="2CH 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 20:25" />Nuko Yehoshafati n’abantu biwe baja gusahura ivyo bari bafise, basangamwo ibigwanisho vyinshi n’impuzu n’ibindi bikoresho vy’igiciro; biba vyinshi ku buryo batashobora kubitwarira rimwe. Kubera ko vyari vyinshi cane, bamaze imisi itatu yose bavyegeranya. <verse eid="2CH 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 20:26" />Ku musi ugira kane bakoranira mu kiyaya c’i Beraka, bahimbaza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Ni co gituma citwa ikiyaya c’i Beraka gushika uwu musi.<verse eid="2CH 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 20:27" />Maze Abayuda bose n’ab’i Yerusalemu, barongowe na Yehoshafati, basubira i Yerusalemu banezerewe, kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yabahaye kwitamba hejuru abansi babo. <verse eid="2CH 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 20:28" />Binjira i Yerusalemu, baja mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bavuza inanga n’amakembe n’inzamba.<verse eid="2CH 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 20:29" />Ubwoba buvuye ku Mana bufata ubwami n’ibihugu bibakikuje, bamaze kwumva ingene <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yagwanije abansi b’Abisirayeli. <verse eid="2CH 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 20:30" />Maze ubwami bwa Yehoshafati buba amahoro, kuko Imana yiwe yari yamuhaye impore ku mpande zose.<verse eid="2CH 20:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iherezo ry’ubwami bwa Yehoshafati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 20:31" />Nuko Yehoshafati aganza i Buyuda. Yari afise imyaka mirongo itatu n’itanu igihe yimikwa ngo abe umwami w’i Buyuda, maze aganza imyaka mirongo ibiri n’itanu ari i Yerusalemu. Nyina wiwe yitwa Azuba umukobwa wa Shiluhi. <verse eid="2CH 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 20:32" />Agendera mu nzira za se Asa, kandi ntiyakikama ngo azivemwo; akora ibigororotse mu nyonga z’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="2CH 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 20:33" />Ariko ntiyakuraho ibibanza vyo gusengeramwo ibigirwamana biri ku mataba y’imisozi, kandi abantu ntibari bwashire imitima yabo ku Mana ya ba sekuruza.<verse eid="2CH 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2CH 20:34" />Ibindi vyabaye ku ngoma ya Yehoshafati, uhereye ku ntango ugashika ku mpera, vyanditswe mu gitabu c’ivyagenda biraba canditswe na Yehu mwene Hanani, bikaba biri no mu gitabu c’abami ba Isirayeli.<verse eid="2CH 20:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2CH 20:35" />Mu nyuma Yehoshafati umwami w’i Buyuda agirana isezerano na Ahaziya umwami w’Abisirayeli, kandi uwo yari umwami mubi. <verse eid="2CH 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2CH 20:36" />Yemeranya na we ngo bubake amato yo kuja i Tarushishi kuzana ibidandazwa. Bamaze kwubaka i Eziyoni Geberi, <verse eid="2CH 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2CH 20:37" />Eliyezeri mwene Dodavahu w’i Maresha avugishwa aburira Yehoshafati, avuga ati: “Ko wagiriraniye isezerano na Ahaziya, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azosambura ivyo wubatse.” Ayo mato aca arameneka ntiyashobora kuja i Tarushishi.<verse eid="2CH 20:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="2CH 21" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 21:1" />Maze Yehoshafati arapfa, ahamvya ba sekuruza; ahambwa mu Gisagara ca sekuruza Dawidi. Umuhungu wiwe Yehoramu amusubirira ku ngoma. <verse eid="2CH 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 21:2" />Abavukanyi ba Yehoramu, bene Yehoshafati, bari Azariya, Yehiyeli, Zakariya, Azariyahu, Mikayeli na Shefatiya. Abo bose bari bene Yehoshafati umwami w’Abisirayeli. <verse eid="2CH 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 21:3" />Se yari yarabagabiye ibintu vyinshi bigizwe n’ifeza n’inzahabu n’ibikoresho vy’agaciro; abaha n’ibisagara bizitijwe inzitiro vy’i Buyuda. Ariko yari yahaye Yehoramu ubwami kuko yari imfura yiwe.<verse eid="2CH 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yehoramu umwami w’i Buyuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 21:4" />Yehoramu amaze kwigira agakomeye ku bwami bwari ubwa se, yicisha inkota abo bavukana bose hamwe n’indongozi zose z’Abisirayeli. <verse eid="2CH 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 21:5" />Yehoramu yari afise imyaka mirongo itatu n’ibiri igihe yimikwa ngo abe umwami. Amara imyaka umunani aganza ari i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 21:6" />Agendera mu ngeso z’abami b’Abisirayeli, nk’uko ab’inzu ya Ahabu bakora, kuko yarongoye umukobwa wa Ahabu. Akora ibibi mu nyonga z’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="2CH 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 21:7" />Ariko kubera isezerano <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yaragiraniye na Dawidi, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ntiyashaka guherengeteza umuryango wa Yuda. Yari yarasezeranye kugumizaho itara ryiwe n’uruvyaro rwiwe ibihe vyose.<verse eid="2CH 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 21:8" />Mu gihe Yehoramu yari ku ngoma, Abanyedomu bagarariza Abayuda, biyimikira umwami wabo. <verse eid="2CH 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 21:9" />Maze Yehoramu ajayo ari kumwe n’intwazangabo ziwe, n’imikogote yiwe yose. Abanyedomu baramukikuza hamwe n’iyo mikogote n’abayigendesha, ariko mw’ijoro arahaguruka, abacamwo aragenda. <verse eid="2CH 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 21:10" />Kuva ico gihe, Abanyedomu baca barikukira, bikura ku Buyuda gushika n’ubu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 21:10">N’igisagara c’i Libuna na co nyene gica kiragarariza cikura ku Buyuda, kuko Yehoramu yari yataye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya ba sekuruza. <verse eid="2CH 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 21:11" />Yari yarubatse n’ibibanza vyo gusengeramwo ku misozi y’i Buyuda, kandi atuma abantu b’i Yerusalemu bihumanya, azimiza Abayuda.<verse eid="2CH 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 21:12" />Yehoramu aronka ikete rivuye ku wavugishwa n’Imana Eliya, ryavuga riti:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2CH 21:12">“Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana ya so Dawidi, avuze: ‘Ntiwagendeye mu nzira za so Yehoshafati canke iza Asa umwami w’i Buyuda. <verse eid="2CH 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 21:13" />Ariko wagendeye mu nzira z’abami b’Abisirayeli, kandi wazimije Abayuda n’ab’i Yerusalemu ubajana mu nzira zo kwihumanisha ubusambanyi, nk’uko inzu ya Ahabu yabikoze. Kandi wishe abavukanyi bawe bwite, abo mu nzu ya so, abantu bakurusha kuba beza. <verse eid="2CH 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 21:14" />None rero nawe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> agira yice abantu bawe, abahungu bawe, abagore bawe, aherengeteze n’ibintu vyawe vyose. <verse eid="2CH 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 21:15" />Wewe ubwawe uzogwara ingwara idakira yo mu mara, igende ikura gushika aho amara yawe azosohoka hanze.’ ”<verse eid="2CH 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 21:16" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ateza ubwansi hagati ya Yehoramu n’Abafilisitiya n’Abarabu babana n’Abanyetiyopiya. <verse eid="2CH 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 21:17" />Batera i Buyuda barahafata, banyaga ivyiza vyose basanze mu ngoro y’umwami, hamwe n’abahungu biwe n’abagore biwe. Nta muhungu n’umwe bamusigarije atari Ahaziya yari muto muri bo.<verse eid="2CH 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 21:18" />Inyuma y’ivyo vyose, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ateza Yehoramu ingwara idakira y’amara. <verse eid="2CH 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 21:19" />Iyo ngwara igenda ikura, mu mpera y’umwaka ugira kabiri, amara yiwe arasohoka kubera iyo ngwara, maze apfa ari mu bubabare bwinshi. Abantu biwe ntibamucanira umuriro ngo baturire ibimota neza vyo kumuhesha icubahiro nk’uko babikoreye ba sekuruza.<verse eid="2CH 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 21:20" />Yehoramu yari afise imyaka mirongo itatu n’ibiri igihe yimikwa ngo abe umwami, maze aganza imyaka umunani ari i Yerusalemu. Apfuye nta n’umwe yababajwe n’urupfu rwiwe. Nuko ahambwa mu Gisagara ca Dawidi, ariko ntiyashirwa mu mva z’abami.<verse eid="2CH 21:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="2CH 22" />
  <para style="s1">Ahaziya aba umwami w’i Buyuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 22:1" />Ab’i Yerusalemu bimika Ahaziya umuhererezi wa Yehoramu, aba umwami mu gishingo ca se, kuko bakuru biwe bose bari bishwe bahitanywe na ca gitero c’ingabo zazananye n’Abarabu zibatsinda aho bashagaje. Nuko Ahaziya mwene Yehoramu umwami w’i Buyuda atangura kuganza.<verse eid="2CH 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 22:2" />Ahaziya yari afise imyaka mirongo ibiri n’ibiri igihe yaba umwami, aganza umwaka umwe ari i Yerusalemu. Nyina yitwa Ataliya, umwuzukuru wa Omuri.<verse eid="2CH 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 22:3" />Na we nyene agendera mu ngeso z’ab’inzu ya Ahabu, kuko nyina yamwosha gukora ibibi. <verse eid="2CH 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 22:4" />Akora ibibi mu nyonga z’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, nk’uko ab’inzu ya Ahabu bakora, kuko se amaze gupfa ari bo babaye abahanuzi biwe, maze bimukwegera kuranduka. <verse eid="2CH 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 22:5" />Yongera akurikiza inama bamugiriye igihe yajana na Yoramu mwene Ahabu umwami w’Abisirayeli kugwanya Hazayeli umwami w’i Siriya i Ramoti Gileyadi. Abasiriya bakomeretsa Yoramu; <verse eid="2CH 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 22:6" />aca asubira i Yezireyeli kugira ngo akirireyo inguma yakomerekeye i Ramoti mu ntambara agwana na Hazayeli umwami w’i Siriya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 22:6">Nuko Ahaziya mwene Yehoramu umwami w’i Buyuda aramanuka aja i Yezireyeli gusuhuza Yoramu mwene Ahabu kuko yari yarakomeretse.<verse eid="2CH 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 22:7" />Muri uko kuja kumusuhuza, Imana yari yateguye gukuraho Ahaziya. Ahaziya ashitse, asohokana na Yoramu ngo baje gusanganira Yehu mwene Nimushi, uwo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yimikishije amavuta ngo aze akureho ab’inzu ya Ahabu. <verse eid="2CH 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 22:8" />Igihe Yehu yariko araherengeteza ab’inzu ya Ahabu, ahura n’abaganwa b’i Buyuda n’abahungu b’incuti za Ahaziya bakorera Ahaziya, maze arabica. <verse eid="2CH 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 22:9" />Nuko yinjira mu nzu kurondera Ahaziya, abantu ba Yehu bamufatira aho yari yinyegeje i Samariya. Bamuzanira Yehu aca aramwica. Baca baramuhamba, kuko bavuga bati: “Yari mwene Yehoshafati, yarondera <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> n’umutima wiwe wose.” Nuko ntihasigara umuntu n’umwe mu bo mu nzu kwa Ahaziya afise ububasha bukwiye bwo kuba umwami.<verse eid="2CH 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivya Ataliya na Yowashi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 22:10" />Ataliya nyina wa Ahaziya abonye ko umuhungu wiwe apfuye, atangura kwica abana b’umwami bose bo mu muryango wa Yuda. <verse eid="2CH 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 22:11" />Ariko Yehosheba, umukobwa w’umwami Yehoramu, afata Yowashi mwene Ahaziya aramunyuruza amukuye mu bandi bana b’umwami bagira bicwe, amunyegeza mu cumba co kuryamamwo ari kumwe n’umurezi wiwe. Kubera ko Yehosheba, umukobwa w’umwami Yehoramu akaba n’umugore w’umuherezi Yehoyada yari mushiki wa Ahaziya, vyatumye ashobora kunyegeza uwo mwana kugira ngo Ataliya ntamwice. <verse eid="2CH 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 22:12" />Agumana na bo anyegejwe mu Ngoro y’Imana kumara imyaka itandatu Ataliya ari we atwara ico gihugu.<verse eid="2CH 22:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="2CH 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 23:1" />Mu mwaka ugira indwi Yehoyada arahaguruka, atumako intwazangabo zitwara abasoda ijanijana ari bo Azariya mwene Yerohamu, Ishimayeli mwene Yehohanani, Azariya mwene Obedi, Mayaseya mwene Adaya, na Elishafati mwene Zikuri, agiriranira isezerano na bo. <verse eid="2CH 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 23:2" />Bakwiragira hose mu Buyuda, bakoranya Abalewi n’abakuru b’imiryango y’Abisirayeli baraza bavuye mu bisagara vyose. Bashitse i Yerusalemu, <verse eid="2CH 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 23:3" />ikoraniro ryose rigiriranira isezerano n’umwami mu Ngoro y’Imana.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 23:3">Yehoyada arababwira ati: “Nguwu umwana w’umwami! Uwu ni we azoganza nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabisezeraniye uruvyaro rwa Dawidi. <verse eid="2CH 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 23:4" />Ibi ni vyo mukwiye gukora: igice kimwe ca gatatu ca mwebwe abaherezi n’Abalewi muzoba muramukiwe gukora kw’Isabato muze mucungere imiryango, <verse eid="2CH 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 23:5" />ikindi ca gatatu canyu kize kije ku ngoro y’umwami, ica gatatu ca nyuma kije kw’Irembo ry’Umushinge, maze abasigaye bose baze baje mu kibuga c’Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="2CH 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 23:6" />Ntihaze hagire uwinjira mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> atari abaherezi n’Abalewi bazoba bari ku gikorwa cabo. Abo bo bazoshobora kwinjira kuko barobanuwe, ariko abandi bose baze bitondere ico <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabashinze. <verse eid="2CH 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 23:7" />Abalewi bazohagarare bakikuje umwami, umuntu wese afise ibigwanisho mu maboko yiwe. Uwuzogerageza kwinjira mu Ngoro wese aze yicwe. Muzogume hafi y’umwami aho azoja hose.”<verse eid="2CH 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 23:8" />Abalewi n’abantu bose b’i Buyuda bakora nk’uko Yehoyada umuherezi yabibabwiye. Umwe wese ahitana abantu biwe, baba abari baramukiwe kuja gukora kw’Isabato n’abari bagombowe kuko Yehoyada umuherezi atemereye n’umwe muri iyo migwi gutaha. <verse eid="2CH 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 23:9" />Maze umuherezi Yehoyada aca aha intwazangabo z’ingabo ijanijana amacumu n’inkinzo nini na ntoya vyahora ari ivy’umwami Dawidi vyari bibitswe mu Ngoro y’Imana. <verse eid="2CH 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 23:10" />Ashira mu bibanza abantu bose, umwe wese afise ikigwanisho mu minwe, bakikuza umwami, hafi y’igicaniro n’Ingoro, kuva mu bumanuko gushika mu buraruko bw’Ingoro.<verse eid="2CH 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 23:11" />Yehoyada n’abahungu biwe basohokana umwana w’umwami bamwambika urugori; bamuzanira n’ikopi y’ivyagezwe vy’Imana batangaza ko abaye umwami. Bamusukako amavuta, baca barasemerera bati: “Umwami nahangame!”<verse eid="2CH 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 23:12" />Maze Ataliya yumvise urwamo rw’abantu bashimagiza umwami, aca aja iyo bari mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="2CH 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 23:13" />Aravye, abona umwami ahagaze hafi y’inkingi mu rwinjiriro. Abatware n’abavuza inzamba bari i ruhande yiwe, abantu bose bo mu gihugu banezerewe bavuza inzamba, abaririmvyi na bo n’ibicurarangisho vyabo barongora abantu mu guhimbaza Imana. Nuko Ataliya yitaburirako impuzu arasemerera ati: “Uwo ni umugararizo! Uwo ni umugararizo!”<verse eid="2CH 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 23:14" />Umuherezi Yehoyada aca abwira intwazangabo zitwara abasoda ijanijana ati: “Nimumusohore hanze mumucishe hagati y’imirongo y’ingabo kandi mwicishe inkota uwomukurikira wese.” Kuko umuherezi yari yavuze ati: “Ntimumwicire mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.” <verse eid="2CH 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 23:15" />Nuko baramufata bamucisha mw’Irembo ry’Amafarasi rija ku mbuga y’ingoro y’umwami, bamwiciraho.<verse eid="2CH 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 23:16" />Yehoyada aca ashiraho isezerano ko we n’abantu n’umwami bazoba abantu b’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="2CH 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 23:17" />Abantu bose baca baja ku ngoro ya Bayali barayisenyagura. Basitagura ibicaniro n’ibigirwamana, bafata Matani umuherezi wa Bayali, bamwicira imbere y’ibicaniro.<verse eid="2CH 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 23:18" />Nuko Yehoyada ashiraho abantu barinda Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bavuye mu baherezi b’Abalewi, abo Dawidi yari yarajeje iyo Ngoro, ngo bashikanire <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ibimazi vyo guturirwa nk’uko vyanditswe mu Vyagezwe vya Mose; maze bakabikora banezerewe, baririmba, nk’uko Dawidi yabitegetse. <verse eid="2CH 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 23:19" />Yongera ashiraho abo kurinda amarembo ku miryango y’Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> kugira ngo ntihagire uwahumanijwe n’ikintu na kimwe yokwinjira.<verse eid="2CH 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 23:20" />Ajana za ntwazangabo z’abasoda ijanijana, abubahwa, abatware n’abantu bose bo muri ico gihugu, amanukana umwami amukuye mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Baja ku kirimba baciye kw’Irembo ryo Haruguru, aca yicarika umwami ku ntebe yiwe y’ubwami. <verse eid="2CH 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 23:21" />Abari aho bose bagira umunezero, n’igisagara kiba amahoro kuko Ataliya yari yicishijwe inkota.<verse eid="2CH 23:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="2CH 24" />
  <para style="s1">Yowashi asanura Ingoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 24:1" />Yowashi yari afise imyaka indwi igihe yaba umwami, aca aganza imyaka mirongo ine ari i Yerusalemu. Nyina wiwe yitwa Zibiya w’i Berisheba. <verse eid="2CH 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 24:2" />Yowashi akora ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abona ko ari vyiza mu myaka yose Yehoyada yamaze ari umuherezi. <verse eid="2CH 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 24:3" />Yehoyada amuhitiramwo abagore babiri, maze avyara abahungu n’abakobwa.<verse eid="2CH 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 24:4" />Haciye igihe Yowashi afata ingingo yo gusanura Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="2CH 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 24:5" />Akoranya abaherezi n’Abalewi arababwira ati: “Nimuje mu bisagara vy’i Buyuda mwegeranye amahera ategekanijwe kurihwa uko umwaka utashe mu Bisirayeli bose kugira ngo dusanure Ingoro y’Imana yacu. Mubikore ubu nyene.” Ariko Abalewi ntibaca babikora ubwo nyene.<verse eid="2CH 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 24:6" />Nuko umwami atumako Yehoyada umuherezi mukuru amubwira ati: “Ni kuki utabwiye Abalewi ngo baje mu bisagara vyose vy’i Buyuda n’i Yerusalemu kwegeranya amatagisi yose yategetswe na Mose umusavyi w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ngo atangwe n’ikoraniro ry’Abisirayeli ku bw’Ihema ry’Ibonaniro?”<verse eid="2CH 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 24:7" />Kuko abahungu ba wa mugore mubi Ataliya batobaguye Ingoro y’Imana bagafata ibintu vyose vyari vyaragizwe inyegu y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bakaja kubikoreshereza Bayali.<verse eid="2CH 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 24:8" />Nuko umwami ategeka ko bakora isandugu bakayishira hafi y’umuryango w’Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="2CH 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 24:9" />Hanyuma baca bamenyesha Abayuda n’ab’i Yerusalemu bose ko bazanira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> itagisi Mose umusavyi w’Imana yari yarategetse Abisirayeli mu bugaragwa. <verse eid="2CH 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 24:10" />Abakuru bose n’abantu bose bazana amashikanwa yabo babikunze, bakayakororera muri iyo sandugu gushika aho yuzura. <verse eid="2CH 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 24:11" />Igihe cose iyo sandugu yaba yuzuye, Abalewi baca bayishira abanyabigega b’umwami. Umunyamabanga w’umwami n’umukozi w’umuherezi mukuru baca baza bagacuranura iyo sandugu bakayisubiza mu kibanza cayo hafi y’umuryango w’Ingoro. Bakora batyo ubudasiba maze begeranya amahera menshi. <verse eid="2CH 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 24:12" />Umwami na Yehoyada bafata ayo mahera bayaha abantu bakurikirana ivyo gusanura iyo ngoro. Baciye bashiraho abubatsi b’impome n’abamanika ngo basanure Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, hamwe n’abahinga bacura ivyuma n’ibikozwe mu butare bw’umwakaka vyo kuyisanura.<verse eid="2CH 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 24:13" />Abo bantu bashinzwe ico gikorwa batangura gukora, kandi ibikorwa vyo kuyisanura bigenda neza kuko babikurikirana. Basubiramwo Ingoro y’Imana bayigira nk’uko yari imeze ubwa mbere barayikomeza. <verse eid="2CH 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 24:14" />Bahejeje, bazanira umwami na Yehoyada amahera yasigaye, baca bayakoreshamwo ivyo mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>: ivyo bakoresha mu Ngoro no mu bimazi vyo guturirwa n’umuriro, hamwe n’amasahani n’ibindi vy’inzahabu n’ifeza. Mu gihe cose Yehoyada yabayeho, ibimazi vyo guturirwa vyama bishikanirwa <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ubudasiba.<verse eid="2CH 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 24:15" />Ico gihe Yehoyada yari ashaje amaze imyaka myinshi, maze apfa yisaziye neza amaze imyaka ijana na mirongo itatu. <verse eid="2CH 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 24:16" />Ahambwa hamwe n’abami mu Gisagara ca Dawidi, ku bw’ivyiza yari yarakoze mu Bisirayeli, akongera akabikorera Imana n’Ingoro yayo.<verse eid="2CH 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivyaha vya Yowashi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 24:17" />Yehoyada amaze gupfa, abakuru b’i Buyuda baza kwunamira umwami, na we arabumviriza. <verse eid="2CH 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 24:18" />Baheba kuja mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana ya ba sekuruza, ariko basenga inkingi za Ashera n’ibindi bigirwamana. Kubera ico caha cabo, uburake bw’Imana buza ku Bayuda n’ab’i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 24:19" />Naho <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yatumye abavugishwa biwe kuri abo bantu ngo babagarukane kuri we, kandi naho babagirije ibibi bakora, ntibabumviye.<verse eid="2CH 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 24:20" />Nuko Mpwemu w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aza kuri Zakariya mwene Yehoyada umuherezi. Ahagarara imbere y’abantu avuga ati: “Ibi ni vyo Imana ivuze, ngo: ‘Ni kuki mwihaye kugarariza amabwirizwa y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>? Ntaco muzoshikako. Kubera ko mwahevye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, na we arabahevye.’ ”<verse eid="2CH 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 24:21" />Ariko baja inama yo kumugirira nabi; maze umwami ategeka ko bamuterera amabuye ku mbuga y’Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> agapfa. <verse eid="2CH 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 24:22" />Umwami Yowashi ntiyibuka urukundo Yehoyada se wa Zakariya yari yaramweretse, ariko yica umuhungu wiwe. Igihe Zakariya yariko aracikana, avuga ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aze arabe ivyo mukoze, azobibaharureko.”<verse eid="2CH 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 24:23" />Umwaka uheze, ingabo z’i Siriya ziza gutera Yowashi; zitera i Buyuda n’i Yerusalemu, bica abakuru baho bose. Barungikira umwami wabo i Damasiko ivyo basahuye vyose. <verse eid="2CH 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 24:24" />Naho ingabo z’Abasiriya zari zaje ari nke, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> agabura mu maboko yabo ingabo zibasumvya ubwinshi z’Abayuda. Kubera ko Abayuda bari barahevye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana ya ba sekuruza, ni co catumye urubanza Imana yaciriye Yowashi rumushikako. <verse eid="2CH 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 24:25" />Abo Basiriya bagiye, basize Yowashi yakomeretse cane. Abakuru bakora i bwami bagira inama yo kumwica kuko yishe mwene Yehoyada umuherezi, baca bamutsinda mu buriri aho yari aryamye. Nuko arapfa, ahambwa mu Gisagara ca Dawidi, ariko ntibamuhamba mu mva z’abami.<verse eid="2CH 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 24:26" />Abamugiriye inama bari Zabadi, umuhungu w’umugore yitwa Shimeyati w’Umwamonikazi, hamwe na Yehozabadi, umuhungu w’umugore yitwa Shimurite w’Umunyamowabukazi. <verse eid="2CH 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 24:27" />Inkuru z’abahungu ba Yowashi, ivyavugishijwe vyinshi kuri we, n’ivyerekeye isanurwa ry’Ingoro y’Imana vyose vyanditswe mu gitabu c’abami. Maze Amaziya umuhungu wiwe amusubirira ku ngoma, aba umwami mu gishingo ciwe.<verse eid="2CH 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="2CH 25" />
  <para style="s1">Amaziya aba umwami w’i Buyuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 25:1" />Amaziya yari afise imyaka mirongo ibiri n’itanu igihe yimikwa ngo abe umwami, aca aganza imyaka mirongo ibiri n’icenda ari i Yerusalemu. Nyina wiwe yitwa Yehoyadini, w’i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 25:2" />Akora ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abona ko ari vyiza mu nyonga ziwe, ariko ntiyabikorana umutima wiwe wose. <verse eid="2CH 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 25:3" />Amaze gukomeza ubwami bwiwe, aca afata abatware bishe umwami ari we se arabica. <verse eid="2CH 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 25:4" />Ariko ntiyica abana babo, kuko yubashe ijambo ry’Uhoraho ryanditswe mu Gitabu c’Ivyagezwe vya Mose rivuga riti: “Ntihaze hagire umuvyeyi yicwa azira abana biwe, canke abana ngo bicwe bazira abavyeyi babo, umwe wese azozire ivyaha vyiwe.”<verse eid="2CH 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 25:5" />Amaziya atumako Abayuda bose ngo bakoranire hamwe, abashira mu migwi akurikije imiryango yabo, abaha abakuru b’ingabo igihumbi n’abatwara ijanijana, i Buyuda n’i Bubenyamini hose. Maze agira rusansuma rw’abafise imyaka mirongo ibiri canke irenga asanga hari abagabo ibihumbi amajana atatu bashobora kuja ku rugamba, kandi bashobora no gukoresha icumu n’inkinzo. <verse eid="2CH 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 25:6" />Yongera arondera abandi bagwanyi b’abacangero ibihumbi ijana bavuye mu Bisirayeli, abahemba italanto ijana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilo 3.750.</char></note> z’ifeza.<verse eid="2CH 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 25:7" />Ariko umuntu w’Imana aza aho ari, aramubwira amubwira ati: “Yewe mwami, izi ngabo zivuye mu Bisirayeli ntuzijane ku rugamba, kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> atari kumwe n’Abisirayeli canke n’umuntu n’umwe wo mu Befurayimu. <verse eid="2CH 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 25:8" />Kandi niwapfa kujana na bo, naho wogenda ukagwana n’ubuhizi bwinshi ku rugamba, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azotuma utsindwa imbere y’umwansi, kuko Imana ifise ububasha bwo gutuma utsinda canke utsindwa.”<verse eid="2CH 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 25:9" />Amaziya abaza uwo muntu w’Imana ati: “None ivya za talanto ijana nahemvye ba bagwanyi b’Abisirayeli bizogenda gute?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 25:9">Uwo muntu w’Imana amwishura ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ashobora kuguha ibirengeye ivyo cane.”<verse eid="2CH 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 25:10" />Nuko Amaziya aca afata izo ngabo zari zaje zivuye mu Befurayimu azirungika iwabo. Bituma bashavurira Abayuda, baca basubira iwabo bashangashiwe cane.<verse eid="2CH 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 25:11" />Maze Amaziya arinanata, aca atwara ingabo ziwe mu Kiyaya c’Umunyu, aho yiciye abantu b’i Seyiri ibihumbi cumi. <verse eid="2CH 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 25:12" />Ingabo z’i Buyuda zongera gufata mpiri abandi ibihumbi cumi, babadugana hejuru ku kimanga c’igitandara, maze babatembagariza mu mwonga, bose baravunagurika, barapfa.<verse eid="2CH 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 25:13" />Muri ico gihe, za ngabo Amaziya yasubiza inyuma ntazemerere kujana na we mu ntambara, zitera ibisagara vy’i Buyuda kuva i Samariya gushika i Beti-Horoni. Zica abantu ibihumbi bitatu, zihasahura n’ibintu vyinshi cane.<verse eid="2CH 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 25:14" />Amaziya agarutse avuye kwica ba Banyedomu, azana ibigirwamana vy’abantu b’i Seyiri, aca abishinga nk’imana ziwe bwite, aravyunamira, abishikanira ibimazi bituriwe. <verse eid="2CH 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 25:15" />Uburake bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> buziriringira Amaziya, aca amutumako umuvugishwa, amubaza ati: “Ni kuki usiguza izo mana z’abo bantu, zitashoboye gukiza benezo ukuboko kwawe?”<verse eid="2CH 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 25:16" />Akiriko aravuga, umwami amubwira ati: “Hari uwakugize umuhanuzi w’umwami? Hora! Ni kuki wikwegera urupfu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 25:16">Maze uwo muvugishwa ntiyasubira kuvuga, ariko yongerako ati: “Ndazi ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yafashe ingingo yo kukwica, kuko wakoze ivyo ntiwumvire impanuro zanje.”<verse eid="2CH 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 25:17" />Amaziya umwami w’i Buyuda amaze gusiguza abahanuzi biwe, atuma kuri Yowashi mwene Yehowahazi, Yehowahazi mwene Yehu umwami wa Isirayeli, amubwira ati: “Ingo duhure, tugwane imbonankubone!”<verse eid="2CH 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 25:18" />Ariko Yowashi umwami wa Isirayeli yishura Amaziya umwami w’i Buyuda ati: “Muri Libani habaye igitovu, kibwira isederi ry’i Libani kiti: ‘Mpa umukobwa wawe abe umugore w’umuhungu wanje.’ Ariko haca haza igikoko kinini gihonyanga ca gitovu. <verse eid="2CH 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 25:19" />Wibwira ngo waranesheje Edomu none wuzuye ubwibone. Nezererwa intsinzi yawe hanyuma ugume iwawe. Ni kubera iki wikwegera amakuba, ukayakwegera n’Ubuyuda bwose?”<verse eid="2CH 25:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 25:20" />Ariko Amaziya ntiyamwumvira, kuko Imana yashaka kubatanga mu maboko ya Yehowashi, kuko barondeye imana zo muri Edomu. <verse eid="2CH 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 25:21" />Nuko Yowashi umwami w’Abisirayeli aratera. We na Amaziya umwami w’i Buyuda bahanganira i Beti-Shemeshi mu Buyuda. <verse eid="2CH 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 25:22" />Abayuda baneshwa n’Abisirayeli, umusoda wese ahunga ataha i muhira iwe. <verse eid="2CH 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 25:23" />Yehowashi umwami wa Isirayeli acakira Amaziya umwami w’i Buyuda mwene Yowashi, Yowashi mwene Ahaziya, amufatira ahitwa Beti-Shemeshi. Maze Yehowashi aca amutwara i Yerusalemu, asenyurira hasi uruzitiro rw’i Yerusalemu, uhereye kw’Irembo rya Efurayimu ugashitsa kw’Irembo ryo mu Mfuruka, ahantu hangana n’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko amajana ane<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 180.</char></note>. <verse eid="2CH 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 25:24" />Asahura inzahabu n’ifeza n’ibindi bikoresho vyose vyari mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> vyarabwa na Obedi-Edomu, hamwe n’ubutunzi bwose bwari mu ngoro y’umwami. Afata n’abantu abagira inyagano, hanyuma asubira i Samariya.<verse eid="2CH 25:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 25:25" />Amaziya mwene Yowashi umwami w’i Buyuda yamaze imyaka cumi n’itanu inyuma y’urupfu rwa Yehowashi mwene Yehowahazi umwami w’Abisirayeli. <verse eid="2CH 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 25:26" />Ibindi vyose vyabaye ku ngoma ya Amaziya, uhereye ku ntango ukageza ku mpera, mbega ntivyanditswe mu gitabu c’abami b’i Buyuda na Isirayeli? <verse eid="2CH 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 25:27" />Kuva igihe Amaziya yatera ibitugu <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ntabe akimwumvira, i Yerusalemu haciye haba inama y’abantu bagomba kumwica, na we aca arahunga aja i Lakishi, ariko barungika abantu bamusanga i Lakishi bamutsindayo. <verse eid="2CH 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 25:28" />Bamugarukana kw’ifarasi, bamuhamba hamwe na ba sekuruza mu Gisagara ca Yuda.<verse eid="2CH 25:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="2CH 26" />
  <para style="s1">Uziya aba umwami w’i Buyuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 26:1" />Nuko Abayuda bose bafata Uziya, yari afise imyaka icumi n’itandatu, bamwimika ngo abe umwami mu gishingo ca se Amaziya. <verse eid="2CH 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 26:2" />Ni we yasanuye Elati ahagarukana i Buyuda, umwami Amaziya amaze guhamvya ba sekuruza.<verse eid="2CH 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 26:3" />Uziya yari afise imyaka icumi n’itandatu igihe yaba umwami, hanyuma aganza imyaka mirongo itanu n’ibiri ari i Yerusalemu. Nyina wiwe yitwa Yekoliya, w’i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 26:4" />Akora ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abona ko ari vyiza mu nyonga ziwe, nk’uko se Amaziya yakora. <verse eid="2CH 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 26:5" />Arondera Imana mu gihe ca Zakariya, kuko ari we yamwigishije kwubaha Imana. Mu gihe cose yarondeye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, na we yamuhaye kuroranirwa.<verse eid="2CH 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 26:6" />Aja kugwanya Abafilisitiya, asenyurira hasi inzitiro z’i Gati, i Yabune n’i Ashidodi. Maze aca yubaka ibisagara vyari hafi y’i Ashidodi n’ahandi hose mu Bafilisitiya. <verse eid="2CH 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 26:7" />Imana imufasha kugwanya Abafilisitiya n’Abarabu baba muri Guri-Bayali, n’Abameyunimu. <verse eid="2CH 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 26:8" />Abamoni bazanira Uziya amashikanwa yo kumwisaba, maze aba rurangiranwa gushika ku rubibe rwa Egiputa, kuko yabaye umunyenkomezi bihebuje.<verse eid="2CH 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 26:9" />Uziya yubaka iminara i Yerusalemu kw’Irembo ryo mu Mfuruka, yubaka iyindi kw’Irembo ryo mu Kiyaya no mu mfuruka z’uruzitiro, arayikomeza. <verse eid="2CH 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 26:10" />Yubaka kandi iminara mu bugaragwa, yimba n’ibinogo vyo kubika amazi vyinshi, kuko yari afise imikuku myinshi mu tubande no mu kiyaya. Yari afise abantu bamukorera mu mirima no mu nzabibu ziwe mu misozi no mu matongo amera cane y’i Karumeli, kuko yakunda uburimyi cane.<verse eid="2CH 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 26:11" />Uziya yari afise ingabo zigishijwe neza kugwana, zama ziteguye kuja ku rugamba ziri mu mice nk’uko ibitigiri vyabo vyari vyaharuwe mw’iharura ryagizwe na Yeyiyeli umunyamabanga, na Mayaseya umukuru w’ingabo, barongowe na Hananiya, umwe mu bakuru bakorera i bwami. <verse eid="2CH 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 26:12" />Igitigiri c’abakuru batwara amazu bari barongoye ingabo cari ibihumbi bibiri n’amajana atandatu. <verse eid="2CH 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 26:13" />Bari barongoye ingabo zingana ibihumbi amajana atatu n’indwi n’amajana atanu bigishijwe ivy’intambara, kandi bakomeye bo gufasha umwami kugwanya abansi biwe. <verse eid="2CH 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 26:14" />Uziya ategura inkinzo, amacumu, inkofero, amakoti yo gukingira igikiriza, imiheto n’amabuye atereshwa umugozi bikwiye ingabo zose. <verse eid="2CH 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 26:15" />I Yerusalemu akora imashini zahinguwe n’abahinga zo gukoreshwa n’abagwanira ku minara no mu mfuruka zo kurasamwo imyampi, hamwe no gutera ibibuye bininibinini. Aramenyekana cane hose kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yamufashije, gushika aho yabaye agakomeye.<verse eid="2CH 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 26:16" />Ariko amaze kuba agakomeye, ubwibone bwiwe bumuzanira kuranduka. Ata ubwizigirwa k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yiwe, maze yinjira mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ngo aturire ibimota neza ku gicaniro. <verse eid="2CH 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 26:17" />Azariya umuherezi n’abandi baherezi b’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> mirongo umunani barinda cane baramukurikira. <verse eid="2CH 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 26:18" />Baramwubahuka, bamubwira bati: “Ewe mwami Uziya, si vyiza ko wewe uturirira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ibimota neza. Ivyo ni ivy’abaherezi, abo mu ruvyaro rwa Aroni, barobanuwe ngo baturirire ibimota neza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Sohoka uve ahera kuko wataye ubwizigirwa, kandi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ntazobigushimira.”<verse eid="2CH 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 26:19" />Uziya, yari afise icotezo mu ntoke yiteguye guturira ibimota neza, aca arashavura. Agishavuriye abo baherezi imbere yabo n’imbere y’igicaniro c’ivyo bimota neza, mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, imibembe imufatira aho nyene, iboneka mu ruhanga rwiwe. <verse eid="2CH 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 26:20" />Azariya umuherezi mukuru n’abandi baherezi bose bamuravye, babona atonzweko n’imibembe mu ruhanga, baca bihuta kumusohora hanze. Kandi na we nyene yihuta gusohoka, kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari amukubise.<verse eid="2CH 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 26:21" />Umwami Uziya agumana imibembe gushika ku musi yapfiriyeko. Aba mu kazu ka wenyene; kuko yari umunyamibembe, kandi ntiyemererwa kuja mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Yotamu umuhungu wiwe aca aba ari we azezwa ikirimba, yongera atwara abantu bo muri ico gihugu.<verse eid="2CH 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 26:22" />Ibindi vyose vyabaye ku ngoma ya Uziya, uhereye ku ntango ugashitsa ku mpera, vyanditswe mu gitabu c’uwavugishwa n’Imana Yesaya mwene Amozi. <verse eid="2CH 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 26:23" />Nuko Uziya arapfa, ahamvya ba sekuruza; ahambwa hafi yabo, mu rindi tongo ryari iry’abami, kuko abantu bavuga bati: “Yari umunyamibembe.” Maze Yotamu umuhungu wiwe amusubirira ku ngoma.<verse eid="2CH 26:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="2CH 27" />
  <para style="s1">Yotamu aba umwami w’Ubuyuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 27:1" />Yotamu yari afise imyaka mirongo ibiri n’itanu igihe yimikwa ngo abe umwami, aca aganza imyaka icumi n’itandatu ari i Yerusalemu. Nyina wiwe yitwa Yerusha, umukobwa wa Zadoki. <verse eid="2CH 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 27:2" />Akora ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abona ko ari vyiza, nk’uko se Uziya yakora, mugabo wewe ntiyacumura ngo yinjire mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Ariko abantu bo, baguma mu ngeso zabo mbi. <verse eid="2CH 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 27:3" />Yotamu ni we yasanuye Irembo ryo Haruguru ry’Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, yubaka n’urundi ruzitiro rwo ku musozi Ofeli. <verse eid="2CH 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 27:4" />Yubaka kandi ibisagara mu misozi y’i Buyuda, n’iminara, n’ubwihisho bukomeye mu misozi iteyeko ibiti.<verse eid="2CH 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 27:5" />Yotamu agwana n’umwami w’Abamoni aramunesha. Uwo mwaka Abamoni bamushikanira amashikanwa yo kumwisaba angana n’italanto ijana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilo 3.750.</char></note> z’ifeza, ingero koru ibihumbi icumi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amatoni 1.800.</char></note> z’ingano, n’ingero koru ibihumbi icumi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amatoni 1.500.</char></note> za sayiri. Mu mwaka ugira kabiri n’uwugira gatatu bamuzanira nk’ivyo nyene.<verse eid="2CH 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 27:6" />Yotamu aba agakomeye kuko yagendera mu bitunganye imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yiwe.<verse eid="2CH 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 27:7" />Ibindi vyose vyabaye ku ngoma ya Yotamu, harimwo n’intambara zose yagwanye n’ibindi yakoze, vyanditswe mu gitabu c’abami b’Abisirayeli n’Abayuda. <verse eid="2CH 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 27:8" />Yari afise imyaka mirongo ibiri n’itanu igihe yimikwa ngo abe umwami, aca aganza imyaka icumi n’itandatu ari i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 27:9" />Yotamu arapfa ahamvya ba sekuruza, ahambwa hamwe na bo mu Gisagara ca Dawidi. Umuhungu wiwe Ahazi aba ari we amusubirira ku ngoma.<verse eid="2CH 27:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="2CH 28" />
  <para style="s1">Ahazi aba umwami w’i Buyuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 28:1" />Ahazi yari afise imyaka mirongo ibiri igihe yaba umwami, aganza imyaka cumi n’itandatu ari i Yerusalemu. Ariko ntiyakora ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abona ko ari vyiza mu nyonga ziwe, nk’uko sekuruza Dawidi yakora. <verse eid="2CH 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 28:2" />Ahubwo yagendeye mu ngeso z’abami ba Isirayeli mbere akora ibigirwamana vya Bayali. <verse eid="2CH 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 28:3" />Aturirira ibimazi mu kiyaya ca Beni-Hinomu, yongera atanga abana biwe nk’ikimazi ngo baturirwe. Uko ni ko yakoze ibizira vy’ubuyobe vyakorwa n’amahanga <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yarirukanye muri ico gihugu imbere y’Abisirayeli. <verse eid="2CH 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 28:4" />Yatanga ibimazi akongera agaturira n’ibimota neza, ivyo akabikorera hejuru mu mataba y’imisozi miremire no musi y’igiti cose gitotahaye.<verse eid="2CH 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 28:5" />Ni co catumye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yiwe amutanga mu maboko y’umwami w’i Siriya. Abasiriya baramunesha, bafata mpiri abantu biwe benshi babagira imbohe, babajana i Damasiko.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 28:5">Yongera amutanga mu maboko y’umwami w’Abisirayeli, aramunesha bikomeye kandi ahatakariza ibintu vyinshi. <verse eid="2CH 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 28:6" />Kandi Peka mwene Remaliya, yica mu Bayuda ingabo ibihumbi ijana na mirongo ibiri ku musi umwe; kuko Abayuda bari bahevye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya ba sekuruza. <verse eid="2CH 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 28:7" />Zikuri, umugwanyi w’Umwefurayimu, yica Mayaseya umuhungu w’umwami, yica Azurikamu umukuru w’ingabo ajejwe ikirimba, na Elukana yari icegera c’umwami. <verse eid="2CH 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 28:8" />Abagabo b’Abisirayeli bafata mpiri abavukanyi babo bakomotse i Buyuda, babatwara abagore ibihumbi amajana abiri, hamwe n’abahungu n’abakobwa. Babasahura n’ibintu vyinshi, babijana i Samariya.<verse eid="2CH 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 28:9" />Ariko uwavugishwa n’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yitwa Odedi yari ngaho i Samariya, aca aja guhura n’ingabo zariko ziratahuka. Arababwira ati: “Kubera <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya ba sogokuruza banyu yashavuriye Ubuyuda, yabagabuye mu maboko yanyu. Ariko rero mwarengeje urugero, mubarandurana uburake bwinshi, ku buryo vyashitse no mw’ijuru. <verse eid="2CH 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 28:10" />None ubu na ho mushaka ko abagabo n’abagore mwakuye i Buyuda n’i Yerusalemu bahinduka abagurano banyu. Mbega none mweho ntimufise ivyaha <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu abagiriza? <verse eid="2CH 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 28:11" />None rero, nimunyumvirize! Nimurungike bagenzi banyu, bamwe mwafata nk’imbohe basubire inyuma, kuko uburake bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> buri kuri mwebwe.”<verse eid="2CH 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 28:12" />Nuko bamwe mu batware bo mu Befurayimu, Azariya mwene Yehohanani, Berekiya mwene Meshilemoti, Yehizikiya mwene Shalumu, na Amasa mwene Hadulayi; bahangana n’abari bavuye ku rugamba. <verse eid="2CH 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 28:13" />Baravuga bati: “Ntimuzane izo mbohe hano, kuko twoba ducumuye imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Mugomba mwongereze ivyaha vyacu? Musanzwe muzi ko icaha cacu ari kinini, kandi uburake bw’inkazi bwiwe bukaba buri ku Bisirayeli.”<verse eid="2CH 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 28:14" />Nuko izo ngabo zica zisiga abo bantu b’imbohe hamwe n’ivyasahuwe imbere y’abo bakuru n’ikoraniro ryose. <verse eid="2CH 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 28:15" />Abantu batowe kandi bagatororokanywa umwe wese ahamagawe izina bafata izo mbohe, maze bakura impuzu mu vyasahuwe, bambika abari gusa bo muri bo. Babaha impuzu n’ibirato, n’ivyokurya n’ivyo kunywa; babaha kandi n’imiti yo kuvura abakomeretse. Bashira ku ndogoba abarushe cane muri bo, maze babasubiza mu b’iwabo i Yeriko, igisagara c’ibigazi, baca basubira i Samariya.<verse eid="2CH 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 28:16" />Muri ico gihe umwami Ahazi atumako umwami w’i Ashuri ngo amutabare, kuko <verse eid="2CH 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 28:17" />Abanyedomu bari bongeye kugaruka gutera i Buyuda, bagatwara n’imbohe. <verse eid="2CH 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 28:18" />Abafilisitiya na bo bari bateye ibisagara vyo mu biyaya n’i Negebu h’i Buyuda; bafata Beti-Shemeshi, Ayaloni n’i Gederoti, hamwe n’i Soko, Timuna n’i Gimuzo, n’ibigwati bihakikije, baravyigarurira. <verse eid="2CH 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 28:19" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yacishije bugufi cane Abayuda kubera Ahazi umwami wa Isirayeli yari yatumye Abayuda bakora ibibi; mbere akarushiriza kuba mubi imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="2CH 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 28:20" />Tigulati-Pilineseri umwami w’i Ashuri aramwitaba araza, ariko aho kumufasha, amufata nk’umwansi aza kumugwanya. <verse eid="2CH 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 28:21" />Ico gihe Ahazi yari yafashe bimwe mu bintu vyo mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> n’ivyo mu ngoro y’i bwami no mu mazu y’abaganwa, abiha umwami w’i Ashuri; ariko ivyo nta co vyamumariye.<verse eid="2CH 28:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 28:22" />No mu gihe c’ivyago umwami Ahazi yaburaniwe, arushiriza kugarariza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="2CH 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 28:23" />Ashikanira ibimazi ibigirwamana vy’i Damasiko, kuko abantu baho bamunesheje; akiyumvira ati: “Ko imana z’abami b’i Siriya zabafashije, ndazishikaniye ibimazi nanje zontabara.” Ariko zamubereye umutego we hamwe n’Abisirayeli bose.<verse eid="2CH 28:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 28:24" />Ahazi yegeranya ibikoresho vyose vyari mu Ngoro y’Imana arabimenagura. Araheza yugara inzugi z’Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aca yubaka ibicaniro ku mayirabiri yose y’i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 28:25" />Mu gisagara cose c’i Buyuda, ashinga ku misozi miremire ibibanza vyo gutuririramwo ibimota neza, no gushikaniramwo ibimazi izindi mana, ivyo vyongera kuvyura uburake bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya ba sekuruza.<verse eid="2CH 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 28:26" />Ibindi vyose vyabaye ku ngoma ya Ahazi n’ivyerekeye inzira ziwe, uhereye ku ntango ugashika ku mpera, vyanditswe mu gitabu c’abami b’i Buyuda n’Abisirayeli. <verse eid="2CH 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 28:27" />Ahazi arapfa, ahamvya ba sekuruza, ahambwa i Yerusalemu, ariko ntiyashirwa mu mva z’abami ba Isirayeli. Maze umuhungu wiwe Hezekiya amusubirira ku ngoma.<verse eid="2CH 28:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="2CH 29" />
  <para style="s1">Hezekiya ahumanura urusengero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 29:1" />Hezekiya yari afise imyaka mirongo ibiri n’itanu igihe yimikwa ngo abe umwami, aganza imyaka mirongo ibiri n’icenda ari i Yerusalemu. Nyina yitwa Abiya, umukobwa wa Zakariya. <verse eid="2CH 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 29:2" />Akora ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abona ko ari vyiza mu nyonga ziwe, nk’uko sekuruza Dawidi yakora.<verse eid="2CH 29:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 29:3" />Mu kwezi kwa mbere kw’umwaka wa mbere w’ingoma yiwe, yugurura inzugi z’Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> arazisanura. <verse eid="2CH 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 29:4" />Atumako abaherezi n’Abalewi, abakoraniriza ku kibuga ahahera mu buseruko, <verse eid="2CH 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 29:5" />avuga ati: “Nimunyumve yemwe Balewi! Nimwihumanure ubu nyene mwongere muhumanure n’Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana ya ba sogokuruza. Mukure Ahera ibihumanya vyose. <verse eid="2CH 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 29:6" />Ba data ntibabaye abizigirwa; bakoze ibibi mu nyonga z’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu, baramuheba. Batera ibitugu inzu y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, na we nyene bamutera ibitugu. <verse eid="2CH 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 29:7" />Barongera bugara inzugi z’ibaraza, bazimya n’amatara. Vyongeye ntibashikaniye Imana y’Abisirayeli ibimota neza canke ikimazi na kimwe co guturirirwa Ahera hayo. <verse eid="2CH 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 29:8" />Ni co gituma uburake bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bwasutswe ku Bayuda n’ab’i Yerusalemu; akabahindura ibimaramare, bakaba akabarore n’agatwengo, nk’uko mushobora kuvyibonera n’amaso yanyu. <verse eid="2CH 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 29:9" />Iki ni co catumye ba sogokuruza bacu bicwa n’inkota, abahungu bacu n’abakobwa bacu, eka mbere n’abagore bacu bakajanwa nk’imbohe. <verse eid="2CH 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 29:10" />None rero ubu nagabiye kugiriranira isezerano n’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana y’Abisirayeli, kugira ngo uburake bwiwe butuveko. <verse eid="2CH 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 29:11" />Nuko rero bagenzi, ibi ntimubifate minenerwe, kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabatoranije ngo muhagarare imbere yiwe mumukorera, ngo mukore igikorwa ciwe, mumuturirire ibimota neza.”<verse eid="2CH 29:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 29:12" />Nuko aba Balewi baca bitegurira gukora.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2CH 29:12" />
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 29:12">Mu bakomoka mu nzu kwa Kohati ni:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CH 29:12">Mahati mwene Amasayi na Yoweli mwene Azariya.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 29:12">Mu bakomoka mu nzu kwa Merari ni:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CH 29:12">Kishi mwene Abudi na Azariya mwene Yehaleleli.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 29:12">Mu bakomoka mu nzu kwa Gerishoni ni:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CH 29:12">Yowa mwene Zima na Edeni mwene Yowa.<verse eid="2CH 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 29:13" />Mu bakomoka mu nzu kwa Elizafani ni:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CH 29:13">Shimuri na Yeyiyeli.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 29:13">Mu bakomoka mu nzu kwa Asafu ni:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CH 29:13">Zakariya na Mataniya.<verse eid="2CH 29:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 29:14" />Mu bakomoka mu nzu kwa Hemani ni:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CH 29:14">Yehiyeli na Shimeyi.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 29:14">Mu bakomoka mu nzu kwa Yedutuni ni:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CH 29:14">Shemaya na Uziyeli.<verse eid="2CH 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 29:15" />Bamaze gukoranya benewabo b’Abalewi no kwihumanura, baca barinjira kugira ngo bahumanure Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, nk’uko umwami yari yabibategetse, yisunze ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="2CH 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 29:16" />Abaherezi binjira imbere mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> kugira ngo bayihumanure. Maze basohora hanze mu rugo rw’Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ikintu cose gihumanye basanze muri iyo Ngoro. Abalewi na bo baca baravyakira babimanukana mu mwonga wa Kidironi. <verse eid="2CH 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 29:17" />Batanguye guhumanura Ingoro ku musi wa mbere w’ukwezi kwa mbere, maze ku musi w’umunani w’ukwo kwezi bashika ku rwinjiriro rw’Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Mu misi umunani yakurikiye, bahumanura Ingoro ubwayo; barangiza ico gikorwa ku musi wa cumi na gatandatu w’ukwezi kwa mbere.<verse eid="2CH 29:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 29:18" />Baca binjira aho umwami Hezekiya yari ari bamubwira bati: “Twahumanuye ingoro yose y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, igicaniro co guturirirako ibimazi n’ibikoresho vyaco, n’imeza y’imikate ishikaniwe Imana n’ibikoresho vyayo vyose. <verse eid="2CH 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 29:19" />Twateguye turongera turahumanura ibikoresho vyose umwami Ahazi yari yarasohoye kubera kutubaha Imana kwiwe igihe yari umwami. Ubu biri imbere y’igicaniro c’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.”<verse eid="2CH 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 29:20" />Bukeye mu gatondo ka kare umwami Hezekiya akoranya abakuru bo mu gisagara baca baduga ku Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="2CH 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 29:21" />Bazana amashuri y’inka indwi, impfizi z’intama indwi, imyagazi y’intama indwi, n’amasuguru y’impene indwi, babitanga kw’ikimazi gitangirwa ivyaha ku bw’ubwami, ku bw’Ingoro no ku bw’Abayuda. Umwami ategeka abaherezi, abo mu ruvyaro rwa Aroni, ngo babitangire ku gicaniro c’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="2CH 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 29:22" />Nuko bakerera ya mashuri, maze abaherezi batwara amaraso bayamija ku gicaniro; hanyuma bakerera za mpfizi z’intama, amaraso yazo bayamija ku gicaniro; baca bakerera na ya myagazi y’intama, amaraso yayo bayamija ku gicaniro. <verse eid="2CH 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 29:23" />Za suguru z’impene zo gutangwako ikimazi gitangirwa ivyaha zizanwa imbere y’umwami n’ikoraniro ryose, bazirambikako ibiganza. <verse eid="2CH 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 29:24" />Abaherezi baca barazikerera, amaraso yazo bayazana ku gicaniro co gutangirako ikimazi c’ivyaha kugira ngo batangire impongano Abisirayeli bose, kuko umwami yari yategetse ko baturira ikimazi c’ivyaha bagatanga n’ishikanwa ry’ivyaha kubw’Abisirayeli bose.<verse eid="2CH 29:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 29:25" />Ahagarika Abalewi mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bafise ibicurarangisho bisamirana, inanga n’amakembe, nk’uko vyashinzwe na Dawidi na Gadi uwerekwa w’umwami hamwe n’uwavugishwa n’Imana Natani. Ivyo vyari vyategetswe n’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abicishije mu bo yavugisha. <verse eid="2CH 29:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 29:26" />Nuko Abalewi bahagarara bafise ivyo bicurarangisho vya Dawidi, abaherezi na bo bafise inzamba zabo.<verse eid="2CH 29:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 29:27" />Nuko Hezekiya ategeka ko batangira vya bimazi biturirwa ku gicaniro. Bagitangura kubitanga, indirimbo zo guhimbaza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> zica zirasamirana, inzamba ziravuzwa, na vya bicurarangisho vya Dawidi umwami w’Abisirayeli. <verse eid="2CH 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 29:28" />Ikoraniro ryose rirunama rirasenga, mu gihe abaririmvyi bariko bararirimba bavuza n’inzamba. Ivyo birabandanya gushika bahejeje gutanga vya bimazi vyo guturirwa.<verse eid="2CH 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 29:29" />Bahejeje gutanga ivyo bimazi, umwami n’abari ngaho bose barapfukama barasenga. <verse eid="2CH 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 29:30" />Umwami Hezekiya n’abakuru bari kumwe na we bategeka Abalewi guhimbaza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bakoresheje amajambo ya Dawidi n’aya Asafu uwerekwa. Nuko baririmba indirimbo zo gutazira banezerewe, baca bunamika imitwe yabo barasenga.<verse eid="2CH 29:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 29:31" />Maze Hezekiya aravuga ati: “Ubu rero mwamaze kwiyegurira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Nimuzane ibimazi n’amashikanwa y’ishimwe mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.” Nuko ikoraniro ryose rizana ibimazi n’amashikanwa y’ishimwe, n’abandi bose bavyishakiye bazana n’ibimazi vyo guturirwa.<verse eid="2CH 29:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 29:32" />Igitigiri c’amashikanwa ikoraniro ryazanye cari amashuri y’inka mirongo indwi, impfizi z’intama ijana, n’imyagazi y’intama amajana abiri; vyose hamwe biba ibimazi vyo guturirwa bishikaniwe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="2CH 29:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 29:33" />Ibitungwa vyose vyashikaniwe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> nk’ibimazi vyari amashuri y’inka amajana atandatu n’intama n’impene ibihumbi bitatu. <verse eid="2CH 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2CH 29:34" />Ariko Abaherezi bari bake cane ntibashobora kubaga vya bimazi vyose. Nuko bagenzi babo b’Abalewi barabafasha gushika igikorwa giheze, mbere gushika n’abandi baherezi barobanuwe, kuko Abalewi bashize umutima ku gukora ibitunganye kurusha abaherezi. <verse eid="2CH 29:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2CH 29:35" />Hariho ibimazi vyo guturirwa vyinshi cane, hamwe n’ibinure vy’ibimazi vy’ishimwe n’amashikanwa y’ibinyobwa aherekeza ivyo bimazi vyo guturirwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 29:35">Nuko igikorwa co mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> kiba kirasubijweho. <verse eid="2CH 29:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2CH 29:36" />Hezekiya n’abantu bose baranezerwa kubera ivyo Imana yari ishikije ku bantu bayo, kuko vyari bikozwe mu mwanya muto.<verse eid="2CH 29:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="2CH 30" />
  <para style="s1">Hezekiya ahimbaza Pasika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 30:1" />Hezekiya atumako Abisirayeli bose n’Abayuda, kandi yandikira amakete Abefurayimu n’Abamanase, abaha ubutumire ngo baze mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> i Yerusalemu guhimbaza Pasika y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana y’Abisirayeli. <verse eid="2CH 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 30:2" />Umwami n’abaganwa biwe n’ikoraniro ryose bari i Yerusalemu bari biyemeje guhimbaza Pasika mu kwezi kwa kabiri. <verse eid="2CH 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 30:3" />Ntibari bwashobore kuyihimbaza mu bihe vyategekanijwe kuko ata baherezi bakwiye bari bwarobanurwe, kandi abantu ntibari bwigere bakoranira i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 30:4" />Iyo nteguro yo guhimbaza Pasika yabonetse ko ari nziza ku mwami no ku bantu bose. <verse eid="2CH 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 30:5" />Baca bafata ingingo yo gutuma intumwa mu Bwisirayeli hose, uhereye i Berisheba mu bumanuko ugashika i Dani mu buraruko, bahamagara abantu ngo baze i Yerusalemu guhimbaza Pasika y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana y’Abisirayeli. Ntibari bwayihimbaze ari benshi nk’uko vyari vyaranditswe.<verse eid="2CH 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 30:6" />Kw’itegeko ry’umwami, intumwa zikwira hose mu Bwisirayeli n’i Buyuda zitwaye amakete avuye ku mwami no ku baganwa biwe, avuga ngo:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2CH 30:6">“Yemwe Bisirayeli mwese, nimugaruke k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana ya Aburahamu, na Isaka na Isirayeli, kugira ngo na we abagarukeko mwebwe abasigaye, mutahitanywe n’agatikizo k’abami b’i Ashuri. <verse eid="2CH 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 30:7" />Ntimube nka ba sogokuruza na benewanyu, babaye ibigaba imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya ba sekuruza, ari co catumye ibahindura akajoreza nk’uko mubibona. <verse eid="2CH 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 30:8" />Ntimukomantaze imitima nk’uko ba sogokuruza banyu bayikomantaje; mwumvire <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Muze mu Ngoro yiwe, iyo yejeje akayitoranya ibihe bidashira. Mukorere <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu, kugira ngo uburake bwiwe bw’inkazi bubaveko. <verse eid="2CH 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 30:9" />Nimwahindukirira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, benewanyu n’abana banyu bazogirirwa akagongwe n’ababajanye nk’inyagano maze bagaruke muri iki gihugu, kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu ari inyembabazi kandi igira ikigongwe cinshi. Nimwamuhindukirira, ntazobakurako inyonga ziwe.”<verse eid="2CH 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 30:10" />Za ntumwa ziragenda, ziva mu gisagara zija mu kindi, mu Befurayimu no mu Bamanase, gushika mu Bazebuloni; ariko abantu baritwengera, barabakengera. <verse eid="2CH 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 30:11" />Yamara abantu bamwe bo mu Basheri, Abamanase n’Abazebuloni bicisha bugufi baja i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 30:12" />No mu Buyuda, ukuboko kw’Imana kuba ku bantu baho, abaha kugira umutima umwe wo gukora ivyo umwami n’abaganwa biwe bari bategetse, bivuye mw’ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="2CH 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 30:13" />Nuko mu kwezi kwa kabiri, abantu benshi bakoranira i Yerusalemu ngo bahimbaze Umusi Mukuru w’imikate itarimwo umwambiro. <verse eid="2CH 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 30:14" />Bakuraho ibicaniro vyari i Yerusalemu, basambura n’ibicaniro batangirako ibimota neza, babita mu mwonga wa Kidironi.<verse eid="2CH 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 30:15" />Maze ku musi ugira cumi na kane w’ukwezi kwa kabiri, bakerera umwagazi wa Pasika. Abaherezi n’Abalewi bari buzuye ibimaramare, baca barihumanura maze bazana ibimazi vyo guturirwa mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="2CH 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 30:16" />Maze baca baja mu bibanza vyabo nk’uko vyanditswe mu Vyagezwe vya Mose umuntu w’Imana. Abaherezi bamija ku gicaniro amaraso baherejwe n’Abalewi. <verse eid="2CH 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 30:17" />Kubera ko mw’ikoraniro harimwo abantu benshi batari bihumanuye, Abalewi ni bo bahavuye bakerera imyagazi y’intama ya Pasika y’abantu bose bari bahumanye, kuko batashobora gushikiriza iyo myagazi yabo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="2CH 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 30:18" />Kandi naho abantu benshi mu bari bavuye mu Befurayimu, mu Bamanase, mu Bisakari no mu Bazebuloni batari bihumanuye, barariye Pasika, banyuranya n’uko vyanditswe. Ariko, Hezekiya arabasengera, avuga ati: “Icompa <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, kuko ari mwiza, akababarira umuntu wese <verse eid="2CH 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 30:19" />yashize umutima wiwe ku kurondera <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana ya ba sekuruza naho ahumanye ku bw’amategeko y’Ahera.” <verse eid="2CH 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 30:20" />Maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yumva ugusenga kwa Hezekiya, akiza abantu.<verse eid="2CH 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 30:21" />Abisirayeli bari i Yerusalemu bahimbaza Umusi Mukuru w’imikate itarimwo umwambiro, bamara imisi indwi banezerewe cane, mu gihe Abalewi n’abaherezi baguma bararirimbira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ku musi ku musi, bakoresheje ibicurarangisho bisamirana, vyeguriwe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="2CH 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 30:22" />Hezekiya avuga amajambo yo gutera intege Abalewi bose bari berekanye ko batahura neza igikorwa c’Imana. Muri iyo misi indwi bariye umugabane wabo batanga n’ibimazi vy’ishimwe barongera bahimbaza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya ba sekuruza.<verse eid="2CH 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 30:23" />Maze ikoraniro ryose rica ryemeranya kwongerako iyindi misi indwi, bayimara bahimbaza Imana kandi banezerewe. <verse eid="2CH 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 30:24" />Hezekiya umwami w’i Buyuda ategura amashuri y’inka igihumbi n’intama n’impene ibihumbi indwi ku bw’iryo koraniro, n’abaganwa na bo batanga amashuri y’inka igihumbi n’intama n’impene ibihumbi cumi. Igitigiri kinini c’abaherezi barihumanura. <verse eid="2CH 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 30:25" />Ikoraniro ryose ry’Abayuda riranezerwa, hamwe n’abaherezi n’Abalewi n’abari bakoraniye hamwe na bo bavuye mu Bisirayeli, harimwo n’abanyamahanga bari baje bava mu Bwisirayeli n’ababa i Buyuda. <verse eid="2CH 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 30:26" />Hari umunezero mwinshi cane i Yerusalemu, kuko kuva mu misi ya Salomo mwene Dawidi umwami w’Abisirayeli hatari bwabe ikintu nk’ico i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 30:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 30:27" />Abaherezi n’Abalewi barahaguruka ngo bahezagire abantu, maze Imana irabumva, kuko isengesho ryabo ryashitse mw’ijuru, ahera hayo, aho iba.<verse eid="2CH 30:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="2CH 31" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 31:1" />Ivyo vyose biheze, Abisirayeli bose bari ngaho barasohoka baja mu bisagara vy’i Buyuda, basitagura inkingi z’amabuye zose, batemagura n’inkingi za Ashera. Basambura ibicaniro vyo ku mataba y’imisozi n’ibicaniro vyari i Buyuda hose, i Bubenyamini, mu Befurayimu no mu Bamanase. Abisirayeli bamaze gusambura vyose, baca basubira mu bisagara vyabo no mu ngo zabo.<verse eid="2CH 31:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Intererano zo Gusenga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 31:2" />Hezekiya ashira abaherezi n’Abalewi mu mice; umuce wose ukurikije ibikorwa vyabo, ngo batange ibimazi vyo guturirwa n’ivy’ishimwe, bongere bakore ibikorwa vy’Imana, batange amashimwe kandi bahimbarize ku marembo y’Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="2CH 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 31:3" />Umwami na we araterera, atanga ku bivuye mu butunzi bwiwe ngo bikoreshwe mu bimazi vyo guturirwa mu gitondo, ivyo ku mugoroba, ivyo ku masabato, ivy’ukwezi guserutse, n’ivyo ku misi mikuru yashinzwe nk’uko vyanditswe mu Vyagezwe vy’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="2CH 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 31:4" />Ategeka abantu baba i Yerusalemu ngo batange ivyo bakuye mu vyabo bigenewe abaherezi n’Abalewi kugira ngo abo na bo bashobore kwiyegurira ibikorwa vy’Ivyagezwe vy’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="2CH 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 31:5" />Iryo tegeko rigisohoka, Abisirayeli batangana umutima ubikunze ku vya mbere vyeze vyo mu vyimburwa vyabo vy’ibinyantete, umuvinyu mushasha, amavuta, ubuki n’ibindi vyose biva mu burimyi. Bazana ibintu vyinshi, n’ikigiracumi c’ibintu vyose. <verse eid="2CH 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 31:6" />Abantu bo mu Bwisirayeli n’i Buyuda baba mu bisagara vy’i Buyuda, na bo bazana ikigiracumi co mu masho yabo n’imikuku yabo hamwe n’ikigiracumi c’ibintu vyeguriwe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yabo, barabirunda biba ikirundo kinini. <verse eid="2CH 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 31:7" />Batanguye kubikora mu kwezi kwa gatatu babiheza mu kwezi kw’indwi. <verse eid="2CH 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 31:8" />Maze Hezekiya n’abaganwa biwe baje bakabona ivyo birundo, bahimbaza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> kandi bahezagira abantu biwe b’Abisirayeli.<verse eid="2CH 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 31:9" />Hezekiya abaza abaherezi n’Abalewi ivyerekeye ivyo birundo ati: “Mbega ibi bintu vyose vyavuye hehe?” <verse eid="2CH 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 31:10" />Maze Azariya umuherezi mukuru, yava mu muryango wa Sadoki, amwishura ati: “Kuva igihe abantu batanguriye kuzana intererano zabo mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, dufise ivyokurya bikwiye hamwe n’ibirenzeko vyinshi twimbuye, kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yahezagiye abantu biwe, kandi ibi vyinshi ubona ni ibirenzeko.”<verse eid="2CH 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 31:11" />Hezekiya ategeka ko bategura ububiko mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, na bo babigenza gutyo. <verse eid="2CH 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 31:12" />Maze bazana intererano zabo mu bwizigirwa, ivyo batanze ku bw’ico gikorwa, ibigiracumi n’ivyo batanze nk’ingabire zeguriwe Imana. Konaniya, Umulewi, ni we yari ajejwe kubiraba; uwo bavukana Shimeyi akaba icegera ciwe. <verse eid="2CH 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 31:13" />Yehiyeli, Azaziya, Nahati, Asaheli, Yerimoti, Yozabadi, Eliyeli, Isimakiya, Mahati na Benaya bari abunganizi bafasha Konaniya na Shimeyi mwenewabo. Bashizweho n’umwami Hezekiya na Azariya umukuru yari ashinzwe Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="2CH 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 31:14" />Kora mwene Imuna Umulewi, yari umurinzi w’Irembo ryo mu Buseruko; yari ajejwe n’amashikanwa yashikaniwe Imana, atanzwe nk’uko umuntu wese avyishakiye, no kugabura izo ntererano zihawe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> hamwe n’ingabire zatanzwe ngo zibe inyegu y’Imana. <verse eid="2CH 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 31:15" />Mu bisagara vy’abaherezi, yari afise abamufasha mu bwizigirwa ari bo Edeni, Miniyamini, Yesuwa, Shemaya, Amariya na Shekaniya; bakagaburira bagenzi babo b’abaherezi nk’uko imice yabo yari iri, baba abakuze canke abakiri bato.<verse eid="2CH 31:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 31:16" />Hamwe n’ivyo, bagaburira n’abahungu bose, uhereye ku bamaze imyaka itatu n’iyirenga, abo amazina yabo yari yanditswe mu ntonde z’ingene abantu bagiye bararondoka, abashobora kwinjira mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, bose ngo bakore ibikorwa bajejwe kandi bitandukanye vyo ku musi ku musi, hakurikijwe kandi imigwi yabo n’ivyo yashinzwe. <verse eid="2CH 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 31:17" />Bagaburira abaherezi bahawe ibikorwa hakurikijwe imiryango yabo nk’uko vyari mu ntonde z’ingene bagiye bararondoka, kandi n’Abalewi bikagenda gutyo, abamaze imyaka mirongo ibiri n’iyirenga, nk’uko ibikorwa vyabo n’imice yabo vyari biri. <verse eid="2CH 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 31:18" />Bongeramwo n’abakiri bato, abagore, abahungu n’abakobwa bo muri uwo muryango bose banditswe ku ntonde z’ingene bagiye bararondoka; kuko bari babaye abizigirwa mu kwiyegurira Imana rwose.<verse eid="2CH 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 31:19" />Ku vy’abaherezi, abakomoka kuri Aroni baba mu matongo akikije ibisagara vyabo canke mu bindi bisagara ivyo ari vyo vyose, hariho abagabo bari batoranijwe, bagenwa ku mazina yabo ngo bagaburire imigabane umugabo wese yari muri bo n’abandi bose bari ku rutonde rw’Abalewi.<verse eid="2CH 31:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 31:20" />Ivyo ni vyo Hezekiya yakoze mu Buyuda hose; akora ibigororotse, bitunganye kandi vyo kwizigirwa imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yiwe. <verse eid="2CH 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 31:21" />Ivyo yakoze vyose, vyaba ibijanye n’igikorwa co mu Ngoro y’Imana canke ivyo kwumvira Ivyagezwe vyayo n’amabwirizwa yayo, yarondeye Imana yiwe n’umutima wiwe wose. Ivyo vyatumye aroranirwa muri vyose.<verse eid="2CH 31:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="2CH 32" />
  <para style="s1">Senakeribu atera i Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 32:1" />Inyuma y’ivyo vyose Hezekiya yakoze mu bwizigirwa, Senakeribu umwami w’i Ashuri aza gutera i Buyuda. Yugariza ibisagara bizitijwe inzitiro z’amabuye, agomba kuvyigarurira. <verse eid="2CH 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 32:2" />Maze Hezekiya abonye ko Senakeribu yaje kandi ko atumbereye kugwanya Yerusalemu, <verse eid="2CH 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 32:3" />avugana n’abaganwa biwe n’abakuru b’ingabo ngo bazibire amazi yo mu masoko yose yari inyuma y’igisagara, maze baramufasha. <verse eid="2CH 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 32:4" />Abantu benshi barakorana, bazibira amasoko yose n’umugezi wose watemba mu gihugu. Baravuga bati: “Ni iki cotuma umwami w’i Ashuri aza agasanga amazi yuzuye?” <verse eid="2CH 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 32:5" />Aca akora cane mu gusanura ibihengeri vyose vy’uruzitiro no mu kwubaka iminara kuri rwo. Yubaka n’urundi ruzitiro inyuma y’urwo, akomeza n’amabaraza yo mu Gisagara ca Dawidi. Yongera acurisha ibigwanisho vyinshi n’inkinzo nyinshi.<verse eid="2CH 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 32:6" />Ashinga abakuru b’ingabo bo kurongora abantu, aca arabakoranya imbere yiwe i ruhande y’irembo ry’igisagara, maze abatera intege muri aya majambo ati: <verse eid="2CH 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 32:7" />“Mukomere kandi mureme. Ntimutinye canke ngo mwihebure kubera umwami w’i Ashuri n’ingabo nyinshi ziri kumwe na we; kuko hari ubushobozi bwinshi buri kumwe natwe kuruta uburi kumwe na we. <verse eid="2CH 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 32:8" />We yishimikije inkomezi z’umuntu w’inyama n’amaraso, ariko tweho turi kumwe n’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu ngo itugwanire intambara.” Maze abantu bararema kubw’amajambo Hezekiya umwami w’i Buyuda avuze.<verse eid="2CH 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 32:9" />Hanyuma y’ivyo, igihe Senakeribu umwami w’i Ashuri n’ingabo ziwe zose bari bugarije i Lakishi, yaciye arungika abaganwa biwe i Yerusalemu, abarungikana ubutumwa kwa Hezekiya umwami w’i Buyuda n’abantu bose b’i Buyuda bari aho, ati:<verse eid="2CH 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 32:10" />“Uku ni ko Senakeribu umwami w’i Ashuri avuze: ngo mbega mwishimirije iki cotuma muguma i Yerusalemu kandi hugarijwe? <verse eid="2CH 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 32:11" />Iyo Hezekiya ababwiye ngo: ‘<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu iradukiza idukure mu kuboko kw’umwami w’i Ashuri,’ aba ariko arabahenda, kugira ngo mwicwe n’inzara n’inyota. <verse eid="2CH 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 32:12" />Mbega Hezekiya ubwiwe si we yakuyeho ibicaniro vyo ku misozi n’ibindi bicaniro vyose vy’imana, akabwira Abayuda n’ab’i Yerusalemu ati: ‘Muzohora musengera imbere y’igicaniro kimwe kandi ni co muzoturirirako ibimazi’?<verse eid="2CH 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 32:13" />Mbega ntimuzi ivyo twe na ba sogokuruza banje twakoreye abantu bose bo mu yandi mahanga? Mbega imana z’ayo mahanga hari aho zigeze zishobora kuyakiza ngo zikure igihugu cayo mu kuboko kwanje? <verse eid="2CH 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 32:14" />Mbega mu mana zose z’ayo mahanga ba data basanganguye, ni izihe zashoboye gukiza abantu bazo ukuboko kwanje? None imana yanyu yobakiza gute mu maboko yanje? <verse eid="2CH 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 32:15" />Nuko ntimwemere ko Hezekiya abahenda canke ngo abazimize kugeza hiyo. Ntimwemere ivyo ababwira, kuko ata mana y’ihanga na rimwe canke y’ubwami na bumwe yashoboye gukiza abantu bayo ngo ibakure mu kuboko kwanje canke kwa ba sogokuruza bacu. Mbega ibi ntibirushirije kubereka ko imana yanyu itazoshobora kubakura mu kuboko kwanje?”<verse eid="2CH 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 32:16" />Maze izo ntumwa za Senakeribu zivuga n’ibindi vyinshi vyo gucokora <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana n’umusavyi wayo Hezekiya. <verse eid="2CH 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 32:17" />Uwo mwami yandika n’ayandi amakete yo gutuka <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana y’Abisirayeli; mu kuyicokora yongera avuga ngo: “Nk’uko imana z’ayandi mahanga zitashoboye gutabara abantu bazo ngo zibakure mu kuboko kwanje, ni ko n’imana ya Hezekiya itazokiza iri hanga mu kuboko kwanje.” <verse eid="2CH 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 32:18" />Nuko bahamagara abantu b’i Yerusalemu bari ku ruzitiro, bababwira mu Giheburayo kugira ngo babace ivutu, maze babone gufata igisagara. <verse eid="2CH 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 32:19" />Bavuga Imana y’i Yerusalemu bayigereranya n’imana z’ayandi mahanga yo mw’isi, zakozwe n’intoke z’abantu.<verse eid="2CH 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 32:20" />Umwami Hezekiya n’uwavugishwa n’Imana Yesaya mwene Amozi barasemerera, basenga barangamije mw’ijuru ku bw’ivyo. <verse eid="2CH 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 32:21" />Nuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> arungika umumarayika, yica ingabo z’abahizi bose, harimwo n’intwazangabo nkurunkuru, abasanze aho umwami w’Abashuri yari acumbitse. Maze wa mwami w’Abashuri aca asubira inyuma mu gihugu ciwe ateterewe. Umusi umwe agiye mu ngoro y’imana yiwe, bamwe mu bahungu biwe bamucumita inkota arapfa.<verse eid="2CH 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 32:22" />Uko ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yatabaye Hezekiya n’abantu b’i Yerusalemu, abakiza ukuboko kwa Senakeribu umwami w’i Ashuri n’ukuboko kw’abandi bansi; abarinda impande zose. <verse eid="2CH 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 32:23" />Benshi bazanira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ibimazi i Yerusalemu n’amashikanwa y’agaciro, bayazanira Hezekiya umwami w’i Buyuda. Kuva ico gihe amahanga yose aca aramutinya.<verse eid="2CH 32:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubwibone bwa Hezekiya, ivyo yakoze, n’urupfu rwiwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 32:24" />Muri iyo misi Hezekiya aragwara ashika ku mpfiro. Asenga <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, na we aramwishura, amuha ikimenyetso c’igitangaza. <verse eid="2CH 32:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 32:25" />Ariko umutima wa Hezekiya wari wuzuye ubwibone bituma atamenya ubuntu yagiriwe. Nuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> arakira Hezekiya, arakira Abayuda n’ab’i Yerusalemu bose. <verse eid="2CH 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 32:26" />Mu nyuma Hezekiya yihana ubwibone bwo mu mutima wiwe, n’ab’i Yerusalemu; ivyo bituma uburake bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bubavako, ntiyasubira kubarakira mu misi yose Hezekiya yabayeho.<verse eid="2CH 32:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 32:27" />Hezekiya yari afise ubutunzi bwinshi n’icubahiro, kandi yari yaraziganije ifeza n’inzahabu n’amabuye y’igiciro, n’ibimota neza, inkinzo n’ibindi bintu vy’igiciro kinini. <verse eid="2CH 32:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 32:28" />Yubaka kandi amazu yo kwimburiramwo ingano, imivinyu n’amavuta; yubaka n’impongore z’amasho y’ubwoko bwose, n’iz’imikuku y’intama n’impene. <verse eid="2CH 32:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 32:29" />Yubaka ibigwati yironkera ibitigiri binini vy’imikuku n’amasho, kuko Imana yari yamuhaye ubutunzi bwinshi cane.<verse eid="2CH 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 32:30" />Hezekiya ni we yagomeye amazi y’umugezi wa Gihoni aca ashiraho umuringoti w’amazi uyajana, uciye mu burengero bw’Igisagara ca Dawidi. Ivyo yipfuza gukora vyose yarabishikako. <verse eid="2CH 32:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 32:31" />Ariko igihe intumwa zatumwa kuri we zivuye ku baganza i Babiloni ngo bamubaze ivyerekeye ibitangaza vyari vyabaye mu gihugu, Imana iramureka kugira ngo imugeze imenye ivyari mu mutima wiwe vyose.<verse eid="2CH 32:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 32:32" />Ibindi vyose vyabaye ku ngoma ya Hezekiya n’ibikorwa vyiwe vy’ubwizigirwa, vyanditswe mu vyo uwavugishwa n’Imana Yesaya mwene Amozi yeretswe, biri mu gitabu c’abami b’i Buyuda n’abo muri Isirayeli. <verse eid="2CH 32:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 32:33" />Nuko Hezekiya ahamvya ba sekuruza, bamuhamba ku gasozi ahari itongo bahambamwo abo mu ruvyaro rwa Dawidi. Amaze gupfa, Abayuda bose n’ab’i Yerusalemu bamuha icubahiro. Maze Manase umuhungu wiwe amusubirira ku ngoma.<verse eid="2CH 32:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="2CH 33" />
  <para style="s1">Manase aba umwami w’i Buyuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 33:1" />Manase yabaye umwami afise imyaka cumi n’ibiri, aganza imyaka mirongo itanu n’itanu ari i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 33:2" />Manase akora ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abona ko ari bibi mu nyonga ziwe, agendera mu bizira vy’ubuyobe vyakorwa n’amahanga <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yarirukanye imbere y’Abisirayeli. <verse eid="2CH 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 33:3" />Asubira kwubaka ibibanza vyo gusengeramwo, ku mataba y’imisozi, ivyo se Hezekiya yari yarasambuye; yongera kwubaka ibicaniro vya Bayali, ashinga n’inkingi za Ashera. Yunamira ibinyenyeri vyose vyo kw’ijuru arabisenga. <verse eid="2CH 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 33:4" />Yubaka ibicaniro mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, iyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yaravuzeko ati: “Izina ryanje rizoba i Yerusalemu ibihe vyose.” <verse eid="2CH 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 33:5" />Mu rugo rwose rw’Ingoro y’Uhoraho ahubaka ibicaniro vy’ibinyenyeri vyose vyo kw’ijuru. <verse eid="2CH 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 33:6" />Agera n’aho atanga abahungu biwe kw’ibimazi vyo guturirwa mu kiyaya ca Beni-Hinomu, agendera mu bupfumu n’amareba, akoresha abahamagara imizimu na ba kamenyi. Akora ibibi vyinshi mu nyonga z’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, bimutera kuraka.<verse eid="2CH 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 33:7" />Afata inkingi ya Ashera yabazishije, ayishira mu Ngoro, imwe Imana yari yabwiye Dawidi n’umuhungu wiwe Salomo iti: “Muri iyi Ngoro n’i Yerusalemu ni ho natoranije mu yindi miryango yose ya Isirayeli, ngo hitirirwe izina ryanje ibihe vyose. <verse eid="2CH 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 33:8" />Sinzosubira gutuma Abisirayeli bakura ikirenge hasi ngo bave mu gihugu nahaye ba sekuruza, nibitwararika gukora ivyo nabategetse vyose, bagakurikiza ivyagezwe vyanje vyose, amabwirizwa n’amategeko nabahaye ncishije ku musavyi wanje Mose.” <verse eid="2CH 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 33:9" />Ariko Manase azimiza Abayuda n’ab’i Yerusalemu bose, bituma bakora ibibi birengeye ivy’amahanga <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yarahonereje imbere y’Abisirayeli.<verse eid="2CH 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 33:10" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aburira Manase n’abantu biwe, ariko ntibavyitaho. <verse eid="2CH 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 33:11" />Nuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abateza abakuru b’ingabo z’umwami w’i Ashuri, bafata Manase bamugira imbohe, bacisha igera mu zuru ryiwe, bamubohesha iminyororo y’ubutare bw’umwakaka, maze bamujana i Babiloni. <verse eid="2CH 33:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 33:12" />Abonye ko ari mu mubabaro mwinshi, arondera <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yiwe, yicisha bugufi cane imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya ba sekuruza. <verse eid="2CH 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 33:13" />Atakambiye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, na we aterwa n’akagongwe yumva ugutakamba kwiwe; maze amugarukana i Yerusalemu no mu bwami bwiwe. Nuko Manase amenya ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari Imana.<verse eid="2CH 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 33:14" />Inyuma y’ivyo aca yubaka uruzitiro rw’inyuma y’Igisagara ca Dawidi, mu burengero bw’umugezi Gihoni mu kiyaya, gushika kw’Irembo ry’Amafi, no kuzunguruka umusozi wa Ofeli; arongera arugira rurerure cane. Ashiraho abatwara ingabo mu bisagara vyose bizitijwe inzitiro vy’i Buyuda.<verse eid="2CH 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 33:15" />Akuraho imana z’abanyamahanga, akuraho na ca gishushanyo mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, n’ibicaniro vyose yari yarubatse ku musozi w’Ingoro n’i Yerusalemu; abiterera inyuma y’igisagara. <verse eid="2CH 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 33:16" />Hanyuma asana igicaniro c’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> agitangirako ibimazi vy’ishimwe n’ibimazi vyo gukenguruka, aca abwira Abayuda ngo bakorere <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana y’Abisirayeli. <verse eid="2CH 33:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 33:17" />Ariko abantu bakomeza gutangira ibimazi ku bicaniro vyo ku mataba y’imisozi, mugabo babishikanira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yabo gusa.<verse eid="2CH 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 33:18" />Ibindi vyabaye ku ngoma ya Manase, harimwo n’isengesho yasenze Imana yiwe, amajambo aberekwa bamubwiye mw’izina ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana y’Abisirayeli, vyanditswe mu bitabu bidonda ivyagenda biraba ku ngoma z’abami b’Abisirayeli. <verse eid="2CH 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 33:19" />Isengesho ryiwe n’uburyo Imana yamugiriye ikigongwe kubera gutakamba kwiwe hamwe n’ibibi vyose yakoze, n’uguta ubwizigirwa, n’ahantu hose yubatse ibibanza vyo gusengeramwo ku misozi, akongera agashiramwo inkingi za Ashera n’ibigirwamana yunamira, vyose vyanditswe mu bitabu vy’aberekwa. <verse eid="2CH 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 33:20" />Nuko Manase arapfa; ahamvya ba sekuruza ahambwa ku kirimba iwe. Amoni umuhungu wiwe amusubirira ku ngoma.<verse eid="2CH 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amoni umwami w’i Buyuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 33:21" />Amoni yari afise imyaka mirongo ibiri n’ibiri igihe yimikwa ngo abe umwami, aca aganza imyaka ibiri ari i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 33:22" />Akora ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abona ko ari bibi mu nyonga ziwe, nk’uko se Manase yakoze. Amoni asenga kandi atanga ibimazi ku bigirwamana Manase yari yaracurishije. <verse eid="2CH 33:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 33:23" />Ariko ntiyicisha bugufi imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> nk’uko se Manase yakoze; Amoni arushaho gukora ibibi.<verse eid="2CH 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 33:24" />Nuko abaganwa biwe baja inama yo kumugirira nabi, maze bamugandagurira mu ngoro iwe. <verse eid="2CH 33:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 33:25" />Ariko abantu bo muri ico gihugu baca bafata abishe umwami Amoni barabica, bimika Yosiya umuhungu wiwe, aba ari we amusubirira ku ngoma.<verse eid="2CH 33:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="2CH 34" />
  <para style="s1">Ivyo Yosiya yahinduye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 34:1" />Yosiya yari afise imyaka umunani igihe yaba umwami, aca aganza imyaka mirongo itatu n’umwe ari i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 34:2" />Akora ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abona ko ari vyiza mu nyonga ziwe; agendera mu nzira za sekuruza Dawidi, ntiyahengamira i buryo canke i bubamfu.<verse eid="2CH 34:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 34:3" />Mu mwaka ugira umunani ari ku ngoma, mu gihe yari akiri muto, atangura kurondera Imana ya sekuruza Dawidi. Mu mwaka ugira cumi na kabiri atangura guhumanura i Buyuda n’i Yerusalemu, akuraho ibicaniro vyo hejuru ku mataba y’imisozi, akuraho inkingi za Ashera, akuraho n’ibishushanyo bibajwe n’ibicuzwe. <verse eid="2CH 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 34:4" />Ategeka ko basenyurira hasi ibicaniro vya Bayali; abomora ibicaniro baturirirako ibimota neza vyari hejuru kuri ivyo bigirwamana, asenyura n’inkingi za Ashera, ibigirwamana n’ibishushanyo. Ivyo yarabijanjaguye bicika umukungugu, aca awusuka ku mva z’ababishikaniye ibimazi; <verse eid="2CH 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 34:5" />yongera aturirira amagufa y’abaherezi ku bicaniro vyabo. Uko ni ko yahumanuye Ubuyuda n’i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 34:6" />Mu bisagara vy’Abamanase, Abefurayimu n’Abasimeyoni gushika mu Banafutali, no mu misaka yose yari ihakikije, <verse eid="2CH 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 34:7" />ahomvorera hasi ibicaniro n’inkingi za Ashera, amenagura n’ibigirwamana bicika umukungugu, asenyagurira hasi ibicaniro baturirirako ibimota neza mu gihugu cose ca Isirayeli, aca asubira i Yerusalemu.<verse eid="2CH 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 34:8" />Mu mwaka ugira cumi n’umunani umwami Yosiya ari ku ngoma, mu guhumanura igihugu n’Ingoro, arungika Shafani mwene Azaliya na Mayaseya umukuru w’igisagara, hamwe na Yowa mwene Yowahazi, umwanditsi, ngo basanure Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yiwe.<verse eid="2CH 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 34:9" />Baja kwa Hilukiya umuherezi mukuru bamuha amahera yari yazanywe mu Ngoro y’Imana, ayo Abalewi bari bajejwe kurinda amarembo bari baregeranije mu bantu bava mu miryango y’Abamanase n’Abefurayimu, mu masigarira yose y’Abisirayeli, mu bantu bose b’i Buyuda, mu muryango w’Ababenyamini no mu baba i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 34:10" />Na bo bayahereza abantu bagenewe gukurikirana ico gikorwa c’Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Abo bantu bahemba abakora ibikorwa vyo gusanura no gusubiramwo ingoro. <verse eid="2CH 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 34:11" />Baha amahera ababaji n’abubatsi ngo bagure amabuye abajwe, n’imbaho zo kubarata hejuru, mu gusanura inyubakwa abami b’i Buyuda bari bararetse zikaba imisaka.<verse eid="2CH 34:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 34:12" />Abo bantu bakora igikorwa mu bwizigirwa. Yahati na Obadiya, Abalewi bava mu Bamerari, hamwe na Zakariya na Meshulamu, bava mu Bakohati, ni bo bari barongoye abandi. Mu Balewi, abari bafise ubuhinga bwo kuvuza ibicurarangisho, <verse eid="2CH 34:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 34:13" />ni bo bari bajejwe abakozi, bagakurikirana abakozi bose bari mu bikorwa bitandukanye. Bamwe bo mu Balewi bari abanyamabanga, abanditsi n’abarinzi b’amarembo.<verse eid="2CH 34:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Batora Igitabu c’ivyagezwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 34:14" />Bakiriko barasohora amahera yari yazanywe mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Hilukiya umuherezi arenguka ku gitabu c’ivyagezwe vy’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> vyahawe Abisirayeli biciye kuri Mose. <verse eid="2CH 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 34:15" />Hilukiya abwira Shafani umwanditsi ati: “Ndatoye Igitabu c’Ivyagezwe mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.” Aca agiha Shafani.<verse eid="2CH 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 34:16" />Maze Shafani ashira ico gitabu umwami aca amubwira ati: “Abasavyi bawe bariko barakora ivyo basabwe gukora vyose. <verse eid="2CH 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 34:17" />Barakiriye amahera yari mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bayazeza abashinzwe gukurikirana abakozi.” <verse eid="2CH 34:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 34:18" />Nuko Shafani umwanditsi arongera abwira umwami ati: “Hilukiya umuherezi yampaye igitabu.” Maze Shafani agisomera imbere y’umwami.<verse eid="2CH 34:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 34:19" />Umwami yumvise amajambo ari mu Vyagezwe, yitabagurirako impuzu. <verse eid="2CH 34:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 34:20" />Aca ategeka Hilukiya, Ahikamu mwene Shafani, Abudoni mwene Mika, Shafani umunyamabanga w’umwami na Asaya umukozi w’umwami, ati: <verse eid="2CH 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 34:21" />“Nimugende munsigurize <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, jewe n’amasigarira ari muri Isirayeli n’i Buyuda, ku vyerekeye ivyanditswe muri iki gitabu catowe. Uburake bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bwasutswe kuri twebwe burateye ubwoba kuko ba sogokuruza batitondeye ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ngo bakore ibihwanye n’ivyanditswe muri iki gitabu.”<verse eid="2CH 34:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 34:22" />Hilukiya n’abo umwami yari yarungitse baja kuvugana na Hulida umuvugishwa, yari umugore wa Shalumu mwene Tokati, Tokati mwene Hasira uwari ajejwe imyambaro. Uwo Hulida yaba i Yerusalemu, mu gice gishasha c’igisagara.<verse eid="2CH 34:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 34:23" />Na we ababwira ati: “Uku ni ko Uhoraho Imana ya Isirayeli avuze: Nimugende mubwire uwabantumyeko muti: <verse eid="2CH 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 34:24" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze: ‘Ngiye guteza icago aha hantu n’abantu baho, mu gushitsa imivumo yose yanditswe muri ico gitabu casomewe imbere y’umwami w’i Buyuda. <verse eid="2CH 34:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 34:25" />Kuko bantaye, bagaturirira ibimota neza izindi mana, bakandakisha izo nyene amaboko yabo yakoze, uburake bwanje buzosukwa aha hantu, kandi nta kizobuhwamika.’ <verse eid="2CH 34:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 34:26" />Nimugende mubwire umwami w’i Buyuda yabatumye kumusiguriza Uhoraho, muti: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya Isirayeli avuze ku vyerekeye amajambo wumvise: <verse eid="2CH 34:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 34:27" />Ko umutima wawe wakozweko, ukicisha bugufi imbere y’Imana ucumva amajambo yavuze kuri aha hantu no ku bantu baho, kandi ko wicishije bugufi imbere yanje ukitabagurirako impuzu, ukaririra imbere yanje; nanje nakwumvise, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze. <verse eid="2CH 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 34:28" />None rero nzoguha kwitahira amahoro uhamvye ba sogokuruza bawe. Amaso yawe ntazobona ivyago vyose ngiye guteza aha hantu n’abantu bose bahaba.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 34:28">Nuko bashira umwami iyo nyishu abahaye.<verse eid="2CH 34:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 34:29" />Maze umwami akoranya abakuru bose b’i Buyuda n’i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 34:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 34:30" />Adugana ku Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> n’abantu bose b’i Buyuda, ababa i Yerusalemu, abaherezi n’Abalewi, n’abantu bose uhereye ku mukuru ugashitsa ku muto. Abasomera amajambo yo muri ca Gitabu c’Isezerano, cari catowe mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="2CH 34:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 34:31" />Umwami ahagarara mu kibanza ciwe, asubizaho isezerano imbere y’Uhoraho ko agiye kwubaha <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> no gukurikiza amabwirizwa, amategeko hamwe n’ivyagezwe vyiwe, akabikora n’umutima wiwe wose n’umushaha wiwe wose, mu gushitsa ivyanditswe muri ico gitabu.<verse eid="2CH 34:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 34:32" />Asaba abantu bose b’i Yerusalemu n’Ababenyamini kwiyemeza gushira mu ngiro iryo sezerano. Maze ab’i Yerusalemu bakora bisunze iryo sezerano ry’Imana ya ba sekuruza.<verse eid="2CH 34:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 34:33" />Yosiya akuraho ibigirwamana vy’ubuyobe vyose mu ntara yitirirwa Abisirayeli, ategeka abari mu Bwisirayeli ngo bakorere <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yabo. Mu gihe cose yari akiriho, ntibigeze bareka gukurikira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana ya ba sekuruza babo.<verse eid="2CH 34:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="2CH 35" />
  <para style="s1">Yosiya ahimbaza Pasika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 35:1" />Yosiya ahimbariza Pasika y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> i Yerusalemu, kandi babaga umwagazi wa Pasika ku musi ugira icumi na kane w’ukwezi kwa mbere. <verse eid="2CH 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 35:2" />Ashira abaherezi mu bikorwa vyabo kandi abatera intege ngo bakore igikorwa c’Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="2CH 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 35:3" />Abwira Abalewi, ari bo bajejwe kwigisha Abisirayeli kandi barobanuriwe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ati: “Nimushire ya Sandugu Yera mu Ngoro Salomo mwene Dawidi umwami w’Abisirayeli yubaka. Ntimuzosubira kuyitwara ku bitugu vyanyu. Ubu rero nimukorere <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu n’abantu biwe b’Abisirayeli. <verse eid="2CH 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 35:4" />Nimwitegure nk’uko imiryango yanyu iri mu mice yanyu, nk’uko mwabitegetswe na Dawidi umwami w’Abisirayeli n’umuhungu wiwe Salomo.<verse eid="2CH 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 35:5" />Muhagarare Ahera muri kumwe n’Abalewi bavuye mu bice vyose vyo mu miryango yose ya benewanyu musangiye igihugu, hamwe n’abantu bose. <verse eid="2CH 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 35:6" />Mubage imyagazi ya Pasika, mwihumanure, maze mutegurire iyo myagazi bagenzi banyu b’Abisirayeli; mukore nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabitegetse abicishije kuri Mose.”<verse eid="2CH 35:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 35:7" />Yosiya ategurira abantu bose bari aho intama n’impene ibihumbi mirongo itatu vy’ibimazi vya Pasika, n’inka ibihumbi bitatu, ivyo vyose vyavuye mu butunzi bw’umwami.<verse eid="2CH 35:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 35:8" />N’abaganwa biwe na bo bazana ivyo guterera abantu bari ngaho n’abaherezi n’Abalewi. Hilikiya, Zakariya na Yehiyeli, abajejwe gukurikirana ivy’Ingoro y’Imana, baha abaherezi ibimazi vya Pasika ibihumbi bibiri n’amajana atandatu vy’imyagazi y’intama n’impene hamwe n’inka amajana atatu. <verse eid="2CH 35:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 35:9" />Kandi na Konaniya hamwe na Shemaya na Netaneli, abavukana na we, na Hashabiya, Yeyiyeli na Yozabadi, abakuru b’Abalewi, baha Abalewi ibimazi vya Pasika ibihumbi bitanu n’inka amajana atanu.<verse eid="2CH 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 35:10" />Ico gikorwa kirategurwa, maze abaherezi bahagarara mu bibanza vyabo bari kumwe n’Abalewi, na bo bigabuye mu mice yabo nk’uko umwami yari yabitegetse. <verse eid="2CH 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 35:11" />Bakerera imyagazi ya Pasika, maze abaherezi baca bamijagira ku gicaniro amaraso bahawe n’Abalewi; Abalewi na bo baca bakora igikorwa co kuyikurako insato. <verse eid="2CH 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 35:12" />Batoranya ibimazi vyo guturirwa babishira i ruhande ngo babihe imigwi y’imiryango y’abantu; ngo na bo babishikanire <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, nk’uko vyanditswe mu gitabu ca Mose. Babigenza gutyo no ku nka. <verse eid="2CH 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 35:13" />Botsa inyama za ya myagazi ya Pasika ku muriro nk’uko bitegekanijwe, baca bateka vya bimazi vyera mu nkono z’ibumba, no mu nkono zo gushusha amazi, eka no mu masafuriya, baca babigaburira abantu bose banyarutsa. <verse eid="2CH 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 35:14" />Inyuma y’ivyo, baca bategura ivyabo n’ivy’abaherezi, kuko abaherezi bakomoka kuri Aroni, bariko baratanga ibimazi vyo guturirwa n’umuriro n’ibinure gushika bwije. Ni co gituma Abalewi bateguye ivyabo n’ivy’abaherezi bene Aroni.<verse eid="2CH 35:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 35:15" />Abacuraranzi bakomoka kuri Asafu bari mu bibanza vyabo nk’uko vyashinzwe na Dawidi, Asafu, Hemani na Yedutuni uwerekwa w’umwami. Abarinzi bo ku marembo yose ntibarinda guhagarika igikorwa cabo, kuko Abalewi benewabo bari babateguriye ivyabo.<verse eid="2CH 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 35:16" />Nuko muri ico gihe igikorwa cose c’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> kirakorwa kugira ngo bahimbaze Pasika, batange n’ibimazi vyo guturirwa ku gicaniro c’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, nk’uko umwami Yosiya yari yabitegetse. <verse eid="2CH 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 35:17" />Muri ico gihe, Abisirayeli bari ngaho bahimbaza Pasika, barongera bamara iyindi misi indwi bahimbaza umusi mukuru w’imikate itarimwo umwambiro. <verse eid="2CH 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 35:18" />Ntihari bwigere hahimbazwa umusi mukuru wa Pasika nk’uwo mu Bisirayeli, uhereye mu gihe c’uwavugishwa n’Imana Samweli. Kandi nta n’umwe wo mu bami b’Abisirayeli yari bwahimbaze Pasika nk’uko Yosiya yayihimbaje, ari kumwe n’abaherezi, Abalewi n’Abayuda n’Abisirayeli bose, bari kumwe n’abantu b’i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 35:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 35:19" />Iyo Pasika yahimbajwe mu mwaka ugira cumi n’umunani Yosiya ari ku ngoma.<verse eid="2CH 35:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Urupfu rwa Yosiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 35:20" />Inyuma y’ivyo, Yosiya amaze gutunganya neza ivyo mu Ngoro, Neko umwami wa Egiputa araduga ngo atere i Karikemishi ku ruzi Efurate; maze Yosiya aja kumutegera ngo amugwanye. <verse eid="2CH 35:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 35:21" />Ariko Neko arungika intumwa kuri we, amubwira ati: “Hari intambara nki hagati yawe nanje ga yewe mwami w’Abayuda? Ubu si wewe nje gutera, ariko hari irindi hanga duhamana ni ryo mviriye hasi. Imana yambwiye ngo nihute; nuko rero reka kugwanya Imana, kuko iri kumwe nanje, kandi yokurandura.”<verse eid="2CH 35:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 35:22" />Yamara Yosiya ntiyahindukira ngo amureke, ahubwo ariyoberanya ngo amutere. Ntiyumvira ivyo Neko yamubwiye ategetswe n’Imana, ahubwo aja kumugwanya; baca bahurira mu kiyaya c’i Megido ari ho bagwaniye.<verse eid="2CH 35:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 35:23" />Abagwanisha imiheto barasa umwami Yosiya; aca abwira abakuru b’ingabo biwe ati: “Nimunkure hano kuko nkomeretse cane.” <verse eid="2CH 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 35:24" />Nuko bamukura mu mukogote wiwe, bamushira mu wundi mukogote yari afise bamujana i Yerusalemu, apfirayo. Bamuhamba mu mva za ba sekuruza, maze Abayuda bose n’ab’i Yerusalemu baramuririra.<verse eid="2CH 35:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 35:25" />Yeremiya yandika amajambo yo gucura intimba ku bwa Yosiya, kandi gushika n’ubu abagabo n’abagore b’abaririmvyi bose bama bibuka Yosiya mu gucura intimba. Ivyo vyabaye umugenzo mu Bisirayeli kandi vyanditswe mu ndirimbo zo gucura intimba.<verse eid="2CH 35:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 35:26" />Ibindi vyabaye ku ngoma ya Yosiya n’ibikorwa vyiwe vy’ubwizigirwa, nk’uko vyanditswe mu Vyagezwe vy’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> <verse eid="2CH 35:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 35:27" />ivyabaye vyose, kuva ku ntango gushika kw’iherezo, vyanditswe mu gitabu c’abami b’Abisirayeli n’Abayuda.<verse eid="2CH 35:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="2CH 36" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 36:1" />Maze abantu bo muri ico gihugu bafata Yehowahazi mwene Yosiya bamwimika ngo abe umwami i Yerusalemu mu gishingo ca se.<verse eid="2CH 36:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yehowahazi umwami w’i Buyuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 36:2" />Yehowahazi yari afise imyaka mirongo ibiri n’itatu igihe yimikwa ngo abe umwami, aca aganza amezi atatu ari i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 36:3" />Umwami wa Egiputa amukura ku ngoma i Yerusalemu aca ategeka Abayuda ko batanga amashikanwa yo kwisaba angana n’italanto ijana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">36:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilo 3.750.</char></note> z’ifeza n’italanto imwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">36:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilo 34.</char></note> y’inzahabu. <verse eid="2CH 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 36:4" />Umwami wa Egiputa yimika Eliyakimu avukana na Yehowahazi, ngo abe umwami w’i Buyuda n’i Yerusalemu; ahindura izina ryiwe amwita Yehoyakimu. Ariko Neko atwara Yehowahazi umuvukanyi wa Eliyakimu amumanukana muri Egiputa.<verse eid="2CH 36:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yehoyakimu umwami w’i Buyuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 36:5" />Yehoyakimu yari afise imyaka mirongo ibiri n’itanu igihe yaba umwami, aganza imyaka cumi n’umwe ari i Yerusalemu, akora ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yiwe abona ko ari bibi mu nyonga ziwe. <verse eid="2CH 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 36:6" />Nebukadineza umwami w’i Babiloni aramutera amubohesha iminyororo y’umwakaka amujana i Babiloni. <verse eid="2CH 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 36:7" />Nebukadineza yongera atwara i Babiloni ibikoresho vyari mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abishira mu ngoro yiwe i Babiloni.<verse eid="2CH 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 36:8" />Ibindi vyabaye ku ngoma ya Yehoyakimu, ibibi vy’ubuyobe yakoze n’ivyamubayeko vyose, vyanditswe mu gitabu c’ivyabaye ku ngoma z’abami b’Abisirayeli n’Abayuda. Maze Yehoyakini umuhungu wiwe aba ari we amusubirira ku ngoma.<verse eid="2CH 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yehoyakini umwami w’i Buyuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 36:9" />Yehoyakini yari afise imyaka cumi n’umunani igihe yimikwa ngo abe umwami, aganza amezi atatu n’imisi cumi ari i Yerusalemu. Akora ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abona ko ari bibi mu nyonga ziwe. <verse eid="2CH 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 36:10" />Mu ntango z’umwaka, umwami Nebukadineza amutumako ngo bamuzane i Babiloni, hamwe n’ibikoresho vy’agaciro vyari mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, aca yimika Zedekiya sewabo wa Yehoyakini, ngo abe umwami w’i Buyuda n’i Yerusalemu.<verse eid="2CH 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Zedekiya umwami w’i Buyuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 36:11" />Zedekiya yari afise imyaka mirongo ibiri n’umwe igihe yaba umwami, aganza imyaka cumi n’umwe ari i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 36:12" />Akora ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yiwe abona ko ari bibi mu nyonga ziwe, kandi ntiyicisha bugufi imbere y’uwavugishwa n’Imana Yeremiya, yavuga ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="2CH 36:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 36:13" />Yongera agarariza umwami Nebukadineza, yari yaramurahije mw’izina ry’Imana. Yigira ntagondwa akomantaza umutima kandi ntiyahindukirira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana y’Abisirayeli. <verse eid="2CH 36:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 36:14" />Vyongeye, abakuru mu baherezi n’abantu bose barushaho gukora ibibi, bakurikira ivy’ubuyobe vy’ayandi mahanga mu guhumanya Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, iyo yari yaratoranije ngo ibe i Yerusalemu.<verse eid="2CH 36:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yerusalemu hasamburwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 36:15" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana ya ba sekuruza, abatumako intumwa nyinshi, kuko yari agiriye akagongwe abantu biwe n’Ingoro yiwe. <verse eid="2CH 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 36:16" />Ariko bakengera izo ntumwa, bakengera n’amajambo yiwe, bahindura agatwengo abavugishwa na we gushika aho uburake bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bwaziriringiye ku bantu biwe ku buryo ata wari kuba agishobora kubakiza. <verse eid="2CH 36:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 36:17" />Abateza umwami w’i Babiloni, na we yicisha inkota urwaruka rwabo, mbere no mu Ngoro abicirayo, ntiyasigaza n’umwe yaba umusore canke inkumi, uwukuze canke umutama. Imana ibatanga mu maboko ya Nebukadineza. <verse eid="2CH 36:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 36:18" />Atwara i Babiloni ibintu vyose vyo mu Ngoro y’Imana, binini na bito, n’ubutunzi bwose bwari mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> n’ubutunzi bw’umwami n’abaganwa biwe. <verse eid="2CH 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 36:19" />Baturira Ingoro y’Imana kandi basenyurira hasi uruzitiro rw’i Yerusalemu; baturira ibirimba vyose, basambura n’ikintu cose c’agaciro cariyo.<verse eid="2CH 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 36:20" />Abasigaye bacitse kw’icumu abajana nk’inyagano i Babiloni, baba abo kumukorera we n’abahungu biwe kugeza ubwami bw’Abaperesi bugiye ku ngoma. <verse eid="2CH 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 36:21" />Igihugu kiruhuka akaruhuko k’Isabato. Igihe cose camaze ari umusaka, cararuhutse, kugeza imyaka mirongo indwi iheze nk’uko ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryari ryaravugiye muri Yeremiya.<verse eid="2CH 36:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 36:22" />Mu mwaka wa mbere Kuro ari umwami w’Ubuperesi, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> kugira ngo ashitse ijambo yari yaravuze aciye kuri Yeremiya, akangura umutima wa Kuro umwami w’Ubuperesi na we atanga mu bwami bwiwe itegeko ryanditswe rivuga ngo:<verse eid="2CH 36:22" /></para>
  <para style="pmo">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 36:23" />“Ibi ni vyo Kuro umwami w’Ubuperesi avuze:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2CH 36:23">‘<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana yo mw’ijuru, yampaye ubwami bwose bwo mw’isi kandi yantoranije ngo ndamwubakire Ingoro i Yerusalemu i Buyuda. Umuntu wese wo mu bantu biwe ari muri mwebwe naduge, kandi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yiwe abane na we.’ ”<verse eid="2CH 36:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 36" />
</usx>